(1387947, 178271, 31443, '<td valign="top">Although opportunity was there you chose to keep your models dressed...extra points for that.  This stark b/w reminds a little of a family visit to Walt Disney World many years ago and seeing our images dispalyed on the wall forever but I like this nevertheless...</td>', 'Although opportunity was there you chose to keep your models dressed...extra points for that.  This stark b/w reminds a little of a family visit to Walt Disney World many years ago and seeing our images dispalyed on the wall forever but I like this nevertheless...', '2005-05-16 02:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387948, 178452, 36299, '<td valign="top">More detail in the background, perhaps exotic, like a lily would inhance this.  8</td>', 'More detail in the background, perhaps exotic, like a lily would inhance this.  8', '2005-05-16 02:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387949, 177348, 23394, '<td valign="top">so...what are you going to shoot when they take this away ;-)<br/>i hope this does well, just to reward your patience, and your good fortune for getting a sunset.</td>', 'so...what are you going to shoot when they take this away ;-)i hope this does well, just to reward your patience, and your good fortune for getting a sunset.', '2005-05-16 02:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387952, 178033, 36299, '<td valign="top">I like the detail in the shadows, keeping it just right. 10</td>', 'I like the detail in the shadows, keeping it just right. 10', '2005-05-16 02:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387953, 177956, 36324, '<td valign="top">Nice merge.</td>', 'Nice merge.', '2005-05-16 02:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387960, 178576, 36299, '<td valign="top">Excellent colours.  I feel a little sharper subject would be great. 9</td>', 'Excellent colours.  I feel a little sharper subject would be great. 9', '2005-05-16 02:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387965, 178003, 37103, '<td valign="top">Lovely sihouette, perfect for this challenge.</td>', 'Lovely sihouette, perfect for this challenge.', '2005-05-16 02:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387968, 177447, 36299, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot.  It is hard to pick out the subject though and is a bit noisy, the over all effect loses its balance, although the pillar does draw the eye.  Different lighting, perhaps more toward the evening. 5</td>', 'This is a good shot.  It is hard to pick out the subject though and is a bit noisy, the over all effect loses its balance, although the pillar does draw the eye.  Different lighting, perhaps more toward the evening. 5', '2005-05-16 02:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387970, 178496, 37252, '<td valign="top">I love it !! Great idea...great focus...excellent color, contrast and brightness.</td>', 'I love it !! Great idea...great focus...excellent color, contrast and brightness.', '2005-05-16 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387971, 177466, 36324, '<td valign="top">Really love th picture, but the frame is far to big and a distraction from an otherwise striking image.</td>', 'Really love th picture, but the frame is far to big and a distraction from an otherwise striking image.', '2005-05-16 02:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387973, 177956, 37252, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I like the way the sun appears to be held up by the phone wires. A little too dark for my personal liking, but that is just IMHO. 7<br/></td>', 'Good composition. I like the way the sun appears to be held up by the phone wires. A little too dark for my personal liking, but that is just IMHO. 7', '2005-05-16 02:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387976, 178553, 36299, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea.  I find the light a bit harsh, although it may be intended.  The light playing off the subject would work better if it was something it was holding, rather then itself.  There also seems to be some over smoothing as well.  On the other side of the coin, great control of the jaggies that can happen on curved surfaces when resizing. 7</td>', 'This is a great idea.  I find the light a bit harsh, although it may be intended.  The light playing off the subject would work better if it was something it was holding, rather then itself.  There also seems to be some over smoothing as well.  On the other side of the coin, great control of the jaggies that can happen on curved surfaces when resizing. 7', '2005-05-16 02:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387978, 178012, 36299, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  noise in the purples, violets cause issue.  The rest is great. 9</td>', 'nice shot.  noise in the purples, violets cause issue.  The rest is great. 9', '2005-05-16 02:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387979, 177703, 36324, '<td valign="top">This is near where I grew up. Very pretty. Man that water is cold.</td>', 'This is near where I grew up. Very pretty. Man that water is cold.', '2005-05-16 02:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387981, 178496, 36324, '<td valign="top">Simple, Elegant, nice color.</td>', 'Simple, Elegant, nice color.', '2005-05-16 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387982, 178572, 36299, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Love this.  The Sepia is great.  Detailing in the clouds works well. 10</td>', 'Nice capture.  Love this.  The Sepia is great.  Detailing in the clouds works well. 10', '2005-05-16 02:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387984, 176344, 36324, '<td valign="top">A little cluttered looking.  Sometimes less is more.</td>', 'A little cluttered looking.  Sometimes less is more.', '2005-05-16 02:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387988, 177660, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery but there is a terrible halo all around the subjects in the image,  strong usm the culprit perhaps...</td>', 'Nice scenery but there is a terrible halo all around the subjects in the image,  strong usm the culprit perhaps...', '2005-05-16 02:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1387989, 178228, 36299, '<td valign="top">Neat.  The subject is to small for me, and it is not really a silhouette per say.  Due, to its size it is hard to judge many things about this photo.  better cropping or being closer to the subject would work better for me.  Focus needs to be worked on so at least something is sharp.  The fog effect is a nice touch, the overall mood of the photo is great as well. 5</td>', 'Neat.  The subject is to small for me, and it is not really a silhouette per say.  Due, to its size it is hard to judge many things about this photo.  better cropping or being closer to the subject would work better for me.  Focus needs to be worked on so at least something is sharp.  The fog effect is a nice touch, the overall mood of the photo is great as well. 5', '2005-05-16 02:52:22.000000', NULL, 1);
