(1388348, 178558, 35044, '<td valign="top">gorgeous sky and hills.  I might have liked fraction more ground and space to the right, as trees a bit close to the border. A tight crop on windmill and hills might have been interesting.</td>', 'gorgeous sky and hills.  I might have liked fraction more ground and space to the right, as trees a bit close to the border. A tight crop on windmill and hills might have been interesting.', '2005-05-16 07:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
