(1388389, 178568, 24642, '<td valign="top">A very good title for this supreme composition.  All elements are working together and the use of slow shutter for the motion of the water and the cloth is brilliant.   The only thing I think could be done better is the female silhouette, there is a strange line from the chest to the neck that seems awkward.  -8</td>', 'A very good title for this supreme composition.  All elements are working together and the use of slow shutter for the motion of the water and the cloth is brilliant.   The only thing I think could be done better is the female silhouette, there is a strange line from the chest to the neck that seems awkward.  -8', '2005-05-16 08:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388390, 178572, 33379, '<td valign="top">wow, i really love the sky in this photo, great job!</td>', 'wow, i really love the sky in this photo, great job!', '2005-05-16 08:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
