(1388612, 178576, 5792, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhhh... the Peter Iredale. Nice to see people out and about taking pictures of Oregonian historic interest. Decent DOF for the lighting conditions. Overall a very good image. I''d recommend darkening black some to remove a slight hue in the black resulting from slight color overprocessing.</td>', 'Ahhhhhhh... the Peter Iredale. Nice to see people out and about taking pictures of Oregonian historic interest. Decent DOF for the lighting conditions. Overall a very good image. I''d recommend darkening black some to remove a slight hue in the black resulting from slight color overprocessing.', '2005-05-16 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
