(1388615, 178558, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well composed and the blues in mountains and clouds is outstanding. You will improve this image dramatically by cloning out the bright diagona streak across the sky. Done''t forget the part in the upper left corner.</td>', 'Well composed and the blues in mountains and clouds is outstanding. You will improve this image dramatically by cloning out the bright diagona streak across the sky. Done''t forget the part in the upper left corner.', '2005-05-16 11:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388617, 178496, 34659, '<td valign="top">The detail on the goblet is superb, but contrasts a little too much (IMHO) with the lesser crispness &amp; detail of the beta.  Fantastic idea &amp; very well done.  I would have scored it even higher if the fish''s silhouette had been a little clearer.  (I know that shooting fish is not exactly like "shooting them in a barrel", so it''s extremely difficult to attain as much clarity as you would out of the water.  And normally I don''t think I''d even notice that it was more out of focus, but the extraordinarily fine detail of the glass - especially the stem, and I think you may have edited the left side, as there''s a slight imperfection as the goblet begins to round from the stem -draws my eye to the lesser clarity of the beta.)  Sorry, this is a very long, drawn out compliment and humble suggestion - the image is outstanding!  (8)</td>', 'The detail on the goblet is superb, but contrasts a little too much (IMHO) with the lesser crispness & detail of the beta.  Fantastic idea & very well done.  I would have scored it even higher if the fish''s silhouette had been a little clearer.  (I know that shooting fish is not exactly like "shooting them in a barrel", so it''s extremely difficult to attain as much clarity as you would out of the water.  And normally I don''t think I''d even notice that it was more out of focus, but the extraordinarily fine detail of the glass - especially the stem, and I think you may have edited the left side, as there''s a slight imperfection as the goblet begins to round from the stem -draws my eye to the lesser clarity of the beta.)  Sorry, this is a very long, drawn out compliment and humble suggestion - the image is outstanding!  (8)', '2005-05-16 11:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388622, 176132, 30392, '<td valign="top">A bit too much blown out white imo, would have been better with some of the top cropped out</td>', 'A bit too much blown out white imo, would have been better with some of the top cropped out', '2005-05-16 11:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388624, 177952, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the dreamy colors &amp; quality you included.  A beautiful image.  One - albeit very slight - thing I noticed (IMHO) is that the reflections of the birds are both single straight lines.  I''m sure it''s just the angle/light/whatever, but their reflections on the water don''t seem to match their graceful curves.  It''s an extremely peaceful shot - no question about it.  Makes me feel calm &amp; sleepy.  (7)</td>', 'Love the dreamy colors & quality you included.  A beautiful image.  One - albeit very slight - thing I noticed (IMHO) is that the reflections of the birds are both single straight lines.  I''m sure it''s just the angle/light/whatever, but their reflections on the water don''t seem to match their graceful curves.  It''s an extremely peaceful shot - no question about it.  Makes me feel calm & sleepy.  (7)', '2005-05-16 11:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388625, 177723, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful concept and well composed image. It captures the intimacy of the moment beautifully.</td>', 'Wonderful concept and well composed image. It captures the intimacy of the moment beautifully.', '2005-05-16 11:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388627, 177465, 30392, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, very creative and simple, should do very well</td>', 'Excellent photo, very creative and simple, should do very well', '2005-05-16 11:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388630, 178246, 34659, '<td valign="top">Definitely made me smile (as I sang along with the word to the song)!  I never realized Barbie had such a pronounced forehead.  Great idea &amp; nicely done.  IMHO, I would have chosen a different background, as it is almost distracting from the subjects themselves.  Not sure whether it''s the placement or what, but something about it seemed a little \"off\" to me.  Sorry for the negative feedback, but like I said, I LOVE the idea (&amp; the song) and overall I think it''s a good pic.  (5)</td>', 'Definitely made me smile (as I sang along with the word to the song)!  I never realized Barbie had such a pronounced forehead.  Great idea & nicely done.  IMHO, I would have chosen a different background, as it is almost distracting from the subjects themselves.  Not sure whether it''s the placement or what, but something about it seemed a little \"off\" to me.  Sorry for the negative feedback, but like I said, I LOVE the idea (& the song) and overall I think it''s a good pic.  (5)', '2005-05-16 11:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388631, 178464, 30392, '<td valign="top">This is  a great shot, with a mysterious feel to it. The lighting is spot on</td>', 'This is  a great shot, with a mysterious feel to it. The lighting is spot on', '2005-05-16 11:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388634, 178245, 30392, '<td valign="top">Wow, amazing capture, fantastic light, my pick for a ribbon</td>', 'Wow, amazing capture, fantastic light, my pick for a ribbon', '2005-05-16 11:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
