(1388645, 176296, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful and moody image. Interesting color and use of noise reduction (NeatImage?) software. The clarity and framing with the trees is very well done.<br/> <br/>This would take some effort but you could make this a perfect shot by cleaning up the haloing around the silhouette of the building and trees. That task can be made very easy by first selecting black to include trees and building, reversing the selection and using the clone tool to remove the bright halo within the selection. Nothing will bleed over into the sihouette itself. You will not have to be as careful as you otherwise would have to be. Congrats on a great capture.</td>', 'This is a beautiful and moody image. Interesting color and use of noise reduction (NeatImage?) software. The clarity and framing with the trees is very well done. This would take some effort but you could make this a perfect shot by cleaning up the haloing around the silhouette of the building and trees. That task can be made very easy by first selecting black to include trees and building, reversing the selection and using the clone tool to remove the bright halo within the selection. Nothing will bleed over into the sihouette itself. You will not have to be as careful as you otherwise would have to be. Congrats on a great capture.', '2005-05-16 11:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388649, 176533, 35947, '<td valign="top">Wax on!  Wax off!  Nice shot!  Sky background colors are very nice!</td>', 'Wax on!  Wax off!  Nice shot!  Sky background colors are very nice!', '2005-05-16 12:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388650, 177952, 34247, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, but there are white "hazyness" right on top of the two primary silhouetted elements, suggestive of over processing through dodge/burn.</td>', 'Lovely composition, but there are white "hazyness" right on top of the two primary silhouetted elements, suggestive of over processing through dodge/burn.', '2005-05-16 12:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388655, 178207, 32997, '<td valign="top">having voted close to 4000 times since joining dp, this is my first 10 (yes i am pathetic..but..)..<br/>this shot speaks..of history... of humanity...composition, detail, the foot just entering the shadows, stark lighting, the silhouette isn''t just because it is a challenge, it allows this shot to represent more than this individual..Brilliant!!!</td>', 'having voted close to 4000 times since joining dp, this is my first 10 (yes i am pathetic..but..)..this shot speaks..of history... of humanity...composition, detail, the foot just entering the shadows, stark lighting, the silhouette isn''t just because it is a challenge, it allows this shot to represent more than this individual..Brilliant!!!', '2005-05-16 12:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388657, 178499, 5792, '<td valign="top">Obvious that most of the color is photographer generated, but it is a good effect and a nice image. You''ve done a good job. Because you have made the background so interesting through the use of color, I''d recommend moving the cross left to the 1st rule of thirds horizontal line for more dramatic photographic effect. The cross leaning inwards toward a bright center would have metaphoric significance as well.</td>', 'Obvious that most of the color is photographer generated, but it is a good effect and a nice image. You''ve done a good job. Because you have made the background so interesting through the use of color, I''d recommend moving the cross left to the 1st rule of thirds horizontal line for more dramatic photographic effect. The cross leaning inwards toward a bright center would have metaphoric significance as well.', '2005-05-16 12:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388658, 177999, 32997, '<td valign="top">Quite simply beautiful!!!</td>', 'Quite simply beautiful!!!', '2005-05-16 12:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388668, 177263, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed image captured at the perfect moment. Technical quality is top notch. I envy this capture and your ability to frame it just right. You have done this so much better than I did when I tried to capture something similar:<br/>//www.pbase.com/azleader/laarea<br/></td>', 'Beautifully composed image captured at the perfect moment. Technical quality is top notch. I envy this capture and your ability to frame it just right. You have done this so much better than I did when I tried to capture something similar://www.pbase.com/azleader/laarea', '2005-05-16 12:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388671, 178576, 20530, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful take on a sunset. Perfect timing, you caught the full range of colors from cool to warm.</td>', 'Wow! Beautiful take on a sunset. Perfect timing, you caught the full range of colors from cool to warm.', '2005-05-16 12:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
