(1388693, 178323, 20530, '<td valign="top">I love this image. So simple and elegant. It creates an optical illusion. When I look at the center it appears to pulsate.</td>', 'I love this image. So simple and elegant. It creates an optical illusion. When I look at the center it appears to pulsate.', '2005-05-16 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388696, 178456, 2764, '<td valign="top">sunsets rarely translate to photographs as vividy as they appeared.  the trick is to put something visually interesting in the forground.  your sunset is lovely but the trees and telephone poles silouetted are not. my guess is that your photo will be marked down for subject matter and not technical aspects.</td>', 'sunsets rarely translate to photographs as vividy as they appeared.  the trick is to put something visually interesting in the forground.  your sunset is lovely but the trees and telephone poles silouetted are not. my guess is that your photo will be marked down for subject matter and not technical aspects.', '2005-05-16 12:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388697, 178264, 20530, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. Very crisp. I especially like the diagonal lines.</td>', 'Lovely image. Very crisp. I especially like the diagonal lines.', '2005-05-16 12:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388698, 178356, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I like it a lot. You''ve created a nice mood with good colors and generally hight technical quality. I suppose you purposely generated the smoothed areas using your noise reduction software (NeatImage?). This borders on digital art, which is not a bad thing in my opinion but may be with other voters. As a photoartist taking full control of the image like you have done in this case, you must strive to make it perfect in every way.  The only place I''d recommend changes would be in the reflections of trees with fine detail in the water. The "lower" parts of the reflected trees in left center are a little too "fuzzy". It would be hard to correct, but worth the effort. But mostly the brighter detail on the rightmost part of the detail refelected in the lake needs to be "sharper" and better show the detail above.</td>', 'Interesting image. I like it a lot. You''ve created a nice mood with good colors and generally hight technical quality. I suppose you purposely generated the smoothed areas using your noise reduction software (NeatImage?). This borders on digital art, which is not a bad thing in my opinion but may be with other voters. As a photoartist taking full control of the image like you have done in this case, you must strive to make it perfect in every way.  The only place I''d recommend changes would be in the reflections of trees with fine detail in the water. The "lower" parts of the reflected trees in left center are a little too "fuzzy". It would be hard to correct, but worth the effort. But mostly the brighter detail on the rightmost part of the detail refelected in the lake needs to be "sharper" and better show the detail above.', '2005-05-16 12:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388699, 178530, 2764, '<td valign="top">iron the sheet.  i find the hands the most interesting part, perhaps the rest of the body should be more defined by stepping closer - you are on to a good idea, just needs some more work.</td>', 'iron the sheet.  i find the hands the most interesting part, perhaps the rest of the body should be more defined by stepping closer - you are on to a good idea, just needs some more work.', '2005-05-16 12:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388704, 175911, 35645, '<td valign="top">Interesting variation on the theme. I was expecting to see all black silhouettes and I''m pleased to see an infusion of color that still fits the challenge. This could possibly benefit from a tighter crop, maybe a little off the top &amp; bottom. You''ve captured beautiful texture and detail in the petals.</td>', 'Interesting variation on the theme. I was expecting to see all black silhouettes and I''m pleased to see an infusion of color that still fits the challenge. This could possibly benefit from a tighter crop, maybe a little off the top & bottom. You''ve captured beautiful texture and detail in the petals.', '2005-05-16 12:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388706, 176200, 35645, '<td valign="top">Timely take on the theme. I like the light saber. Wish I couls see a head in there somewhere. Right now it looks like the Headless Jedi.</td>', 'Timely take on the theme. I like the light saber. Wish I couls see a head in there somewhere. Right now it looks like the Headless Jedi.', '2005-05-16 12:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
