(1388712, 178255, 5792, '<td valign="top">A wonderful concept and great composition. Tones are terrific. You highlighted what nature provided at that moment which is the mark of a great photographer. Cloud detail is nothing less than stunning. The only part that is too for me is the fine detail on the beach is oversharpened, but that might just be me. In that case I would have split the amount of USM applied to the image and used a slightly lower USM amount on the beach itself than to the ocean and clouds above.</td>', 'A wonderful concept and great composition. Tones are terrific. You highlighted what nature provided at that moment which is the mark of a great photographer. Cloud detail is nothing less than stunning. The only part that is too for me is the fine detail on the beach is oversharpened, but that might just be me. In that case I would have split the amount of USM applied to the image and used a slightly lower USM amount on the beach itself than to the ocean and clouds above.', '2005-05-16 12:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388713, 177952, 37444, '<td valign="top">Wonderful emotions with this one.</td>', 'Wonderful emotions with this one.', '2005-05-16 12:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
