(1388728, 178496, 35645, '<td valign="top">I expect this will do quite well. Beautiful depth of color. Nice clean outline on the fish. Only nit I have to pick is the water level in the glass - don''t know if you could have filled it further to get rid of the line just under the rim, though. Fish probably would have splashed it out.</td>', 'I expect this will do quite well. Beautiful depth of color. Nice clean outline on the fish. Only nit I have to pick is the water level in the glass - don''t know if you could have filled it further to get rid of the line just under the rim, though. Fish probably would have splashed it out.', '2005-05-16 12:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388732, 178436, 35645, '<td valign="top">The lighting for this is awesome!! Colors are great, and it fits the challenge *perfectly*. 10.</td>', 'The lighting for this is awesome!! Colors are great, and it fits the challenge *perfectly*. 10.', '2005-05-16 12:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388739, 177466, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very nice transition form true silhouette to lit subject. (don''t know how else to say that) Very nice lighting. Good background color choice. I thought I didn''t like the border, but the more I look at it, the more I see that it works quite well with this photo.</td>', 'Very nice transition form true silhouette to lit subject. (don''t know how else to say that) Very nice lighting. Good background color choice. I thought I didn''t like the border, but the more I look at it, the more I see that it works quite well with this photo.', '2005-05-16 12:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388741, 178362, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very neat photo. Nice crisp duck. Beautiful textures in the water and smoke. I do notice a LOT of colors in the water. Oversaturation maybe?</td>', 'Very neat photo. Nice crisp duck. Beautiful textures in the water and smoke. I do notice a LOT of colors in the water. Oversaturation maybe?', '2005-05-16 12:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1388751, 176243, 37302, '<td valign="top">i have seen a lot of photos with people. but the lighting composition and style of this is original. technically shot well 10 !!!</td>', 'i have seen a lot of photos with people. but the lighting composition and style of this is original. technically shot well 10 !!!', '2005-05-16 12:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
