(1388756, 178532, 37302, '<td valign="top">i like the was you got this guy through the leaf (or at least it appear that way) ;)<br/>nice composition technically sound - on topic and original! 10</td>', 'i like the was you got this guy through the leaf (or at least it appear that way) ;)nice composition technically sound - on topic and original! 10', '2005-05-16 12:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
