(1388848, 177672, 18868, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!  very high impact image.  I really like how you''ve use a strong side light to strongly define the foreground figure.  It''s not very noticeable, but the hoop is casting a shadow upward, which is sort of un-natural.</td>', 'AWESOME!  very high impact image.  I really like how you''ve use a strong side light to strongly define the foreground figure.  It''s not very noticeable, but the hoop is casting a shadow upward, which is sort of un-natural.', '2005-05-16 13:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
