(1388890, 177700, 37149, '<td valign="top">you have the right idea here but there is FAR too much detail for this to be a silhouette... good try!</td>', 'you have the right idea here but there is FAR too much detail for this to be a silhouette... good try!', '2005-05-16 13:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
