(1389033, 177011, 22748, '<td valign="top">Really cool, bold image. Great simple combination of 3 colors and simplicity of design, goes well with the iPod style. I would imagine this in a magazine ad.</td>', 'Really cool, bold image. Great simple combination of 3 colors and simplicity of design, goes well with the iPod style. I would imagine this in a magazine ad.', '2005-05-16 14:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389042, 177503, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice setting - I love the contrast between the industrial, nature and residential. This looks very much like a place called The Gorge where I live in Victoria, B.C - and I always find it a dramatic place to shoot in the early morning and sunset. Good luck with this one.</td>', 'This is a really nice setting - I love the contrast between the industrial, nature and residential. This looks very much like a place called The Gorge where I live in Victoria, B.C - and I always find it a dramatic place to shoot in the early morning and sunset. Good luck with this one.', '2005-05-16 14:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389058, 178492, 16241, '<td valign="top">this is cool</td>', 'this is cool', '2005-05-16 14:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389068, 178492, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is my prediction for one of the three ribbons. It''s perfect in so many ways 10</td>', 'This is my prediction for one of the three ribbons. It''s perfect in so many ways 10', '2005-05-16 14:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389070, 178572, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a truly exciting and dramatic shot. I love the sepia-type tone to it - wonderful composition. Love the way the eye is led by the lines of the horses. Perfection 10 I''d predit this will be one of the three ribbons.</td>', 'This is a truly exciting and dramatic shot. I love the sepia-type tone to it - wonderful composition. Love the way the eye is led by the lines of the horses. Perfection 10 I''d predit this will be one of the three ribbons.', '2005-05-16 14:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389071, 178245, 15207, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t ribbon I''ll be so surprised. I love that this is more than just a silhouette - the backlighting is supurb. It almost looks like molten lava kicking up from behind. Wonderful action shot. I hope you decide to sell it to an agency or somethign when the contest is over. 10</td>', 'If this doesn''t ribbon I''ll be so surprised. I love that this is more than just a silhouette - the backlighting is supurb. It almost looks like molten lava kicking up from behind. Wonderful action shot. I hope you decide to sell it to an agency or somethign when the contest is over. 10', '2005-05-16 14:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
