(1389147, 178427, 29904, '<td valign="top">Nice color and shapes good focus and contrast.  I would have cloned out the pole on the tower, it is distracting, and would have cropped off the sides some.  It is a little busy for me.</td>', 'Nice color and shapes good focus and contrast.  I would have cloned out the pole on the tower, it is distracting, and would have cropped off the sides some.  It is a little busy for me.', '2005-05-16 15:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389167, 177942, 29904, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus/DOF, forms in the background.  I love the texture that the window screen makes in the left side of the window!  The only things I would change would be to clone out the water drops on the window above his head and maybe crop some off the right side so the window divider is not in the center of the shot, and to remove a bit of the distracting white in the lower right. - 9</td>', 'Beautiful focus/DOF, forms in the background.  I love the texture that the window screen makes in the left side of the window!  The only things I would change would be to clone out the water drops on the window above his head and maybe crop some off the right side so the window divider is not in the center of the shot, and to remove a bit of the distracting white in the lower right. - 9', '2005-05-16 15:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
