(1389199, 178222, 3032, '<td valign="top">Perhaps there is a way to hide that light behinde the poles of the fence? It draws the eye away from the tree. I like the light on the ground, the purplepink contrasts well with the blue. Nice subject for a silhouette, though the crop is a bit tight in the upper left.</td>', 'Perhaps there is a way to hide that light behinde the poles of the fence? It draws the eye away from the tree. I like the light on the ground, the purplepink contrasts well with the blue. Nice subject for a silhouette, though the crop is a bit tight in the upper left.', '2005-05-16 15:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
