(1389209, 178580, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, the lines of branches of  the tree are very strong and form an interesting pattern. The angle of the ground makes the lower part keep interest. The stone adds a feeling of place and serenity in combo with the tree. Very good.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, the lines of branches of  the tree are very strong and form an interesting pattern. The angle of the ground makes the lower part keep interest. The stone adds a feeling of place and serenity in combo with the tree. Very good.', '2005-05-16 15:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
