(1389212, 178534, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the steps of purple to white in the background. The silhouette of the mill is nice but  the trees are slightly distracting.</td>', 'I like the steps of purple to white in the background. The silhouette of the mill is nice but  the trees are slightly distracting.', '2005-05-16 15:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389213, 177348, 12962, '<td valign="top">One of my few tens.  I think this is the ''truest'' silhouette in the challenge (I could be wrong) with little help from adjusting shadows and levels.   But whatever, it''s beautiful and you had the patience to wait for that sun to hit the right spot - even the sun''s reflections on the other pods are perfect.  Very well thought of.  You probably had this in your head in a long time and were just waiting for the perfect opportunity to shoot and share.</td>', 'One of my few tens.  I think this is the ''truest'' silhouette in the challenge (I could be wrong) with little help from adjusting shadows and levels.   But whatever, it''s beautiful and you had the patience to wait for that sun to hit the right spot - even the sun''s reflections on the other pods are perfect.  Very well thought of.  You probably had this in your head in a long time and were just waiting for the perfect opportunity to shoot and share.', '2005-05-16 15:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
