(1389249, 176595, 12962, '<td valign="top">Really provocative.  Beautiful body and hint of a silhouette.</td>', 'Really provocative.  Beautiful body and hint of a silhouette.', '2005-05-16 15:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389250, 178507, 29904, '<td valign="top">Do you reallize this is an unusual weather effect called a sun pillar? It requires a certain shape of ice crystals in the atmosphere to reflect the light, right amount, right altitudes, right time...   I''ve noticed that a few sunset shots in this challenge have them to varying degrees.  Amazing that this was occuring for several people at about the same time.  <br/>As for the photo, I would like to see the horizon, it seems cut off.  You coulde probably bump up the contrast and saturation some to give it more color and increase the effect of the pillar.  Hope that helps, good luck!  :)</td>', 'Do you reallize this is an unusual weather effect called a sun pillar? It requires a certain shape of ice crystals in the atmosphere to reflect the light, right amount, right altitudes, right time...   I''ve noticed that a few sunset shots in this challenge have them to varying degrees.  Amazing that this was occuring for several people at about the same time.  As for the photo, I would like to see the horizon, it seems cut off.  You coulde probably bump up the contrast and saturation some to give it more color and increase the effect of the pillar.  Hope that helps, good luck!  :)', '2005-05-16 15:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389251, 177956, 32848, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally like wires in pictures where they can possibly be removed, but hey, this is certainly an exception.  Great idea, funny and well executed.  Good Luck!</td>', 'I don''t normally like wires in pictures where they can possibly be removed, but hey, this is certainly an exception.  Great idea, funny and well executed.  Good Luck!', '2005-05-16 15:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389256, 178342, 3032, '<td valign="top">Hmm, this is one of those scenes that I might prefer in B&amp;W (b&amp;w, sepia, other duo-quadtones). The color and complexity of the  pyramids draws the eye away from the people. With B&amp;W it is a little bit less so.<br/>Despite that I like the composition and moment. Just enough detail to see that they are a woman and man. The entry provides a good frame, altough it is bit high in relation to the human size. The architect should be hanged, no, make that guillotined. :)</td>', 'Hmm, this is one of those scenes that I might prefer in B&W (b&w, sepia, other duo-quadtones). The color and complexity of the  pyramids draws the eye away from the people. With B&W it is a little bit less so.Despite that I like the composition and moment. Just enough detail to see that they are a woman and man. The entry provides a good frame, altough it is bit high in relation to the human size. The architect should be hanged, no, make that guillotined. :)', '2005-05-16 15:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389257, 178563, 29904, '<td valign="top">Really nice!   Soft warm quiet.  Nice lines, forms, and composition.  Wonderful contrast!  there is a little spot in the lower left window that is a little distracting, but no big deal.</td>', 'Really nice!   Soft warm quiet.  Nice lines, forms, and composition.  Wonderful contrast!  there is a little spot in the lower left window that is a little distracting, but no big deal.', '2005-05-16 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
