(1389380, 178239, 19010, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting silhouettes in the challenge. I think I would have liked it better however if all of the leaves had been in focus. The ones at the top are getting a bit fuzzy. I tend tp like nice sharp edges in silhouettes. other than that one complaint, I like the shot.</td>', 'One of the more interesting silhouettes in the challenge. I think I would have liked it better however if all of the leaves had been in focus. The ones at the top are getting a bit fuzzy. I tend tp like nice sharp edges in silhouettes. other than that one complaint, I like the shot.', '2005-05-16 16:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389389, 177447, 19010, '<td valign="top">I can see to many details on this one to say its a true silhouette. Perhaps if the entire image was a bit darker it would work for me. I also feel that the colors are a bit drab and monotone. I would like to have seen a bit more vibrant colors to help this one pop a bit more. This is a great start and I feel that with a little time in photoshop. This could have been up there running with the high scoring ones.</td>', 'I can see to many details on this one to say its a true silhouette. Perhaps if the entire image was a bit darker it would work for me. I also feel that the colors are a bit drab and monotone. I would like to have seen a bit more vibrant colors to help this one pop a bit more. This is a great start and I feel that with a little time in photoshop. This could have been up there running with the high scoring ones.', '2005-05-16 16:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389391, 178572, 19010, '<td valign="top">Absolutaly wonderfull!! Great pose on the horse. strong outlines on the silhouette.  Very contrasty and bright colorfull and interesting sky. I couldn''t ask for more!! 10</td>', 'Absolutaly wonderfull!! Great pose on the horse. strong outlines on the silhouette.  Very contrasty and bright colorfull and interesting sky. I couldn''t ask for more!! 10', '2005-05-16 16:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
