(1389621, 178368, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice   I like that the wine in this picture is not a Silhouette, but the rest of the main subject is.  Very nicely done  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Very nice   I like that the wine in this picture is not a Silhouette, but the rest of the main subject is.  Very nicely done  <7>', '2005-05-16 18:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
