(1389632, 176243, 30018, '<td valign="top">VERY NICE !  I love the colors, and the lighting.  This will finish very high!  Great job.  &lt;9&gt;<br/> <br/>Okay, now that they are sorted, it''s clear, there are none better!  Bumping this up a notch.  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'VERY NICE !  I love the colors, and the lighting.  This will finish very high!  Great job.  <9> Okay, now that they are sorted, it''s clear, there are none better!  Bumping this up a notch.  <10>', '2005-05-16 18:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389637, 178360, 30018, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the colors.  Worthy of a high marks.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'I love the composition and the colors.  Worthy of a high marks.  <9>', '2005-05-16 18:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389638, 178499, 24065, '<td valign="top">The background is beautiful and I love your message.  I am wondering a little about the composiiton.  I like the slanted angle of the cross, but wonder if it would have worked better if it had not been so centered.  Perhaps over to the left with the expanse to the right?  BOL</td>', 'The background is beautiful and I love your message.  I am wondering a little about the composiiton.  I like the slanted angle of the cross, but wonder if it would have worked better if it had not been so centered.  Perhaps over to the left with the expanse to the right?  BOL', '2005-05-16 18:19:55.000000', NULL, 1);
