(1389645, 178585, 30018, '<td valign="top">Quite the Dandy Dandelion.  Very nicely done.  Beautiful image.  Will it bring home a ribbon?  I wouldn''t be surprised.  &lt;8&gt;<br/> <br/>Now that they are sorted, I need to bump this up a notch  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Quite the Dandy Dandelion.  Very nicely done.  Beautiful image.  Will it bring home a ribbon?  I wouldn''t be surprised.  <8> Now that they are sorted, I need to bump this up a notch  <9>', '2005-05-16 18:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389650, 177466, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Great Silhouette with just a little detail.  I like it a lot.  Wonderful colors as well.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Great Silhouette with just a little detail.  I like it a lot.  Wonderful colors as well.  <8>', '2005-05-16 18:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389651, 178572, 33947, '<td valign="top">Incredibly well lit sky and interesting shapes on the horses...especially the front one. Very well done.</td>', 'Incredibly well lit sky and interesting shapes on the horses...especially the front one. Very well done.', '2005-05-16 18:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389652, 178130, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice line, contrast and glowy background. Very appealing.</td>', 'Nice line, contrast and glowy background. Very appealing.', '2005-05-16 18:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389653, 178295, 30392, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but it looks overdone to me</td>', 'Sorry, but it looks overdone to me', '2005-05-16 18:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389659, 177358, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love your idea of dancing with your dog. Fun. A bit soft around the edges, but still, a fun shot. Did you plan sun that way? : )</td>', 'I love your idea of dancing with your dog. Fun. A bit soft around the edges, but still, a fun shot. Did you plan sun that way? : )', '2005-05-16 18:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389662, 178460, 33672, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites!  Nice Job the lighting, contrast and comp!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites!  Nice Job the lighting, contrast and comp!', '2005-05-16 18:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389663, 178496, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Like the line and simplicity. Nice composition.<br/> <br/>Second pass...bumping up. 9</td>', 'Very creative. Like the line and simplicity. Nice composition. Second pass...bumping up. 9', '2005-05-16 18:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389664, 177011, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very fun shot. Love the intense purple agaist the black. Composition has nice line.</td>', 'Very fun shot. Love the intense purple agaist the black. Composition has nice line.', '2005-05-16 18:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389665, 177983, 30392, '<td valign="top">What an incredibly sharp horizon! the colors are beautiful. Maybe it would look better with a tighter crop at the top, but then you would lose the cool white bit... Only other (slight) problem is the lack of details in the sea, is it too much neatimage? Still an 8</td>', 'What an incredibly sharp horizon! the colors are beautiful. Maybe it would look better with a tighter crop at the top, but then you would lose the cool white bit... Only other (slight) problem is the lack of details in the sea, is it too much neatimage? Still an 8', '2005-05-16 18:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389672, 177051, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color tones. Nice composition. Like that you achieved a warm background with an interesting muted peach/melon color rather than yellow. Makes it stand out. 8</td>', 'Beautiful color tones. Nice composition. Like that you achieved a warm background with an interesting muted peach/melon color rather than yellow. Makes it stand out. 8', '2005-05-16 18:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389682, 177952, 13688, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I''m having a tough time figuring out what you did but the edges of the ducks ended up very off. I''m thinking upping the contrast a bunch would have helped the ducks stand out without the artifacts.</td>', 'Nice composition. I''m having a tough time figuring out what you did but the edges of the ducks ended up very off. I''m thinking upping the contrast a bunch would have helped the ducks stand out without the artifacts.', '2005-05-16 18:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389683, 177672, 33672, '<td valign="top">without the wires its a 10. Great lighting and comp!</td>', 'without the wires its a 10. Great lighting and comp!', '2005-05-16 18:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389684, 178323, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love the subtleness of this shot and the nice, muted tones. Also, the droplets are really neat. Sharpness is very good. Super shot. 8</td>', 'I love the subtleness of this shot and the nice, muted tones. Also, the droplets are really neat. Sharpness is very good. Super shot. 8', '2005-05-16 18:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389690, 178453, 33947, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot. I love the subtleness and simplicity of the composition. Nice job.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot. I love the subtleness and simplicity of the composition. Nice job.', '2005-05-16 18:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389691, 178576, 36499, '<td valign="top">i love the use of color here. great photo! good luck</td>', 'i love the use of color here. great photo! good luck', '2005-05-16 18:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389695, 177465, 33947, '<td valign="top">Great shot!! Very creative and clever. The line and simplicity of the composition are outstanding. 8</td>', 'Great shot!! Very creative and clever. The line and simplicity of the composition are outstanding. 8', '2005-05-16 18:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389714, 178576, 23278, '<td valign="top">I was going to take a shot of this very location but wasn''t able to make it out to the coast over the weekend, and ended up not entering at all. I am glad someone caught it -- it''s a beautiful place, and haunting. Nice capture, good colors, and definitely says sillouette.</td>', 'I was going to take a shot of this very location but wasn''t able to make it out to the coast over the weekend, and ended up not entering at all. I am glad someone caught it -- it''s a beautiful place, and haunting. Nice capture, good colors, and definitely says sillouette.', '2005-05-16 18:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389725, 177657, 19959, '<td valign="top">Well captured, the item on the left is a distraction though.</td>', 'Well captured, the item on the left is a distraction though.', '2005-05-16 18:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389727, 178003, 15305, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful!!  The silhouette of th butterfly against the textures in the plant make this a very good picture.</td>', 'Simply beautiful!!  The silhouette of th butterfly against the textures in the plant make this a very good picture.', '2005-05-16 18:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389736, 178496, 35161, '<td valign="top">Perfect shade and composition! :)</td>', 'Perfect shade and composition! :)', '2005-05-16 18:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
