(1389745, 178290, 19959, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. Not quite dark enough to be considered a classic silhouette. Very nice work though. I like it (especially as it is a subject close to my heart!)</td>', 'This is a great shot. Not quite dark enough to be considered a classic silhouette. Very nice work though. I like it (especially as it is a subject close to my heart!)', '2005-05-16 18:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
