(1389759, 178207, 4411, '<td valign="top">Surely Thatcher''s legacy would be the complete lack of miners? ; )<br/> <br/>Good, powerful image. I like the dark framing you''ve created with the building and the miner provides a very strong focal point.</td>', 'Surely Thatcher''s legacy would be the complete lack of miners? ; ) Good, powerful image. I like the dark framing you''ve created with the building and the miner provides a very strong focal point.', '2005-05-16 19:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389764, 176434, 4411, '<td valign="top">Exposure is well handled, but as a "subject" the trees aren''t really strong enough.</td>', 'Exposure is well handled, but as a "subject" the trees aren''t really strong enough.', '2005-05-16 19:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389766, 178560, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice shot (pun intended).  I think I would have cropped this one quite a bit tighter - probably most of the sky and all of the tree on the left</td>', 'Nice shot (pun intended).  I think I would have cropped this one quite a bit tighter - probably most of the sky and all of the tree on the left', '2005-05-16 19:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389769, 178243, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent composition.  A drawback is that there is a lot of post process haloing all around the lines and edges.</td>', 'This is an excellent composition.  A drawback is that there is a lot of post process haloing all around the lines and edges.', '2005-05-16 19:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389772, 177528, 4411, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you didn''t go for the pitch black silhouette - the slight detail works very well. The sunset is very nice too, with plenty of cloud to add interest and a pleasant change from the usual garish oranges &amp; reds. The yellow seems a little odd to these eyes, but it is London so I guess anything is possible!<br/> <br/>What really makes this shot though is the boat. Perfectly placed in the "less interesting" side of the water, it give the whole shot that little extra. Superb.</td>', 'I''m glad you didn''t go for the pitch black silhouette - the slight detail works very well. The sunset is very nice too, with plenty of cloud to add interest and a pleasant change from the usual garish oranges & reds. The yellow seems a little odd to these eyes, but it is London so I guess anything is possible! What really makes this shot though is the boat. Perfectly placed in the "less interesting" side of the water, it give the whole shot that little extra. Superb.', '2005-05-16 19:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389774, 177990, 18799, '<td valign="top">While this is a beautiful image, I think there is too much detail to be considered a true silhouette.</td>', 'While this is a beautiful image, I think there is too much detail to be considered a true silhouette.', '2005-05-16 19:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1389803, 176243, 33352, '<td valign="top">I Like the effect....8</td>', 'I Like the effect....8', '2005-05-16 19:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
