(1390130, 178496, 29904, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and contrast.  Your glass stem is perfectly in focus but not the betta and parts of the glass like the bottom.   Perhaps it may look sharper overall with a smaller f-stop/ less macro effect?  There is also a distracting line in the right side of the rim that could have been cloned out.  But I''m just being nit-picky because I really like this image so much.  9</td>', 'Beautiful color and contrast.  Your glass stem is perfectly in focus but not the betta and parts of the glass like the bottom.   Perhaps it may look sharper overall with a smaller f-stop/ less macro effect?  There is also a distracting line in the right side of the rim that could have been cloned out.  But I''m just being nit-picky because I really like this image so much.  9', '2005-05-16 22:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
