(1390161, 178209, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful colors, great bold silhouette. I like how it looks like she''s looking into the space and off into the distance beyond the edge of the frame. It makes me wonder what she''s looking at.</td>', 'Very beautiful colors, great bold silhouette. I like how it looks like she''s looking into the space and off into the distance beyond the edge of the frame. It makes me wonder what she''s looking at.', '2005-05-16 22:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390162, 176749, 18799, '<td valign="top">This looks like you just went out and snapped a photo without really thinking about what you wanted to say.  I image is fine, the scene is nice, and there is a silhouette - but it just doesn''t move me in any way.  Subject wise, there is nothing going on - just a guy walking out of a shaded area.  Compositionally,  I think it''s way too centered.  The eye goes right to it and then doesn''t feel compelled to move around in the image to see what else is there.   Don''t get me wrong, just trying to help.  5</td>', 'This looks like you just went out and snapped a photo without really thinking about what you wanted to say.  I image is fine, the scene is nice, and there is a silhouette - but it just doesn''t move me in any way.  Subject wise, there is nothing going on - just a guy walking out of a shaded area.  Compositionally,  I think it''s way too centered.  The eye goes right to it and then doesn''t feel compelled to move around in the image to see what else is there.   Don''t get me wrong, just trying to help.  5', '2005-05-16 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390164, 178285, 18799, '<td valign="top">Very abstract looking.  Good choice with the tilt.</td>', 'Very abstract looking.  Good choice with the tilt.', '2005-05-16 23:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390165, 177664, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! Really incredible silhouette. I love the simplicity of only blue and black. Great sky, great all around. <br/> <br/>The only think I don''t like is the JPEG artifacting around the silhouette. The image is only about 50KB, you should use more of the 150KB you have and get better quality. This really distracts from the otherwise fabulous crispness and cleanness of the image. I would give a 9 or even 10 if the image was just a bit cleaner. 8</td>', 'Fabulous! Really incredible silhouette. I love the simplicity of only blue and black. Great sky, great all around.  The only think I don''t like is the JPEG artifacting around the silhouette. The image is only about 50KB, you should use more of the 150KB you have and get better quality. This really distracts from the otherwise fabulous crispness and cleanness of the image. I would give a 9 or even 10 if the image was just a bit cleaner. 8', '2005-05-16 23:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390167, 177108, 29904, '<td valign="top">The branches in the upper left are distracting, and under these rules, could have been cloned out.  Rules of thirds, you want your horizon I/3 from the top or bottom.  Nice color, focus and contrast.  Hope that helps, good luck!</td>', 'The branches in the upper left are distracting, and under these rules, could have been cloned out.  Rules of thirds, you want your horizon I/3 from the top or bottom.  Nice color, focus and contrast.  Hope that helps, good luck!', '2005-05-16 23:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390168, 178490, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, nice soft feel to the image. I think the border''s a little too bright white though, it doesn''t fit with the rest of the image.</td>', 'Nice colors, nice soft feel to the image. I think the border''s a little too bright white though, it doesn''t fit with the rest of the image.', '2005-05-16 23:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390174, 178496, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very clean image! Simple, neat, uncluttered. I like it. I just can''t get over how smooth this image is! (I *hate* seeing great images ruined by JPEG artifacts or jaggies or noise or dust specs...) <br/> <br/>Excellent job!</td>', 'Very clean image! Simple, neat, uncluttered. I like it. I just can''t get over how smooth this image is! (I *hate* seeing great images ruined by JPEG artifacts or jaggies or noise or dust specs...)  Excellent job!', '2005-05-16 23:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
