(1390280, 178342, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the feeling of motion or action with the people walking. The framing with the arch is really cool.</td>', 'Nice, I like the feeling of motion or action with the people walking. The framing with the arch is really cool.', '2005-05-16 23:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390282, 178493, 22748, '<td valign="top">Really nice image, thought it''s borderline whether it''s a silhouette or not, since only the trees on the very left and right bottom corners of the image are really dark and devoid of detail.</td>', 'Really nice image, thought it''s borderline whether it''s a silhouette or not, since only the trees on the very left and right bottom corners of the image are really dark and devoid of detail.', '2005-05-16 23:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390286, 178003, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great take on the silhouette. It''s really original and a pretty shot. Very sharp and nice color.</td>', 'Great take on the silhouette. It''s really original and a pretty shot. Very sharp and nice color.', '2005-05-16 23:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390290, 178246, 30959, '<td valign="top">Had to think about this one, on the first go round I was not that impressed. However after returning I am bumping up. The title is what put me off at first, then after taking the time to consider it realized it was a commentary more than disinterest in your own shot. At any rate, sharp outlines, out of the box thinking and nice lighting for topic.</td>', 'Had to think about this one, on the first go round I was not that impressed. However after returning I am bumping up. The title is what put me off at first, then after taking the time to consider it realized it was a commentary more than disinterest in your own shot. At any rate, sharp outlines, out of the box thinking and nice lighting for topic.', '2005-05-16 23:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390291, 178255, 29904, '<td valign="top">Love this effect, did you use a filter, or post-edit?</td>', 'Love this effect, did you use a filter, or post-edit?', '2005-05-16 23:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390295, 176082, 30959, '<td valign="top">A cute photo, but not a silhouette. I am sure others have made the same comment. What I do see here is nice positioning of the subject. I like this composition, perhaps a bit sharper focus.</td>', 'A cute photo, but not a silhouette. I am sure others have made the same comment. What I do see here is nice positioning of the subject. I like this composition, perhaps a bit sharper focus.', '2005-05-16 23:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390298, 178586, 30959, '<td valign="top">Dont really see a silhouette here, just a dimly lit pair of wings.</td>', 'Dont really see a silhouette here, just a dimly lit pair of wings.', '2005-05-16 23:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390299, 178393, 30959, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus would have made this a nice catch.</td>', 'Sharper focus would have made this a nice catch.', '2005-05-16 23:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390302, 178271, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool, original shot! Nice bold image. There are some weird gray dots in the lower lefthand corner though that interfere with the crisp black and white.</td>', 'Cool, original shot! Nice bold image. There are some weird gray dots in the lower lefthand corner though that interfere with the crisp black and white.', '2005-05-16 23:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390304, 178069, 30959, '<td valign="top">While it is a silhouette, I have no  idea what I am looking at. Perhaps leaves on an outdoor light. I am left wondering at the reason for this photo. I am a fan of the abstract, but it leaves me unmoved in that areana as well.</td>', 'While it is a silhouette, I have no  idea what I am looking at. Perhaps leaves on an outdoor light. I am left wondering at the reason for this photo. I am a fan of the abstract, but it leaves me unmoved in that areana as well.', '2005-05-16 23:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390310, 178245, 30959, '<td valign="top">Perhaps I am being unfair, but this views to me as having been overprocessed due to the halo arond the elephant and the blown out yellows. The subject itself is stunning and the background colors are dramatic. After review, I am bumping it up however. 5</td>', 'Perhaps I am being unfair, but this views to me as having been overprocessed due to the halo arond the elephant and the blown out yellows. The subject itself is stunning and the background colors are dramatic. After review, I am bumping it up however. 5', '2005-05-16 23:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390312, 178073, 30959, '<td valign="top">Focus on the branches and leaves appears soft. The lighting is definately dramatic and the colors fit your humorous title. 5</td>', 'Focus on the branches and leaves appears soft. The lighting is definately dramatic and the colors fit your humorous title. 5', '2005-05-16 23:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390314, 178444, 6668, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, love the colors in the sunset!</td>', 'This is beautiful, love the colors in the sunset!', '2005-05-16 23:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390315, 177693, 30959, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see a silhouette here, rather a dimly lit plant. Everything else is in darkness. It is an intriguing photo of a plant.</td>', 'Not sure I see a silhouette here, rather a dimly lit plant. Everything else is in darkness. It is an intriguing photo of a plant.', '2005-05-16 23:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390317, 177466, 6668, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, I love the gold of the trombone, and the border works nicely here too! 10</td>', 'This is really nice, I love the gold of the trombone, and the border works nicely here too! 10', '2005-05-16 23:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390325, 176889, 30959, '<td valign="top">An unusual shot. The lighting makes me want a sharp silhouette and it is a tad soft. Yet, that may well suite the theme of the picture as he walks off into who knows what. Like the composition and lighting, focus doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'An unusual shot. The lighting makes me want a sharp silhouette and it is a tad soft. Yet, that may well suite the theme of the picture as he walks off into who knows what. Like the composition and lighting, focus doesn''t work for me.', '2005-05-16 23:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390329, 176255, 30959, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, however focus is too soft to appeal to me.The telephone wires dissect the picture and do not add to it''s over all impact. If they led me to some interesting point, then they would have earned their keep.</td>', 'Nice colors, however focus is too soft to appeal to me.The telephone wires dissect the picture and do not add to it''s over all impact. If they led me to some interesting point, then they would have earned their keep.', '2005-05-16 23:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390331, 178158, 30959, '<td valign="top">Halo and soft focus take away from this nice effort. I admire the attempt and would like to see a reshoot with crisp focus and no haloing.</td>', 'Halo and soft focus take away from this nice effort. I admire the attempt and would like to see a reshoot with crisp focus and no haloing.', '2005-05-16 23:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390334, 178258, 30959, '<td valign="top">Nice subject here, and good composition. Focus is soft and the light background appears smudgy. The effect of those two items detract significantly.</td>', 'Nice subject here, and good composition. Focus is soft and the light background appears smudgy. The effect of those two items detract significantly.', '2005-05-17 00:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390335, 177766, 30959, '<td valign="top">Bumping up, I enjoy this playful shot and putting the cartwheeler there is a stroke of genius.</td>', 'Bumping up, I enjoy this playful shot and putting the cartwheeler there is a stroke of genius.', '2005-05-17 00:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390337, 178295, 30959, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, however looks pushed just a bit hard in processing and the lack of focus takes away from the overal effect as well.</td>', 'Lovely colors, however looks pushed just a bit hard in processing and the lack of focus takes away from the overal effect as well.', '2005-05-17 00:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390338, 176434, 19672, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-05-17 00:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390339, 177766, 19672, '<td valign="top">trippy.....  : )<br/> <br/></td>', 'trippy.....  : ) ', '2005-05-17 00:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390340, 177951, 30959, '<td valign="top">Going back around and bumping this up, Nice colors and subject against the water. Focus is on and no lens issues with sun. Nice job 8</td>', 'Going back around and bumping this up, Nice colors and subject against the water. Focus is on and no lens issues with sun. Nice job 8', '2005-05-17 00:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390341, 178222, 19672, '<td valign="top">the rait on the right totally distracts from this shot....if you cropped it to just the tree it''d be surperb</td>', 'the rait on the right totally distracts from this shot....if you cropped it to just the tree it''d be surperb', '2005-05-17 00:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390342, 178484, 30959, '<td valign="top">Second go round, bumping this up. Lovely photo of a misty morning, the horse grazing makes the shot. While a stretch for silhouettes, tree and horse are close enough to meet a loose definition. Magnificent scene to be able to view in real life no doubt.</td>', 'Second go round, bumping this up. Lovely photo of a misty morning, the horse grazing makes the shot. While a stretch for silhouettes, tree and horse are close enough to meet a loose definition. Magnificent scene to be able to view in real life no doubt.', '2005-05-17 00:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390343, 178290, 19672, '<td valign="top">intriguing composition</td>', 'intriguing composition', '2005-05-17 00:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390345, 177515, 19672, '<td valign="top">very interesting....</td>', 'very interesting....', '2005-05-17 00:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390349, 178149, 19672, '<td valign="top">should have cropped this shot, the guy on the left is very distracting....does not have a good pose, the gal on the right is a great pose. you could have cropped just the bottom right and gotten a solid two points higher and possibly been in shot for a ribbon</td>', 'should have cropped this shot, the guy on the left is very distracting....does not have a good pose, the gal on the right is a great pose. you could have cropped just the bottom right and gotten a solid two points higher and possibly been in shot for a ribbon', '2005-05-17 00:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390350, 178566, 19672, '<td valign="top">i''d swear that is a Jesus doll on the left with the hands in an outstretched "bless the people"</td>', 'i''d swear that is a Jesus doll on the left with the hands in an outstretched "bless the people"', '2005-05-17 00:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390353, 178464, 19672, '<td valign="top">would have cropped it to just the right half</td>', 'would have cropped it to just the right half', '2005-05-17 00:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390360, 178486, 19672, '<td valign="top">a bit too much noise but a nice shot....the faded white washed blinds give almost that "Sin City" feel</td>', 'a bit too much noise but a nice shot....the faded white washed blinds give almost that "Sin City" feel', '2005-05-17 00:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390361, 178196, 30959, '<td valign="top">This has a bit of an abstract feel to it. Nice job of not letting the sun just burn t is into oblivion. bumping up 7</td>', 'This has a bit of an abstract feel to it. Nice job of not letting the sun just burn t is into oblivion. bumping up 7', '2005-05-17 00:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390364, 178073, 19672, '<td valign="top">looks like war</td>', 'looks like war', '2005-05-17 00:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
