(1390915, 177999, 34247, '<td valign="top">i like the composition here very much, including the pose and backgrounding. what are probably snow flakes driven by the wind (nice addition to the overall ambiance) could be mistaken for scratches on a pane of glass through which this image was shot. For that aspect to be more effective, I''d wish for clearer "snow" or none at all. Still, I''m impressed by the textures represented here, the contrast control, the shadow and angling, etc. Originally a 7, but I''ll bump to 9 within a field of shots filled with many very good ones. Thanks.</td>', 'i like the composition here very much, including the pose and backgrounding. what are probably snow flakes driven by the wind (nice addition to the overall ambiance) could be mistaken for scratches on a pane of glass through which this image was shot. For that aspect to be more effective, I''d wish for clearer "snow" or none at all. Still, I''m impressed by the textures represented here, the contrast control, the shadow and angling, etc. Originally a 7, but I''ll bump to 9 within a field of shots filled with many very good ones. Thanks.', '2005-05-17 08:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390916, 177475, 31443, '<td valign="top">Finally see something interesting, great shot!</td>', 'Finally see something interesting, great shot!', '2005-05-17 08:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390917, 177358, 27605, '<td valign="top">Hey I know that profile!  (Would have been a 10 if you had added a cool, feathered border!)</td>', 'Hey I know that profile!  (Would have been a 10 if you had added a cool, feathered border!)', '2005-05-17 08:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390918, 178232, 31443, '<td valign="top">Love this image!</td>', 'Love this image!', '2005-05-17 08:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390925, 177952, 19010, '<td valign="top">Absolutaly breathtaking. This is just phenominal. I could look at this one for hours and never grow bored with the perfect gold water with hints of other colors gently mixed in, and the amazingly crisp ripples in the water. The silhouettes have a nice clean edge and just perfect. My only very small complaint would be that the water on the botom is a little soft. I would have liked for it to be as crisp as the rest of the image. But thats just personal raste. This is still a perfect shot worth every bit of my 10 and more.</td>', 'Absolutaly breathtaking. This is just phenominal. I could look at this one for hours and never grow bored with the perfect gold water with hints of other colors gently mixed in, and the amazingly crisp ripples in the water. The silhouettes have a nice clean edge and just perfect. My only very small complaint would be that the water on the botom is a little soft. I would have liked for it to be as crisp as the rest of the image. But thats just personal raste. This is still a perfect shot worth every bit of my 10 and more.', '2005-05-17 08:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390927, 178382, 25355, '<td valign="top">not at all sure what this is</td>', 'not at all sure what this is', '2005-05-17 08:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390928, 176243, 14700, '<td valign="top">Terrific job.  I think that cropping out the window frame would have kept your focus on you and the subjects on the desk.  Still a 9.</td>', 'Terrific job.  I think that cropping out the window frame would have kept your focus on you and the subjects on the desk.  Still a 9.', '2005-05-17 08:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390929, 178534, 25355, '<td valign="top"><br/>i''ve never seen a windmill with blades like that before</td>', 'i''ve never seen a windmill with blades like that before', '2005-05-17 08:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390930, 178576, 19010, '<td valign="top">Absolutaly beyond a doubt one of the most beautifull silhouettes I have ever seen. Very stong and crisp lines. The boat alone is enough to make this a great shot. But then you give us a spectacular and brilliant sunset with mountains of perfect colors. This is to much to ask for. Absolutaly wonderfull. 10</td>', 'Absolutaly beyond a doubt one of the most beautifull silhouettes I have ever seen. Very stong and crisp lines. The boat alone is enough to make this a great shot. But then you give us a spectacular and brilliant sunset with mountains of perfect colors. This is to much to ask for. Absolutaly wonderfull. 10', '2005-05-17 08:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390933, 178093, 25355, '<td valign="top">funny, this was the sort of idea I had for the Apple challenge, but I never got around to getting an apple...</td>', 'funny, this was the sort of idea I had for the Apple challenge, but I never got around to getting an apple...', '2005-05-17 08:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390934, 176595, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice Silhouette.  Just enough detail and I like the way the red teddy is not silhouetted.  Sexy image, that allows the imagination to work a little.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Very nice Silhouette.  Just enough detail and I like the way the red teddy is not silhouetted.  Sexy image, that allows the imagination to work a little.  <8>', '2005-05-17 08:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390935, 177466, 19010, '<td valign="top">Very crisp lines on the silhouette wonderfull lighting. One of the few man made silhouettes in the challenge not just showing of the female form. (not that thats a bad thing). I absolutaly love the way the hron climbs out from the shadows. The only one of it kind in the challenge, Great shot. 10</td>', 'Very crisp lines on the silhouette wonderfull lighting. One of the few man made silhouettes in the challenge not just showing of the female form. (not that thats a bad thing). I absolutaly love the way the hron climbs out from the shadows. The only one of it kind in the challenge, Great shot. 10', '2005-05-17 08:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390936, 176797, 14700, '<td valign="top">Great job. Your photo tells a story anyone can identify with... I do find myself distracted by all the stuff near the chin on the left-hand guy.... looks like he is wearing a neckbrace.  Still worth a 7.</td>', 'Great job. Your photo tells a story anyone can identify with... I do find myself distracted by all the stuff near the chin on the left-hand guy.... looks like he is wearing a neckbrace.  Still worth a 7.', '2005-05-17 08:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390940, 177263, 19010, '<td valign="top">Bahumbug. No fair! You just knew there was a surfer on this site and that you would be able to get a good score of of him for thi wonderfull shot. (9) I would have gone higher but I cant help but wonder if this was shot at a different angle would you have captuerd more of the gold in waves. Sharp lines on the silhouettes and a wonderfull rich golden color on the sand.</td>', 'Bahumbug. No fair! You just knew there was a surfer on this site and that you would be able to get a good score of of him for thi wonderfull shot. (9) I would have gone higher but I cant help but wonder if this was shot at a different angle would you have captuerd more of the gold in waves. Sharp lines on the silhouettes and a wonderfull rich golden color on the sand.', '2005-05-17 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390941, 177398, 35764, '<td valign="top">would be more effective if the moth was sharper</td>', 'would be more effective if the moth was sharper', '2005-05-17 08:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390945, 177500, 14700, '<td valign="top">I think you captured an invisible texture well.</td>', 'I think you captured an invisible texture well.', '2005-05-17 08:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390947, 178269, 35764, '<td valign="top">i like the silhouette side of the photo, especially the reflection in the floor, but the way that the image is divided in half down the middle is too distracting</td>', 'i like the silhouette side of the photo, especially the reflection in the floor, but the way that the image is divided in half down the middle is too distracting', '2005-05-17 08:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390948, 178291, 14700, '<td valign="top">very clever use of a g.i. joe.  10 for good trick photography.</td>', 'very clever use of a g.i. joe.  10 for good trick photography.', '2005-05-17 08:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390949, 177672, 35764, '<td valign="top">love the play of light and the pose</td>', 'love the play of light and the pose', '2005-05-17 09:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390954, 177951, 14700, '<td valign="top">I think there is too much dead space on the bottom.</td>', 'I think there is too much dead space on the bottom.', '2005-05-17 09:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390959, 178354, 35764, '<td valign="top">too much detail to qualify as a silhouette for me</td>', 'too much detail to qualify as a silhouette for me', '2005-05-17 09:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390963, 178274, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image.  Great Silhouette.  I would have probably scored this higher had there been a hint of detail on your model.  Just a little shadow or skin tones around the very edges of your model.  Still a very nice image.  Very nice job.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'This is a very nice image.  Great Silhouette.  I would have probably scored this higher had there been a hint of detail on your model.  Just a little shadow or skin tones around the very edges of your model.  Still a very nice image.  Very nice job.  <7>', '2005-05-17 09:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390964, 176252, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very cool image.  Odd colored sky, but I like it.  Can''t wait to see more information about this image.  One of the few images where electrical lines and phone lines enhance the image.  Very nicely done.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Very cool image.  Odd colored sky, but I like it.  Can''t wait to see more information about this image.  One of the few images where electrical lines and phone lines enhance the image.  Very nicely done.  <7>', '2005-05-17 09:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390965, 177108, 35764, '<td valign="top">great photo.  I would have cloned out the stray branch and a few leaves in the top left of the sky.  great nonetheless</td>', 'great photo.  I would have cloned out the stray branch and a few leaves in the top left of the sky.  great nonetheless', '2005-05-17 09:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390966, 178489, 35764, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-05-17 09:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390967, 177348, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I like the way you included part of the city''s skyline which helps ground this image.  Nice soft color.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Very nice image.  I like the way you included part of the city''s skyline which helps ground this image.  Nice soft color.  <6>', '2005-05-17 09:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390970, 177975, 35764, '<td valign="top">while a great photo, I think that the two silhouette elements distract from the impact that just the leaves would have had</td>', 'while a great photo, I think that the two silhouette elements distract from the impact that just the leaves would have had', '2005-05-17 09:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390971, 177770, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  One of the few images where "just a little detail" is not needed.  this is totally self expanitory.   Interesting color in the sky; I can''t wait to see some of the details about this image.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Very nice composition.  One of the few images where "just a little detail" is not needed.  this is totally self expanitory.   Interesting color in the sky; I can''t wait to see some of the details about this image.  <6>', '2005-05-17 09:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390973, 176797, 35764, '<td valign="top">the natural poses convey a lot of feeling in the shot.  very nice</td>', 'the natural poses convey a lot of feeling in the shot.  very nice', '2005-05-17 09:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1390997, 178572, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very interesting sky.  Almost too powerful as it takes away from the main subject.  Very interesting angle, however.  I like the "different look".  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Very interesting sky.  Almost too powerful as it takes away from the main subject.  Very interesting angle, however.  I like the "different look".  <5>', '2005-05-17 09:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391000, 178499, 9073, '<td valign="top">I like the starkness of the composition and the redness. Very appropriate for an image of a powerful god. However, the title rather goes against this. The blue in the top right doesn''t help much. 5</td>', 'I like the starkness of the composition and the redness. Very appropriate for an image of a powerful god. However, the title rather goes against this. The blue in the top right doesn''t help much. 5', '2005-05-17 09:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391003, 178158, 9073, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea, but the overall feeling is that it''s a bit muddy, not that appropriate for a love theme. 4</td>', 'This is a nice idea, but the overall feeling is that it''s a bit muddy, not that appropriate for a love theme. 4', '2005-05-17 09:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391004, 177904, 30018, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too much detail in the main subject, to be considered a Silhouette, in my opinion.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Just a bit too much detail in the main subject, to be considered a Silhouette, in my opinion.  <5>', '2005-05-17 09:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391013, 177172, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  You have captured a Silhouette and with textured detail as well.  I wish the bright light were not in the corner of the image, as it pulls my eye to that corner.  This would have been a much better image had the entire image had the illumination found on the left side of the image.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Nicely done.  You have captured a Silhouette and with textured detail as well.  I wish the bright light were not in the corner of the image, as it pulls my eye to that corner.  This would have been a much better image had the entire image had the illumination found on the left side of the image.  <6>', '2005-05-17 09:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391016, 178440, 9073, '<td valign="top">I like the off-centre composition and the choice of action. Very fitting. You''ve managed a very clear separation of the figure from the clouds through an effective use of dof. Also, the rule of thirds is textbook. Good stuff. 8</td>', 'I like the off-centre composition and the choice of action. Very fitting. You''ve managed a very clear separation of the figure from the clouds through an effective use of dof. Also, the rule of thirds is textbook. Good stuff. 8', '2005-05-17 09:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391023, 178270, 9073, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the white border for this grey-toned image. It detracts from the point somewhat. Also, the feet area blends too much with the sand. Otherwise, a nice set up. 5</td>', 'I''m not fond of the white border for this grey-toned image. It detracts from the point somewhat. Also, the feet area blends too much with the sand. Otherwise, a nice set up. 5', '2005-05-17 09:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391035, 178330, 9073, '<td valign="top">For my tastes, there''s too much negative space here. I''d try a landscape format cropping just below the chin and just to the left of the horn.  Or maybe you could have placed the sun directly behind the head giving  a halo effect to emphasise the mythical quality. 4</td>', 'For my tastes, there''s too much negative space here. I''d try a landscape format cropping just below the chin and just to the left of the horn.  Or maybe you could have placed the sun directly behind the head giving  a halo effect to emphasise the mythical quality. 4', '2005-05-17 09:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391048, 178116, 9073, '<td valign="top">I really like the top 80% of this image. It''s so surrealistic that I laughed. Unfortunately, when I got to the bottom, the realness of the brick showed through and took away the effect. 5</td>', 'I really like the top 80% of this image. It''s so surrealistic that I laughed. Unfortunately, when I got to the bottom, the realness of the brick showed through and took away the effect. 5', '2005-05-17 09:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391061, 176533, 9073, '<td valign="top">The double border isn''t to my taste, and I feel that the black part is too thick. The action and composition are fine, and I like the colours in the bottom section.  5</td>', 'The double border isn''t to my taste, and I feel that the black part is too thick. The action and composition are fine, and I like the colours in the bottom section.  5', '2005-05-17 09:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391081, 178571, 9073, '<td valign="top">Besides not being a true silhouette, there''s a fuzzy feeling here detracting from what should be a sharpness in the instruments'' lines. About the title: try to avoid prepositions. Rhythm and Bass: Harmony''s Combination might be more punchier. 3</td>', 'Besides not being a true silhouette, there''s a fuzzy feeling here detracting from what should be a sharpness in the instruments'' lines. About the title: try to avoid prepositions. Rhythm and Bass: Harmony''s Combination might be more punchier. 3', '2005-05-17 09:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391082, 176252, 9073, '<td valign="top">What a delightfully messy work. I''d cut off the bottom 1/5th, though for a tighter effect. I''ve been having my own troubles with electricity lines, so I''m happy to see them work so well in a photo. 7</td>', 'What a delightfully messy work. I''d cut off the bottom 1/5th, though for a tighter effect. I''ve been having my own troubles with electricity lines, so I''m happy to see them work so well in a photo. 7', '2005-05-17 09:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391083, 177620, 9073, '<td valign="top">Simple composition, restricted tonal palatte and clear action support your theme well. It''s a pity that the light source is still too obvious. 6</td>', 'Simple composition, restricted tonal palatte and clear action support your theme well. It''s a pity that the light source is still too obvious. 6', '2005-05-17 09:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391090, 177796, 9073, '<td valign="top">There''s still too much detail in the face for a true silhouette. This, for me, is a touch frustrating as I can see a much better and much more appealing photo here if you lighten the face a lot. I suspect that you tried to force the challenge theme here.  A potentially very, very nice photo for a different time. 4</td>', 'There''s still too much detail in the face for a true silhouette. This, for me, is a touch frustrating as I can see a much better and much more appealing photo here if you lighten the face a lot. I suspect that you tried to force the challenge theme here.  A potentially very, very nice photo for a different time. 4', '2005-05-17 09:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391094, 177654, 9073, '<td valign="top">Although I like the simple square composition and the border, the overall effect is a little bland for me. 4</td>', 'Although I like the simple square composition and the border, the overall effect is a little bland for me. 4', '2005-05-17 09:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391102, 176493, 9073, '<td valign="top">While this is a nice scene, there''s very little to grab my attention. It might have worked better if there''d been a pipe-smoking granddad reading a paper on the chair. That also might have helped avoid the glare. 3</td>', 'While this is a nice scene, there''s very little to grab my attention. It might have worked better if there''d been a pipe-smoking granddad reading a paper on the chair. That also might have helped avoid the glare. 3', '2005-05-17 09:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391104, 177491, 9073, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I think that the ferns really take away from the integrity of the main subject''s shape here. 3</td>', 'Sorry, but I think that the ferns really take away from the integrity of the main subject''s shape here. 3', '2005-05-17 09:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391107, 176742, 9073, '<td valign="top">There you are, and here I am screaming, "Stop thinking and get your finger on the shutter button!"  The only problem I feel here is with the composition - the space above the head takes away from the strong  line running from the  head to the sun.  A much tighter crop would really have brought that out. Otherwise a lovely shot. 7</td>', 'There you are, and here I am screaming, "Stop thinking and get your finger on the shutter button!"  The only problem I feel here is with the composition - the space above the head takes away from the strong  line running from the  head to the sun.  A much tighter crop would really have brought that out. Otherwise a lovely shot. 7', '2005-05-17 09:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391110, 178482, 22533, '<td valign="top">Looks a little crooked, but other than that, very nice! Good use of dodging around the cross.</td>', 'Looks a little crooked, but other than that, very nice! Good use of dodging around the cross.', '2005-05-17 09:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391124, 176434, 9073, '<td valign="top">I''d have cut the top 1/4 off. As is, the exact centring feels a bit too stable. I''m also left wondering how it would have been if the branches had been silhouetted against the sun a bit. That might have made the photo a bit more dynamic. 5</td>', 'I''d have cut the top 1/4 off. As is, the exact centring feels a bit too stable. I''m also left wondering how it would have been if the branches had been silhouetted against the sun a bit. That might have made the photo a bit more dynamic. 5', '2005-05-17 09:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391135, 178321, 9073, '<td valign="top">The black blob on the left detracts from this very appealing shot.  I understand that you wanted to show the beginning of the branch and have the sun in the middle bottom, so you may have felt a bit constrained by that. For me, the real impact here is in the details in the buds. So, I''d have cut off the extreme right 1/8, got in a bit closer and asked a friend to pull the blob out of the frame. No friends? Well, you ARE a photographer. 7</td>', 'The black blob on the left detracts from this very appealing shot.  I understand that you wanted to show the beginning of the branch and have the sun in the middle bottom, so you may have felt a bit constrained by that. For me, the real impact here is in the details in the buds. So, I''d have cut off the extreme right 1/8, got in a bit closer and asked a friend to pull the blob out of the frame. No friends? Well, you ARE a photographer. 7', '2005-05-17 09:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391143, 178507, 9073, '<td valign="top">The ''top-bottom'' feel of this scene is lost a bit because of the square format. 4</td>', 'The ''top-bottom'' feel of this scene is lost a bit because of the square format. 4', '2005-05-17 10:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391152, 178517, 9073, '<td valign="top">Classic and a beautiful amount of texture outside. The border and line emphasise this perfectly. I think that you''ve got just the right amount of space above the head. I tried to visualise it a number of ways, but I always came back to what you''ve given here. Good stuff. 8</td>', 'Classic and a beautiful amount of texture outside. The border and line emphasise this perfectly. I think that you''ve got just the right amount of space above the head. I tried to visualise it a number of ways, but I always came back to what you''ve given here. Good stuff. 8', '2005-05-17 10:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391159, 178533, 9073, '<td valign="top">With the sky so bland, I wonder if it was wise to leave so much of it in. Especially as the very interesting details are elsewhere.  5</td>', 'With the sky so bland, I wonder if it was wise to leave so much of it in. Especially as the very interesting details are elsewhere.  5', '2005-05-17 10:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391163, 178222, 9073, '<td valign="top">You''ve got such lovely and rich colours here. The composition works for me, too as both sets of left-right lines compliment each other well. My only quibble is with the border and with the left tree clipping the border. It''s screaming out for space all around it. 7</td>', 'You''ve got such lovely and rich colours here. The composition works for me, too as both sets of left-right lines compliment each other well. My only quibble is with the border and with the left tree clipping the border. It''s screaming out for space all around it. 7', '2005-05-17 10:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391171, 177879, 9073, '<td valign="top">You''ve filled the frame well. The sky and the main subject are both very appealling. Maybe if you''d have waited just a touch, you could have avoided the pure white behind the centre of the wheel. Otherwise, good stuff. 8</td>', 'You''ve filled the frame well. The sky and the main subject are both very appealling. Maybe if you''d have waited just a touch, you could have avoided the pure white behind the centre of the wheel. Otherwise, good stuff. 8', '2005-05-17 10:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391179, 178328, 9073, '<td valign="top">I''m normally not so picky, but here this excellent photo suffers too much from a faulty horizon. 6</td>', 'I''m normally not so picky, but here this excellent photo suffers too much from a faulty horizon. 6', '2005-05-17 10:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391185, 178329, 9073, '<td valign="top">Two points: 1/ A better balance is needed. If the space from the bottom to the tip of the tree matched that of the top to the moon, the composition would have felt much more connected.  2/ I don''t like the title.  How about ''moon &amp; branch''? 5</td>', 'Two points: 1/ A better balance is needed. If the space from the bottom to the tip of the tree matched that of the top to the moon, the composition would have felt much more connected.  2/ I don''t like the title.  How about ''moon & branch''? 5', '2005-05-17 10:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391190, 176129, 9073, '<td valign="top">This lovely idea suffers from too much extraneous background spoilers. Also, there seems to be too much bottom. 4</td>', 'This lovely idea suffers from too much extraneous background spoilers. Also, there seems to be too much bottom. 4', '2005-05-17 10:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391196, 177478, 9073, '<td valign="top">Oh - nice. I can just see this gracing a book cover perfectly. I really like the tonal range here, as well as the composition and combined ideas. Lovely stuff. 10</td>', 'Oh - nice. I can just see this gracing a book cover perfectly. I really like the tonal range here, as well as the composition and combined ideas. Lovely stuff. 10', '2005-05-17 10:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391200, 177904, 9073, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea well executed. However, it''s not my cup of tea. 6</td>', 'This is a nice idea well executed. However, it''s not my cup of tea. 6', '2005-05-17 10:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391201, 177703, 19010, '<td valign="top">Hello zoomdack. I can''t help but wonder what the rocks look like from the other side. Would you please stand out in the water and shoot them for us. Maybe the camera will get wet so that a few of us can win a few of the ribbons : ) Once again great shot. For some reason I never get bored of looking as this great scene. Very strong lines on the silhouette. Nice colors in the sky and the water is absolutaly perfect. Wonderfull job.</td>', 'Hello zoomdack. I can''t help but wonder what the rocks look like from the other side. Would you please stand out in the water and shoot them for us. Maybe the camera will get wet so that a few of us can win a few of the ribbons : ) Once again great shot. For some reason I never get bored of looking as this great scene. Very strong lines on the silhouette. Nice colors in the sky and the water is absolutaly perfect. Wonderfull job.', '2005-05-17 10:17:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1391207, 177693, 9073, '<td valign="top">It seems to be that you''ve inverted the challenge theme - the main subject is far brighter than all but the lighted section. 3</td>', 'It seems to be that you''ve inverted the challenge theme - the main subject is far brighter than all but the lighted section. 3', '2005-05-17 10:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391213, 177942, 9073, '<td valign="top">I like this nice image, especially the colour and detail in the flowers, but I don''t care for the border.  5</td>', 'I like this nice image, especially the colour and detail in the flowers, but I don''t care for the border.  5', '2005-05-17 10:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391221, 177723, 9073, '<td valign="top">This image is so nearly perfect. The warmth and romanticism are shown so well in the background. My feeling is that the faces needed to be a little more distinct (by being closer to the centre of the frame?) and the glasses far more so.  7</td>', 'This image is so nearly perfect. The warmth and romanticism are shown so well in the background. My feeling is that the faces needed to be a little more distinct (by being closer to the centre of the frame?) and the glasses far more so.  7', '2005-05-17 10:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391232, 178066, 9073, '<td valign="top">If you''d have placed the sun directly behind the buildings, would their outline have been sharper? That certainly would have avoided the unhelpful white blob. The black silhouette on the left doesn''t help that much, either. But, beyond these quibbles, this is a potentially very good image. I like the attempt at combining motifs rather than just shoot a straightforward subject. 7</td>', 'If you''d have placed the sun directly behind the buildings, would their outline have been sharper? That certainly would have avoided the unhelpful white blob. The black silhouette on the left doesn''t help that much, either. But, beyond these quibbles, this is a potentially very good image. I like the attempt at combining motifs rather than just shoot a straightforward subject. 7', '2005-05-17 10:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1391240, 177983, 9073, '<td valign="top">My only question is: 1/ how would this have worked if the fisherman had been used to connect the sea with the sky? I''m not fond of this border.  Otherwise, a lovely image.  8</td>', 'My only question is: 1/ how would this have worked if the fisherman had been used to connect the sea with the sky? I''m not fond of this border.  Otherwise, a lovely image.  8', '2005-05-17 10:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
