(1391474, 178295, 2764, '<td valign="top">This sky is truely gorgeous. Sunsets rarely translate to photographs as vividy as they appeared but this one does.  the trick is to put something visually interesting in the forground.  your sunset is lovely but the trees and telephone poles silouetted are not. my guess is that your photo will be marked down for subject matter of the silouette and not technical aspects.</td>', 'This sky is truely gorgeous. Sunsets rarely translate to photographs as vividy as they appeared but this one does.  the trick is to put something visually interesting in the forground.  your sunset is lovely but the trees and telephone poles silouetted are not. my guess is that your photo will be marked down for subject matter of the silouette and not technical aspects.', '2005-05-17 11:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
