(1391874, 178484, 19010, '<td valign="top">This is a great silhoutte but it seems be be drowned out a little by all of the other bright photos in the challenge. I almost over looked this one. Two things I would like to see different in the shot. The first I think that I would have tried to leave the fence out. I have never found the seeing anything captive is better than in the wild. Second one you have no control over. I think some more fog and a slightlt tighter crop would have been great. Over a very enjoyable shot that I enjoyed viewing and voting on.</td>', 'This is a great silhoutte but it seems be be drowned out a little by all of the other bright photos in the challenge. I almost over looked this one. Two things I would like to see different in the shot. The first I think that I would have tried to leave the fence out. I have never found the seeing anything captive is better than in the wild. Second one you have no control over. I think some more fog and a slightlt tighter crop would have been great. Over a very enjoyable shot that I enjoyed viewing and voting on.', '2005-05-17 14:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
