(1392193, 178572, 25655, '<td valign="top">How dramatic!<br/>Wonderful POV, amazing sky, I love the sepia tones here.<br/>at my first round over this photo, I thought I didn''t like that other horse in the background. But at second round I think it''s adding more life to the scene, and more perspective. So bumping up... from 9 to 10.</td>', 'How dramatic!Wonderful POV, amazing sky, I love the sepia tones here.at my first round over this photo, I thought I didn''t like that other horse in the background. But at second round I think it''s adding more life to the scene, and more perspective. So bumping up... from 9 to 10.', '2005-05-17 17:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392195, 176199, 32378, '<td valign="top">There isn''t enough contrast between the sky and the bird. Makes the sky appear underexposed.</td>', 'There isn''t enough contrast between the sky and the bird. Makes the sky appear underexposed.', '2005-05-17 17:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392196, 178587, 32378, '<td valign="top">Need more light in the sky so that the backround of the trees isn''t so dark.</td>', 'Need more light in the sky so that the backround of the trees isn''t so dark.', '2005-05-17 17:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392198, 177770, 32378, '<td valign="top">I think you need a little bit larger subject to block more of the sun</td>', 'I think you need a little bit larger subject to block more of the sun', '2005-05-17 17:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392199, 177703, 9668, '<td valign="top">Took this on May 10th, eh? I shot the same sunset for this challenge at a different location. I like the water patterns and the placement of Haystack Rock. The rock in the foreground (which I do recognize &lt;grin&gt;) is places in kindof an odd position, IMHO. It seems to blend to much with the Haystack, maybe a little higher position or a further back view would give it a little more clarity. Overall, I love the shot (what can I say? It is my favorite subject).  I also that it will be funny when you get a bunch of "This is Zoomdak" and "That darn beach" comments.</td>', 'Took this on May 10th, eh? I shot the same sunset for this challenge at a different location. I like the water patterns and the placement of Haystack Rock. The rock in the foreground (which I do recognize <grin>) is places in kindof an odd position, IMHO. It seems to blend to much with the Haystack, maybe a little higher position or a further back view would give it a little more clarity. Overall, I love the shot (what can I say? It is my favorite subject).  I also that it will be funny when you get a bunch of "This is Zoomdak" and "That darn beach" comments.', '2005-05-17 17:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392201, 178567, 32378, '<td valign="top">The sky looks underexposed.</td>', 'The sky looks underexposed.', '2005-05-17 17:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392202, 178323, 35645, '<td valign="top">Wow. Terrific detail on this one!  Cool.</td>', 'Wow. Terrific detail on this one!  Cool.', '2005-05-17 17:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392203, 178045, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool silhoutte motion, don''t normally see motion like that in a silhoutte. Sweet background as well, although IMO it is a bit off color.</td>', 'Cool silhoutte motion, don''t normally see motion like that in a silhoutte. Sweet background as well, although IMO it is a bit off color.', '2005-05-17 17:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392204, 177905, 32378, '<td valign="top">This looks either underexposed or taken too late in the day.  Need more contrast between the subject and backround.  I can''t even tell if this was back lit or not because the lighting is so even.</td>', 'This looks either underexposed or taken too late in the day.  Need more contrast between the subject and backround.  I can''t even tell if this was back lit or not because the lighting is so even.', '2005-05-17 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392208, 178574, 31443, '<td valign="top">Don''t see silhouette of anything here?</td>', 'Don''t see silhouette of anything here?', '2005-05-17 17:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392209, 176208, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice tree shot, looks like a coming sunset/or post sunrise in the background. Composition is nice, but the shot doesn''t really have a "Wow!" factor that DPC likes. And this is really the step that makes photos score great. I like it though =)</td>', 'Nice tree shot, looks like a coming sunset/or post sunrise in the background. Composition is nice, but the shot doesn''t really have a "Wow!" factor that DPC likes. And this is really the step that makes photos score great. I like it though =)', '2005-05-17 17:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392211, 177970, 35645, '<td valign="top">This one would be much better if the area around the egret(?) wasn''t as busy. As it stands now it''s difficult to separate the bird from the vegetation.</td>', 'This one would be much better if the area around the egret(?) wasn''t as busy. As it stands now it''s difficult to separate the bird from the vegetation.', '2005-05-17 17:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392212, 177979, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like being able to see some of the lighthouse.  However, I wish it didn''t appear to be leaning.</td>', 'I like being able to see some of the lighthouse.  However, I wish it didn''t appear to be leaning.', '2005-05-17 17:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392213, 178560, 9668, '<td valign="top">My perception of the horizon is a bit titled. Awesome sunset! Great capture of the moment.</td>', 'My perception of the horizon is a bit titled. Awesome sunset! Great capture of the moment.', '2005-05-17 17:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392218, 178514, 32378, '<td valign="top">I think I would have tried to get the sun behind on of the trees.</td>', 'I think I would have tried to get the sun behind on of the trees.', '2005-05-17 17:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392219, 178358, 35645, '<td valign="top">I like this photo...except for the streetlight. Nice colors, good DOF, meets the challenge, good detail in the water, pretty clouds. I just don''t like the streetlight.</td>', 'I like this photo...except for the streetlight. Nice colors, good DOF, meets the challenge, good detail in the water, pretty clouds. I just don''t like the streetlight.', '2005-05-17 17:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
