(1392294, 177358, 35746, '<td valign="top">there has been a debate going on for days in the forums about whether or not titles help a photos score...i never read them as a rule...i happened to check your title after noticing the hysterical placment of the sun(as if you had control of that) and fell off my chair...great job great shot great title..."10"</td>', 'there has been a debate going on for days in the forums about whether or not titles help a photos score...i never read them as a rule...i happened to check your title after noticing the hysterical placment of the sun(as if you had control of that) and fell off my chair...great job great shot great title..."10"', '2005-05-17 17:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392296, 177703, 28662, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo--I can almost feel the tide washing over my feet as I stand there.</td>', 'Beautiful photo--I can almost feel the tide washing over my feet as I stand there.', '2005-05-17 17:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392301, 178478, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!   The aMAZING sky and colors  that don''t look fake), make what might be too ordinary of a silhouette picture STRIKING!   I love it!!!</td>', 'Very pretty!   The aMAZING sky and colors  that don''t look fake), make what might be too ordinary of a silhouette picture STRIKING!   I love it!!!', '2005-05-17 17:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
