(1392306, 177924, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is SO pretty!   This is one of  the kinds of pictures I imagine when I think of a beautiful, perfect silhouette picture.  Your sky cooperated so perfectly for you to give you such a dramatic photo.   I love it!</td>', 'That is SO pretty!   This is one of  the kinds of pictures I imagine when I think of a beautiful, perfect silhouette picture.  Your sky cooperated so perfectly for you to give you such a dramatic photo.   I love it!', '2005-05-17 17:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392311, 177956, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is very beautiful!</td>', 'That is very beautiful!', '2005-05-17 17:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392315, 178452, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What an unusual, incredible photo!   It''s amazing how you got perfect lighting on the flower and such a great silhouette of the face.   I really like it alot!</td>', 'Wow!  What an unusual, incredible photo!   It''s amazing how you got perfect lighting on the flower and such a great silhouette of the face.   I really like it alot!', '2005-05-17 17:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392317, 178520, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!   The blues are so serene, and the white clouds so contrasting to the dark silhouette.   I love the composition of the silhouette right in front of the sun.  Beautiful photo!  10</td>', 'I love this photo!   The blues are so serene, and the white clouds so contrasting to the dark silhouette.   I love the composition of the silhouette right in front of the sun.  Beautiful photo!  10', '2005-05-17 17:57:42.000000', NULL, 1);
