(1392321, 177263, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a BEAUTIFUL, amazing photo.   I love everything about it.    The colors, the perfect, focused sun,  the waves.  The reflection of the pier on the wet sand.   Great job.  10</td>', 'This is a BEAUTIFUL, amazing photo.   I love everything about it.    The colors, the perfect, focused sun,  the waves.  The reflection of the pier on the wet sand.   Great job.  10', '2005-05-17 17:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
