(1392345, 177983, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible photo!  I love the minimalistic feel to the silhouette.   It''s just the perfect enhancement to that aMAZING sunset and ocean.   This would get a 20 from me if we had it  :)</td>', 'This is an incredible photo!  I love the minimalistic feel to the silhouette.   It''s just the perfect enhancement to that aMAZING sunset and ocean.   This would get a 20 from me if we had it  :)', '2005-05-17 18:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
