(1392368, 178362, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!   I really have a soft spot for good duck pictures   I love the dreamy effect of this with such a great reflection of the silhouette in the water.   It looks like there''s smoke on the water. . . a really cool effect!    I love this picture!</td>', 'Wow!   I really have a soft spot for good duck pictures   I love the dreamy effect of this with such a great reflection of the silhouette in the water.   It looks like there''s smoke on the water. . . a really cool effect!    I love this picture!', '2005-05-17 18:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
