(1392633, 177172, 6999, '<td valign="top">I find the strangth of this image in the light at the fringes of the grasses, which somewhat works against the idea of silhouettte I fear. It''s a fine shot, however, certainly worthy off placing well in this company; though it perhaps lacks that edge of the very special - some, perhaps compositional, element to contrast the delicate shapes of the grasses, to put them into context.</td>', 'I find the strangth of this image in the light at the fringes of the grasses, which somewhat works against the idea of silhouettte I fear. It''s a fine shot, however, certainly worthy off placing well in this company; though it perhaps lacks that edge of the very special - some, perhaps compositional, element to contrast the delicate shapes of the grasses, to put them into context.', '2005-05-17 20:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392635, 177092, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neat and clean, works well, although the idea is a touch straightforward perhaps.</td>', 'Neat and clean, works well, although the idea is a touch straightforward perhaps.', '2005-05-17 20:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392640, 178328, 37529, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I think the photo would have been better without the building.  Seemed distracting to me.</td>', 'Very nice.  I think the photo would have been better without the building.  Seemed distracting to me.', '2005-05-17 20:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392643, 176524, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very close to being a lovely shot - very. Perhaps just letting the guy take one more step would have clinched it? I feel that he''s so dominated by the lighthouse that he really needs to poccupy a terribly strong area of frame to compete for our attention; I would love for his shadow to have paralleled the motion through frame of the lighthouse''s shadow. But there''s a lot of good things here - don''t be put down by my longing for perfection from you :-)</td>', 'Very close to being a lovely shot - very. Perhaps just letting the guy take one more step would have clinched it? I feel that he''s so dominated by the lighthouse that he really needs to poccupy a terribly strong area of frame to compete for our attention; I would love for his shadow to have paralleled the motion through frame of the lighthouse''s shadow. But there''s a lot of good things here - don''t be put down by my longing for perfection from you :-)', '2005-05-17 20:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392645, 177475, 37529, '<td valign="top">I think you nailed this shot.  Very tranquil and excellent composition.</td>', 'I think you nailed this shot.  Very tranquil and excellent composition.', '2005-05-17 20:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392648, 178368, 37529, '<td valign="top">Another excellent shot.  One of the best I think.</td>', 'Another excellent shot.  One of the best I think.', '2005-05-17 20:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392653, 178271, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen this graphic trick with hands before, and now two ... a proper silhouette, and excellently done; I would have more interest in frame to give top marks - more reality, less studio.</td>', 'I''ve never seen this graphic trick with hands before, and now two ... a proper silhouette, and excellently done; I would have more interest in frame to give top marks - more reality, less studio.', '2005-05-17 20:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
