(1392733, 178258, 9906, '<td valign="top">It appears to me that you have overprocessed this to get the feeling of a silhouette without having a silhouette to begin with.  I could be wrong.  It''s just my gut feeling about it.<br/>TC</td>', 'It appears to me that you have overprocessed this to get the feeling of a silhouette without having a silhouette to begin with.  I could be wrong.  It''s just my gut feeling about it.TC', '2005-05-17 20:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
