(1392739, 178565, 9906, '<td valign="top">When I cyber crop this tighter on the screen to get rid of the dark sky portion on the left and the stupid plane trails in the top portion of the sky, I come up with a much more potent IMHO composition.  Nice sky colors that don''t appear to be so oversaturated as some of the other sunset shots in this challenge.<br/>TC</td>', 'When I cyber crop this tighter on the screen to get rid of the dark sky portion on the left and the stupid plane trails in the top portion of the sky, I come up with a much more potent IMHO composition.  Nice sky colors that don''t appear to be so oversaturated as some of the other sunset shots in this challenge.TC', '2005-05-17 20:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1392741, 176200, 9906, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame that the models head dissappears into the dark background...  Nicely composed.  Love the splash of blue against the overall sepia tonality.<br/>TC</td>', 'It''s a shame that the models head dissappears into the dark background...  Nicely composed.  Love the splash of blue against the overall sepia tonality.TC', '2005-05-17 20:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
