(1394202, 177335, 36495, '<td valign="top">Very niec colors. Some people do not like sunrises or sunsets as much on here, but I love them. Especially if I have to get up very early and hike a few miles to get a pic...it makes an average pic have more meaning to me. To me, the photograph not only captures the image that is seen through the viewfinder but also reminds of the day I took it and the emotions I had the time. This shot makes me feel like I was there. Weird, anyways, nice shot.</td>', 'Very niec colors. Some people do not like sunrises or sunsets as much on here, but I love them. Especially if I have to get up very early and hike a few miles to get a pic...it makes an average pic have more meaning to me. To me, the photograph not only captures the image that is seen through the viewfinder but also reminds of the day I took it and the emotions I had the time. This shot makes me feel like I was there. Weird, anyways, nice shot.', '2005-05-18 08:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
