(1394344, 177723, 19978, '<td valign="top">I love your idea here but the execution just doesn''t seem to speak loudly enough. The softly blurred city background is much stronger than the silhouetted couple and constantly draws attention away. I''m sure you went for the portrait crop because of the beautifully lit tower, and I can''t argue with that. However, the overall image makes me want to like it a lot more than I actually do.</td>', 'I love your idea here but the execution just doesn''t seem to speak loudly enough. The softly blurred city background is much stronger than the silhouetted couple and constantly draws attention away. I''m sure you went for the portrait crop because of the beautifully lit tower, and I can''t argue with that. However, the overall image makes me want to like it a lot more than I actually do.', '2005-05-18 10:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394345, 176889, 19010, '<td valign="top">Very emotive photo.  Great silhouette work with a crisp outline and interesting lighting. I understand the idea of the musicial walking away with his head down, but it just dosn''t work well for me I don''t find the pose to be very flattering. Otherwise very nice silhouette.</td>', 'Very emotive photo.  Great silhouette work with a crisp outline and interesting lighting. I understand the idea of the musicial walking away with his head down, but it just dosn''t work well for me I don''t find the pose to be very flattering. Otherwise very nice silhouette.', '2005-05-18 10:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
