(1394763, 176252, 19010, '<td valign="top">The golds and oranges are just great. I love the way they work to give this a sci-fi feel. Fery unique and greative idea. The silhouettes are very crisp and defined. I would like to have seen a little less of the black on the bottom and maybe a few less wires. The wires work well it is just a couple to many for the eyes to move smoothly over them. Winderfull shot! 8</td>', 'The golds and oranges are just great. I love the way they work to give this a sci-fi feel. Fery unique and greative idea. The silhouettes are very crisp and defined. I would like to have seen a little less of the black on the bottom and maybe a few less wires. The wires work well it is just a couple to many for the eyes to move smoothly over them. Winderfull shot! 8', '2005-05-18 12:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394775, 178245, 19010, '<td valign="top">While not the most crisp of the silhouettes, this is definately one of the most interesting ones. I just cant get enough of the fiery cloud of dust that trails the highspeed elephant. Absolutaly wonderfull job!</td>', 'While not the most crisp of the silhouettes, this is definately one of the most interesting ones. I just cant get enough of the fiery cloud of dust that trails the highspeed elephant. Absolutaly wonderfull job!', '2005-05-18 12:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394786, 178560, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great motion carture. This is a tough shot to get i would imagine. Silhouettes are tricky enough but a stop motion one. Those are a little toughter. Great color, crisp outlines, and an enjoyable shot to look at. I would like to have seen a little more of the jumper though He is such a key element to the shot yet he is mostly hidden by the background. So please retake this and tell the ball player to jump higher next time : ) Great shot. very nicely done.</td>', 'Great motion carture. This is a tough shot to get i would imagine. Silhouettes are tricky enough but a stop motion one. Those are a little toughter. Great color, crisp outlines, and an enjoyable shot to look at. I would like to have seen a little more of the jumper though He is such a key element to the shot yet he is mostly hidden by the background. So please retake this and tell the ball player to jump higher next time : ) Great shot. very nicely done.', '2005-05-18 12:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394795, 178548, 19010, '<td valign="top">No fair! You just knew there was a surfer on this site and that you would be able to get a good score of of him for thi wonderfull shot. (8) I would have gone higher but I cant help but wonder if this was shot at a different angle would you have captured more of the gold in the waves. Sharp lines on the silhouettes and a wonderfull rich golden color on the sand. Great shot!!</td>', 'No fair! You just knew there was a surfer on this site and that you would be able to get a good score of of him for thi wonderfull shot. (8) I would have gone higher but I cant help but wonder if this was shot at a different angle would you have captured more of the gold in the waves. Sharp lines on the silhouettes and a wonderfull rich golden color on the sand. Great shot!!', '2005-05-18 12:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394814, 177924, 19010, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Spectacular colors, crisp silhouette. The Only thing I dislike is how small the windmill is in the phot. I wish there was someway to make it more promenant without loosing any of that wonderfull sky. Very well done.</td>', 'Very nice. Spectacular colors, crisp silhouette. The Only thing I dislike is how small the windmill is in the phot. I wish there was someway to make it more promenant without loosing any of that wonderfull sky. Very well done.', '2005-05-18 12:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
