(1395353, 177263, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  Love the colors.  I have to admit that I saw this photo prior to seeing a second photo of the exact same surfer (different pose), pier, sunset, etc.  This one is much better than the other (IMHO), however, I was curious - did you spouse perhaps take the other one???  :-)  It was good too, but didn''t have the same impact on me that this one does.</td>', 'Very nice shot!  Love the colors.  I have to admit that I saw this photo prior to seeing a second photo of the exact same surfer (different pose), pier, sunset, etc.  This one is much better than the other (IMHO), however, I was curious - did you spouse perhaps take the other one???  :-)  It was good too, but didn''t have the same impact on me that this one does.', '2005-05-18 14:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1395359, 176595, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! I love the detail that''s available to the inquiring eye (i.e., the toering).  She''s a lovely girl and you can JUST make out a little detail of her face &amp; expression.  (9)<br/> <br/>I keep coming back to this shot...  I''m not sure why, but it has a very alluring quality about it (and I''m a gay man, so it''s not the sex appeal! LOL).  I really think it''s the amazing shape of her body - very unusual.  I''m changing it to a 10 because it seemed to really capture this girl''s soul.  Outstanding job.  (10)</td>', 'Beautiful shot! I love the detail that''s available to the inquiring eye (i.e., the toering).  She''s a lovely girl and you can JUST make out a little detail of her face & expression.  (9) I keep coming back to this shot...  I''m not sure why, but it has a very alluring quality about it (and I''m a gay man, so it''s not the sex appeal! LOL).  I really think it''s the amazing shape of her body - very unusual.  I''m changing it to a 10 because it seemed to really capture this girl''s soul.  Outstanding job.  (10)', '2005-05-18 15:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1395365, 177492, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think this may have been better in color, because it''s just not doing much for me (IMHO).  Yes, it''s a silhouette, but it doesn''t seem to have a focal point of action, interest, etc. (unless you''re really into choppers - and I''m sorry, but I''m not).  It''s cool that you were able to capture the propellers at a standstill - must have been a very fast shutter speed - and I think the sky loses a lot by being in b/w.  I''m sure I would have scored it much higher if it was in color. (3)</td>', 'I think this may have been better in color, because it''s just not doing much for me (IMHO).  Yes, it''s a silhouette, but it doesn''t seem to have a focal point of action, interest, etc. (unless you''re really into choppers - and I''m sorry, but I''m not).  It''s cool that you were able to capture the propellers at a standstill - must have been a very fast shutter speed - and I think the sky loses a lot by being in b/w.  I''m sure I would have scored it much higher if it was in color. (3)', '2005-05-18 15:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1395404, 177672, 34247, '<td valign="top">Excellent feel and tonality. I love the intensity of colors, the angle of shot, the general composition, the posture and background. Only nitpick would be the wires running in the background, and perhaps the poles supporting them. 10</td>', 'Excellent feel and tonality. I love the intensity of colors, the angle of shot, the general composition, the posture and background. Only nitpick would be the wires running in the background, and perhaps the poles supporting them. 10', '2005-05-18 15:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
