(1396112, 178514, 31036, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2005-05-18 19:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396114, 178565, 31036, '<td valign="top">stunning lighting and colors</td>', 'stunning lighting and colors', '2005-05-18 19:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396122, 177235, 31036, '<td valign="top">This is quite cool. The contrast was maybe tweaked a little much.</td>', 'This is quite cool. The contrast was maybe tweaked a little much.', '2005-05-18 19:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396127, 178033, 22046, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection and light.</td>', 'Very nice reflection and light.', '2005-05-18 19:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396130, 177235, 22046, '<td valign="top">I like your use of shadow elements as part of the composition.</td>', 'I like your use of shadow elements as part of the composition.', '2005-05-18 19:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396134, 177263, 22046, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to be there.</td>', 'Makes me want to be there.', '2005-05-18 19:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396157, 178529, 35645, '<td valign="top">Only thing that detracts from this image IMO is that it is cropped very tight on the right. Otherwise this is a fine picture.</td>', 'Only thing that detracts from this image IMO is that it is cropped very tight on the right. Otherwise this is a fine picture.', '2005-05-18 19:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396159, 177358, 31036, '<td valign="top">If you hadn''t mentioned the "balls of fire" in the title, I never would have noticed ;)<br/> <br/>The composition is nothing but perfect. I could just imagine the full smile of the man. I rarely run across a photo where the feelings of the subjects are so strongly conveyed through composition. Going in my favs.</td>', 'If you hadn''t mentioned the "balls of fire" in the title, I never would have noticed ;) The composition is nothing but perfect. I could just imagine the full smile of the man. I rarely run across a photo where the feelings of the subjects are so strongly conveyed through composition. Going in my favs.', '2005-05-18 19:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396167, 177475, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset. Wish the silhouette of the fisherman was a little more defined and did not blend in with the treeline quite so much. Gorgeous color and detail in the water. Beautiful composition.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset. Wish the silhouette of the fisherman was a little more defined and did not blend in with the treeline quite so much. Gorgeous color and detail in the water. Beautiful composition.', '2005-05-18 19:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396171, 178486, 31036, '<td valign="top">Great!</td>', 'Great!', '2005-05-18 19:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396177, 176450, 31036, '<td valign="top">Wow. I''m speechless.</td>', 'Wow. I''m speechless.', '2005-05-18 19:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396183, 178243, 35645, '<td valign="top">Awesome pic! Beautiful colors, and I love the angle at which this was shot. Great detail in the bridges. I predict top 10 for this one. 10 from me.<br/>PS - Is this Charleston, SC?</td>', 'Awesome pic! Beautiful colors, and I love the angle at which this was shot. Great detail in the bridges. I predict top 10 for this one. 10 from me.PS - Is this Charleston, SC?', '2005-05-18 19:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396189, 177623, 31036, '<td valign="top">You know, I would say this fits the challenge even if the reflections weren''t present, as the engravings are silhouettes of the individuals they represent.</td>', 'You know, I would say this fits the challenge even if the reflections weren''t present, as the engravings are silhouettes of the individuals they represent.', '2005-05-18 19:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396191, 177924, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very nice pic. Love the clouds. Border works well with this one.</td>', 'Very nice pic. Love the clouds. Border works well with this one.', '2005-05-18 19:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396195, 178532, 31036, '<td valign="top">Fake bug, ain''t it... ; ) Nice composition.</td>', 'Fake bug, ain''t it... ; ) Nice composition.', '2005-05-18 19:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396201, 178493, 31036, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know where this was taken...</td>', 'I''d like to know where this was taken...', '2005-05-18 19:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396209, 178356, 31036, '<td valign="top">EXCLAMATION! I''m sensing a ribbon or at least a op ten spot. Stunning.</td>', 'EXCLAMATION! I''m sensing a ribbon or at least a op ten spot. Stunning.', '2005-05-18 19:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396211, 178482, 35645, '<td valign="top">The lighting around the cross is exquisite. I think I would prefer a different crop for this pic, though. The dark clouds and trees on the right give the pic an unbalanced feel. Perhaps a crop with just the church and spire would give this a cleaner ''feel'', but hta''s just my opinion.</td>', 'The lighting around the cross is exquisite. I think I would prefer a different crop for this pic, though. The dark clouds and trees on the right give the pic an unbalanced feel. Perhaps a crop with just the church and spire would give this a cleaner ''feel'', but hta''s just my opinion.', '2005-05-18 19:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396219, 178565, 35645, '<td valign="top">Awesome sunset! Buildings seem a little out of focus to me. Don''t care for the border. Gorgeous color, though.</td>', 'Awesome sunset! Buildings seem a little out of focus to me. Don''t care for the border. Gorgeous color, though.', '2005-05-18 19:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396228, 178562, 31036, '<td valign="top">It sort of appears as if the model is acting "gangsta."  "Come on water... just try to splash me. You best watch yo back."  ; )<br/> <br/>It''s actually an impressively beautiful photo.</td>', 'It sort of appears as if the model is acting "gangsta."  "Come on water... just try to splash me. You best watch yo back."  ; ) It''s actually an impressively beautiful photo.', '2005-05-18 19:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396233, 178588, 35645, '<td valign="top">I have 2 bones to pick with this photo. 1) the sun and reflected light on the water are too bright. 2 The water around the seagull is too dark, which makes the bird and piling difficult to see. I do like the boat, and the clouds around the island (?) are really pretty.</td>', 'I have 2 bones to pick with this photo. 1) the sun and reflected light on the water are too bright. 2 The water around the seagull is too dark, which makes the bird and piling difficult to see. I do like the boat, and the clouds around the island (?) are really pretty.', '2005-05-18 19:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396234, 176243, 31036, '<td valign="top">I feel your pain ; )</td>', 'I feel your pain ; )', '2005-05-18 19:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396243, 178572, 31036, '<td valign="top">Simply put, this is my definition of a 10.</td>', 'Simply put, this is my definition of a 10.', '2005-05-18 19:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396283, 177465, 31036, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition.</td>', 'Perfect composition.', '2005-05-18 19:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396304, 177122, 32997, '<td valign="top">Beautiful-love your colour balance.</td>', 'Beautiful-love your colour balance.', '2005-05-18 19:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396306, 177738, 31036, '<td valign="top">scalvert, is that you? If it''s not, I''m in for a reasonable amount of embarassment.<br/> <br/>I''m guessing cardboard props with a red led or jewel as the eye. The background, though... can''t wait to hear how this was done. 10</td>', 'scalvert, is that you? If it''s not, I''m in for a reasonable amount of embarassment. I''m guessing cardboard props with a red led or jewel as the eye. The background, though... can''t wait to hear how this was done. 10', '2005-05-18 19:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396318, 176595, 31036, '<td valign="top">very sensual. the red is perfect, the composition is perfect, the lighting is perfect. well done.</td>', 'very sensual. the red is perfect, the composition is perfect, the lighting is perfect. well done.', '2005-05-18 19:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396356, 176200, 31036, '<td valign="top">Just thought I''d say that I''ll be reading "A long time ago..." on the big screen at midnight tonight.</td>', 'Just thought I''d say that I''ll be reading "A long time ago..." on the big screen at midnight tonight.', '2005-05-18 20:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396367, 178576, 30214, '<td valign="top">great composition and colors</td>', 'great composition and colors', '2005-05-18 20:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396370, 178335, 30214, '<td valign="top">i am not sure I understand the title, but a greate image nonetheless, one of my favorites</td>', 'i am not sure I understand the title, but a greate image nonetheless, one of my favorites', '2005-05-18 20:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396373, 178460, 30214, '<td valign="top">a perfect silhouette. Very "minimalistic". One of my favorites.</td>', 'a perfect silhouette. Very "minimalistic". One of my favorites.', '2005-05-18 20:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396392, 177879, 22533, '<td valign="top">More contrast would have blackened the ferris wheel more, therefore fitting the challenge better. Still a nice shot though.</td>', 'More contrast would have blackened the ferris wheel more, therefore fitting the challenge better. Still a nice shot though.', '2005-05-18 20:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396491, 176797, 13688, '<td valign="top">I really like the guy on the right''s body language and expression.  I wish the other guy had his arm down.</td>', 'I really like the guy on the right''s body language and expression.  I wish the other guy had his arm down.', '2005-05-18 21:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396553, 178258, 13688, '<td valign="top">The strange angle is very intriguing.  It seems like the bird should be falling backwards off the branch.  I''m guessing you cropped down alot, but with the b/w and the artifacts that became more apparent, it adds to the mystique of the shot for me.    I''m also guessing from the title, the artisticness of this shot was perhaps unintended.  Looking at it more closely, perhaps I''m completely wrong and you just added a plastic type filter and then upped the contrast?  Regardless of the intention I do enjoy it.</td>', 'The strange angle is very intriguing.  It seems like the bird should be falling backwards off the branch.  I''m guessing you cropped down alot, but with the b/w and the artifacts that became more apparent, it adds to the mystique of the shot for me.    I''m also guessing from the title, the artisticness of this shot was perhaps unintended.  Looking at it more closely, perhaps I''m completely wrong and you just added a plastic type filter and then upped the contrast?  Regardless of the intention I do enjoy it.', '2005-05-18 21:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396560, 178499, 13688, '<td valign="top">That appears to be a very strong sunset you had to work with.  I find myself wondering what would have happened if you showed more of the scene and kept the natural colors</td>', 'That appears to be a very strong sunset you had to work with.  I find myself wondering what would have happened if you showed more of the scene and kept the natural colors', '2005-05-18 21:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396578, 177491, 13688, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Like the b/w.  Would have liked to see it with the bottom fern pulled down when you took the pic and with that middle black line at the bridge of the nose removed during processing</td>', 'Good idea.  Like the b/w.  Would have liked to see it with the bottom fern pulled down when you took the pic and with that middle black line at the bridge of the nose removed during processing', '2005-05-18 21:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396606, 178486, 13688, '<td valign="top">I like how the shape of the outer black conforms to her shape.  Would have liked to see less detail in the mode''l''s face and chest.  And if her fingers weren'' t visible, she would have looked like a pregnant venus de milo.  I''m thinking that would have been a cool idea.</td>', 'I like how the shape of the outer black conforms to her shape.  Would have liked to see less detail in the mode''l''s face and chest.  And if her fingers weren'' t visible, she would have looked like a pregnant venus de milo.  I''m thinking that would have been a cool idea.', '2005-05-18 21:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396661, 178293, 13688, '<td valign="top">Your  post-processing has made me stop and stare for a good 5 minutes.  This is very odd.    the forest feels like it''s on a movie screen being played behind the cat, who''s pin whole eye reflections make the scene even more surreal. Your title is extremely intriguing with no visible door in the pic. I wish the cat was more centered in the tree opening and you probably wish I posted my comments sober.</td>', 'Your  post-processing has made me stop and stare for a good 5 minutes.  This is very odd.    the forest feels like it''s on a movie screen being played behind the cat, who''s pin whole eye reflections make the scene even more surreal. Your title is extremely intriguing with no visible door in the pic. I wish the cat was more centered in the tree opening and you probably wish I posted my comments sober.', '2005-05-18 21:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396681, 178436, 13688, '<td valign="top">Perhaps I have my monitor set to dark because I don''t want anyone complaining about my pics, but I think this could have been a stellar shot if there was some more light on the water.  Oh and if possible I would have liked to see the full reflections of the longer posts and a bit less sky</td>', 'Perhaps I have my monitor set to dark because I don''t want anyone complaining about my pics, but I think this could have been a stellar shot if there was some more light on the water.  Oh and if possible I would have liked to see the full reflections of the longer posts and a bit less sky', '2005-05-18 21:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396690, 177660, 13688, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Wish you had taken turned the entire foreground to full black in post-processing</td>', 'Great composition.  Wish you had taken turned the entire foreground to full black in post-processing', '2005-05-18 21:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396786, 178158, 11738, '<td valign="top">This seems oversharpened.  weird haloing around both arms and hands.</td>', 'This seems oversharpened.  weird haloing around both arms and hands.', '2005-05-18 22:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396793, 177890, 11738, '<td valign="top">Should have cloned out that love handle.</td>', 'Should have cloned out that love handle.', '2005-05-18 22:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396798, 177664, 11738, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but I think I would have liked to see this with the blue toned down just a little.</td>', 'Cool shot, but I think I would have liked to see this with the blue toned down just a little.', '2005-05-18 22:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396817, 178033, 32345, '<td valign="top">Great picture, one of my rare 10, well done and good luck.</td>', 'Great picture, one of my rare 10, well done and good luck.', '2005-05-18 22:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396819, 177952, 32345, '<td valign="top">Great picture, one of my rare 10, well done and good luck.</td>', 'Great picture, one of my rare 10, well done and good luck.', '2005-05-18 22:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396832, 178496, 13688, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting.  At first glance,  I thought your fish had passed, but I''m guessing it would be floating if that were the case.  The mood i''m stiil getting is post life.  Anyway since you decided to cut off the base, I''m left trying to figure out why you decided to show so much of the stem.</td>', 'Superb lighting.  At first glance,  I thought your fish had passed, but I''m guessing it would be floating if that were the case.  The mood i''m stiil getting is post life.  Anyway since you decided to cut off the base, I''m left trying to figure out why you decided to show so much of the stem.', '2005-05-18 22:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396837, 178492, 6519, '<td valign="top">There is so much I like about this photo - the composition, the dynamics, the details, background etc. It''s just all around enjoyable. I''ve come back to bump it up.</td>', 'There is so much I like about this photo - the composition, the dynamics, the details, background etc. It''s just all around enjoyable. I''ve come back to bump it up.', '2005-05-18 22:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396846, 178489, 6519, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, I don''t even mind the VERY white right hand edge. Nice composition and background.</td>', 'Lovely photo, I don''t even mind the VERY white right hand edge. Nice composition and background.', '2005-05-18 22:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396849, 176117, 6519, '<td valign="top">Classic silhouette. Tells a story. I like the graduated background.</td>', 'Classic silhouette. Tells a story. I like the graduated background.', '2005-05-18 22:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396853, 178132, 6519, '<td valign="top">Beautiful well balanced simplicity.</td>', 'Beautiful well balanced simplicity.', '2005-05-18 22:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396863, 178046, 6519, '<td valign="top">What should be your subject - the person''s silhouette - is in this case very secondary due to the grandeur of Mother Nature''s fascinating display. Nice colors.</td>', 'What should be your subject - the person''s silhouette - is in this case very secondary due to the grandeur of Mother Nature''s fascinating display. Nice colors.', '2005-05-18 23:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396868, 178447, 6519, '<td valign="top">This could have been a lovely silhouette , but there is far too much light and detail  to qualify as silhouette.</td>', 'This could have been a lovely silhouette , but there is far too much light and detail  to qualify as silhouette.', '2005-05-18 23:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396872, 177796, 6519, '<td valign="top">Dark, but too much detail to count as silhouette. Your model is lovely and the composition is nice, too.</td>', 'Dark, but too much detail to count as silhouette. Your model is lovely and the composition is nice, too.', '2005-05-18 23:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1396884, 178367, 6519, '<td valign="top">I feel there is a bit too much light (and detail) on your subject to count as silhouette, but I love the composition and the mood.</td>', 'I feel there is a bit too much light (and detail) on your subject to count as silhouette, but I love the composition and the mood.', '2005-05-18 23:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
