(1397073, 178577, 1827, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, ...this is a difficult one.  I can''t for the life of me figure out what I''m looking at, and I''ve tried.  Underwater life?  Seems like many photos sown together, but then the colors are really so similar that I''m inclined to blieve it is all one image.  Originally I thought it''s not abstract enough to appeal to me as an abstract, but the fact that I keep coming back to look at it clearly proves I''m wrong there.  <br/> <br/>OK, I got up to answer the phone as I typed this comment and from across the room I got this idea: bank of monitors at an aquarium with the view obstructed by people walking by?</td>', 'Hmmm, ...this is a difficult one.  I can''t for the life of me figure out what I''m looking at, and I''ve tried.  Underwater life?  Seems like many photos sown together, but then the colors are really so similar that I''m inclined to blieve it is all one image.  Originally I thought it''s not abstract enough to appeal to me as an abstract, but the fact that I keep coming back to look at it clearly proves I''m wrong there.   OK, I got up to answer the phone as I typed this comment and from across the room I got this idea: bank of monitors at an aquarium with the view obstructed by people walking by?', '2005-05-19 00:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
