(1397157, 178353, 1827, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice.  I wish it weren''t pushed quite so much (I''m guessing that you enhanced the silhouette in post processing) - I''d prefer to see the teensiest bit of detail on the woman''s face.  ''course, others would vote you down for that.</td>', 'This is quite nice.  I wish it weren''t pushed quite so much (I''m guessing that you enhanced the silhouette in post processing) - I''d prefer to see the teensiest bit of detail on the woman''s face.  ''course, others would vote you down for that.', '2005-05-19 01:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
