(1397179, 178093, 811, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that apears more like digital art than photography to me.  If that was your aim -- congrats.  Doesn''t do a lot for me on any level, but I am impressed that you got it sliced so thin.  good luck in the challenge</td>', 'This is one of those shots that apears more like digital art than photography to me.  If that was your aim -- congrats.  Doesn''t do a lot for me on any level, but I am impressed that you got it sliced so thin.  good luck in the challenge', '2005-05-19 01:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397184, 178507, 811, '<td valign="top">For me personally, a tighter crop might have been more effective.  There is too much space in the lower left, but not enough to be truly effective negative space, I think.</td>', 'For me personally, a tighter crop might have been more effective.  There is too much space in the lower left, but not enough to be truly effective negative space, I think.', '2005-05-19 01:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397187, 177978, 811, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop to eliminate the window sill (?) would have made this a bit more effective, I believe.</td>', 'A tighter crop to eliminate the window sill (?) would have made this a bit more effective, I believe.', '2005-05-19 01:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397194, 178575, 811, '<td valign="top">Something about the pose looks unnatural to me -- almost like your subject was standing in such a way to get as much "silhouette" as possible, which in and of itself is not a bad thing, but it kinda looks like one of those police outlines you see on the pavement</td>', 'Something about the pose looks unnatural to me -- almost like your subject was standing in such a way to get as much "silhouette" as possible, which in and of itself is not a bad thing, but it kinda looks like one of those police outlines you see on the pavement', '2005-05-19 01:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397211, 177620, 811, '<td valign="top">The yellow doesn''t do a lot for me.  Perhaps in bw?</td>', 'The yellow doesn''t do a lot for me.  Perhaps in bw?', '2005-05-19 01:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397214, 177500, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting way to make a silhouette, but it comes across as being a bit flat -- or too much like digital art, and not enough like an actual photograph for my tastes.</td>', 'Interesting way to make a silhouette, but it comes across as being a bit flat -- or too much like digital art, and not enough like an actual photograph for my tastes.', '2005-05-19 01:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397217, 177447, 811, '<td valign="top">A bit of noise that is distracting, and the crop at the top seems a bit tight.</td>', 'A bit of noise that is distracting, and the crop at the top seems a bit tight.', '2005-05-19 01:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397220, 177491, 811, '<td valign="top">I find that the face and the leaves compete a bit too much for my attention.</td>', 'I find that the face and the leaves compete a bit too much for my attention.', '2005-05-19 01:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397222, 176255, 811, '<td valign="top">I think less blackness at the bottom and more sky showing would be more effective.  It feels bottom heavy to me, and a bit on the static side.</td>', 'I think less blackness at the bottom and more sky showing would be more effective.  It feels bottom heavy to me, and a bit on the static side.', '2005-05-19 01:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397236, 178382, 811, '<td valign="top">Difficult to tell exactly wha the silhouette is in this shot.  Good use of shadows, but the composition seems  a bit awkward to me</td>', 'Difficult to tell exactly wha the silhouette is in this shot.  Good use of shadows, but the composition seems  a bit awkward to me', '2005-05-19 01:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397244, 178566, 811, '<td valign="top">The hand on the right looks out of proportion to the person (whose arms also look out of proportion).  While it does technically meet the definiiton of silhouette, I think, it is still a bit "flat" as far as  pictures go.</td>', 'The hand on the right looks out of proportion to the person (whose arms also look out of proportion).  While it does technically meet the definiiton of silhouette, I think, it is still a bit "flat" as far as  pictures go.', '2005-05-19 01:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397248, 178393, 811, '<td valign="top">Quite a bit of noise to me, and not enough of the subject to hold my interest.</td>', 'Quite a bit of noise to me, and not enough of the subject to hold my interest.', '2005-05-19 01:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397251, 176889, 811, '<td valign="top">The pose of your subject looks terribly unnatural and even painful to me</td>', 'The pose of your subject looks terribly unnatural and even painful to me', '2005-05-19 01:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397252, 177505, 811, '<td valign="top">Good focus, but not a lot of captivating interest here</td>', 'Good focus, but not a lot of captivating interest here', '2005-05-19 01:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397254, 178258, 811, '<td valign="top">All of the different limbs make it difficult to focus on the main subject</td>', 'All of the different limbs make it difficult to focus on the main subject', '2005-05-19 01:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397256, 176447, 811, '<td valign="top">a tighter crop on the seeds would have added to the effect, I think</td>', 'a tighter crop on the seeds would have added to the effect, I think', '2005-05-19 01:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397258, 178530, 811, '<td valign="top">I looks like the silhouette/shadow of someone behind a wrinkled sheet.  OTher than that, there is not a lot here ot really grab the viewer''s attention and make them remember your shot.  Maybe a smoother "sheet" with a crisper focus/outline of the person, and even soem color would help make this more captivating.</td>', 'I looks like the silhouette/shadow of someone behind a wrinkled sheet.  OTher than that, there is not a lot here ot really grab the viewer''s attention and make them remember your shot.  Maybe a smoother "sheet" with a crisper focus/outline of the person, and even soem color would help make this more captivating.', '2005-05-19 01:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397262, 176129, 20889, '<td valign="top">For me the picture is good, for a over view point  , if the time of day was later. Putting the sun father down, I think you could have blocked the sun With no trees this image would have been far greater. This only from me, bumping up</td>', 'For me the picture is good, for a over view point  , if the time of day was later. Putting the sun father down, I think you could have blocked the sun With no trees this image would have been far greater. This only from me, bumping up', '2005-05-19 01:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397269, 177660, 20889, '<td valign="top">I think if you could have moved yourself to another position. Her and the tree would have been silhouetted togther. How about a 7</td>', 'I think if you could have moved yourself to another position. Her and the tree would have been silhouetted togther. How about a 7', '2005-05-19 01:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397278, 178328, 20889, '<td valign="top">This is were title and picture are a match. I myself can read it two different ways, so this is a plus for you and a 10 from me. keep up the good work!</td>', 'This is were title and picture are a match. I myself can read it two different ways, so this is a plus for you and a 10 from me. keep up the good work!', '2005-05-19 01:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397284, 178158, 20889, '<td valign="top">Good ideal, love the yor thinking. I think if your sky had some color...like some pinks this would have really rocked</td>', 'Good ideal, love the yor thinking. I think if your sky had some color...like some pinks this would have really rocked', '2005-05-19 01:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397291, 178568, 20889, '<td valign="top">For me this a good one and also would make a lighter image great also.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'For me this a good one and also would make a lighter image great also.Good luck.', '2005-05-19 02:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397339, 178544, 31443, '<td valign="top">Although so dark this image is wonderfully serene and calm</td>', 'Although so dark this image is wonderfully serene and calm', '2005-05-19 02:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397341, 177999, 31443, '<td valign="top">Great shot, looks like something out of an old National Geographic magazine. Something flying in the air on top left but unusually gives the photo an extra charm. Is this really snow or perhaps sand dunes, looking forward to finding out :)</td>', 'Great shot, looks like something out of an old National Geographic magazine. Something flying in the air on top left but unusually gives the photo an extra charm. Is this really snow or perhaps sand dunes, looking forward to finding out :)', '2005-05-19 02:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397343, 178290, 31443, '<td valign="top">So many similar images in the challenge but this one stands out, nicely done!</td>', 'So many similar images in the challenge but this one stands out, nicely done!', '2005-05-19 02:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397347, 178128, 31443, '<td valign="top">The clouds look grainy and sort of artificial in this photo and centralizing the subjects gives it this snapshot feel, from another angle would have been better imo...</td>', 'The clouds look grainy and sort of artificial in this photo and centralizing the subjects gives it this snapshot feel, from another angle would have been better imo...', '2005-05-19 02:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397369, 178256, 31443, '<td valign="top">Sorry to see you misunderstand the challenge...good luck next time</td>', 'Sorry to see you misunderstand the challenge...good luck next time', '2005-05-19 03:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397373, 177491, 31443, '<td valign="top">Photos of statues don´t impress me much although this one has an interesting shape, wish you had included more of the foliage though would have been a lot better imo</td>', 'Photos of statues don´t impress me much although this one has an interesting shape, wish you had included more of the foliage though would have been a lot better imo', '2005-05-19 03:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397380, 178560, 31443, '<td valign="top">Colors are impressive but the cropping is a little off, wish you had equally cut of part of the tree on the left to match the right one. Image is also tilted.</td>', 'Colors are impressive but the cropping is a little off, wish you had equally cut of part of the tree on the left to match the right one. Image is also tilted.', '2005-05-19 03:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397393, 176199, 31443, '<td valign="top">Coming back for a comment, you caught this little dove well and the silhouette is perfect... like the minimalist look as well, serene and calm.</td>', 'Coming back for a comment, you caught this little dove well and the silhouette is perfect... like the minimalist look as well, serene and calm.', '2005-05-19 03:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397419, 176082, 31443, '<td valign="top">Cute kid but you misunderstood the challenge apparently, too bad :(</td>', 'Cute kid but you misunderstood the challenge apparently, too bad :(', '2005-05-19 04:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397423, 178487, 31443, '<td valign="top">Silhouette or a shadow, what''s the difference? Anyway this is a beautifully composed photo</td>', 'Silhouette or a shadow, what''s the difference? Anyway this is a beautifully composed photo', '2005-05-19 04:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397426, 178245, 31443, '<td valign="top">Well done! Just wish you didn´t put the fram not needed at all......</td>', 'Well done! Just wish you didn´t put the fram not needed at all......', '2005-05-19 04:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397429, 178484, 31443, '<td valign="top">Probably not enough silhouette here, too bad since this is a beautiful scenery...</td>', 'Probably not enough silhouette here, too bad since this is a beautiful scenery...', '2005-05-19 04:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397443, 176129, 31443, '<td valign="top">Always heartwarming situation. Not too thrilled about the strong yellow light but than again it´s a silhoutte and that´s what is needed, great shot</td>', 'Always heartwarming situation. Not too thrilled about the strong yellow light but than again it´s a silhoutte and that´s what is needed, great shot', '2005-05-19 04:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397667, 178012, 22533, '<td valign="top">You could have cropped the lights out at the bottom, or cloned them out. Lovely colors.</td>', 'You could have cropped the lights out at the bottom, or cloned them out. Lovely colors.', '2005-05-19 09:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397669, 177693, 22533, '<td valign="top">Too dark, and the objects that should be silhouetted are the things lighted. Sorry.</td>', 'Too dark, and the objects that should be silhouetted are the things lighted. Sorry.', '2005-05-19 09:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397670, 178566, 22533, '<td valign="top">sharper edges would have been better. Classic idea though. Keep it up.</td>', 'sharper edges would have been better. Classic idea though. Keep it up.', '2005-05-19 09:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397674, 178324, 6814, '<td valign="top">If not for the title, I would have no idea what this is.  I think a good silhouette should be recognizable.</td>', 'If not for the title, I would have no idea what this is.  I think a good silhouette should be recognizable.', '2005-05-19 09:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397677, 178560, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice silhouette.  You definitely get it!  I especially like the pleasing colors of the sunset.  Very nice job!</td>', 'This is a very nice silhouette.  You definitely get it!  I especially like the pleasing colors of the sunset.  Very nice job!', '2005-05-19 09:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397680, 176450, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is another nice silhouette created with the setting sun.</td>', 'This is another nice silhouette created with the setting sun.', '2005-05-19 09:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397681, 177051, 6814, '<td valign="top">I fail to see how this can be considered a silhouette.</td>', 'I fail to see how this can be considered a silhouette.', '2005-05-19 09:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397682, 178264, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is a silhouette?</td>', 'This is a silhouette?', '2005-05-19 09:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397683, 178012, 6814, '<td valign="top">I like the purplish sunset colors.</td>', 'I like the purplish sunset colors.', '2005-05-19 09:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397684, 176528, 6814, '<td valign="top">The deep blue of the sky and the pinkish clouds really make this photograph!  Nice capture.</td>', 'The deep blue of the sky and the pinkish clouds really make this photograph!  Nice capture.', '2005-05-19 09:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397687, 178004, 6814, '<td valign="top">Excellent silhouette which captures the feeling of flight nicely.</td>', 'Excellent silhouette which captures the feeling of flight nicely.', '2005-05-19 09:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397688, 178222, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is a very haunting image.  Nicely captured!</td>', 'This is a very haunting image.  Nicely captured!', '2005-05-19 09:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397689, 177879, 6814, '<td valign="top">To consider this a silhouette is kind of a stretch.</td>', 'To consider this a silhouette is kind of a stretch.', '2005-05-19 09:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397691, 178045, 6814, '<td valign="top">Technically, it''s not a bad photograph, but it''s not really a silhouette.  Also, the windmill is tilting a little to the left which is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Technically, it''s not a bad photograph, but it''s not really a silhouette.  Also, the windmill is tilting a little to the left which is somewhat distracting.', '2005-05-19 09:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397693, 176595, 11738, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but putting her in heels would have made it even better.  It would have given her longer legs and a more elegant look.  Good work.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but putting her in heels would have made it even better.  It would have given her longer legs and a more elegant look.  Good work.', '2005-05-19 09:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397696, 177478, 6814, '<td valign="top">The bottom third of the image is way too dark for my tastes.  I want to see more detail in the silhouettes of the photographers.</td>', 'The bottom third of the image is way too dark for my tastes.  I want to see more detail in the silhouettes of the photographers.', '2005-05-19 09:44:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1397697, 178530, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is not a silhouette, it''s a shadow. . . there''s a difference.</td>', 'This is not a silhouette, it''s a shadow. . . there''s a difference.', '2005-05-19 09:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397701, 178368, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is a very creative silhouette.  I like the splash of red the wine creates which adds interest.  Nicely captured.</td>', 'This is a very creative silhouette.  I like the splash of red the wine creates which adds interest.  Nicely captured.', '2005-05-19 09:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397702, 177492, 6814, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a silhouette, it''s an under exposed photograph.</td>', 'This isn''t a silhouette, it''s an under exposed photograph.', '2005-05-19 09:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397707, 178499, 11738, '<td valign="top">I would have gone for a more of-center composition.  The manner inwhich you manipulated the sky makes it look more like a paintaing than a photograph.  It also looks like you have a dust spot on your sensor - there a greyish blob to the lower-right of the cross''s right arm.  I like how the cross is the only element of this shot.</td>', 'I would have gone for a more of-center composition.  The manner inwhich you manipulated the sky makes it look more like a paintaing than a photograph.  It also looks like you have a dust spot on your sensor - there a greyish blob to the lower-right of the cross''s right arm.  I like how the cross is the only element of this shot.', '2005-05-19 09:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397709, 178484, 6814, '<td valign="top">Where''s the silhouette?</td>', 'Where''s the silhouette?', '2005-05-19 09:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397710, 177999, 11738, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot.  I''m intrigued as to where this was taken considering the time of the year.  Must be in altitude.</td>', 'I like this one a lot.  I''m intrigued as to where this was taken considering the time of the year.  Must be in altitude.', '2005-05-19 09:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397712, 177172, 6814, '<td valign="top">I especially like the colors in this image.  It creates a great mood for a silhouette.</td>', 'I especially like the colors in this image.  It creates a great mood for a silhouette.', '2005-05-19 09:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397713, 178517, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but border too heavy.</td>', 'Nice image, but border too heavy.', '2005-05-19 09:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397715, 178562, 6814, '<td valign="top">The colors make this image work.  Very nicely captured.</td>', 'The colors make this image work.  Very nicely captured.', '2005-05-19 09:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397718, 178256, 6814, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a silhouette, it''s a shadow. . . two very different concepts.</td>', 'This isn''t a silhouette, it''s a shadow. . . two very different concepts.', '2005-05-19 09:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397719, 178568, 11738, '<td valign="top">The girl with the vail rocks.  Not sure about the other fellow.  I find he takes away from image impact.  Nice colours, but it feels a bit washed out.  I think you could have boosted reds, magentas and blues a little.</td>', 'The girl with the vail rocks.  Not sure about the other fellow.  I find he takes away from image impact.  Nice colours, but it feels a bit washed out.  I think you could have boosted reds, magentas and blues a little.', '2005-05-19 09:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397720, 176255, 6814, '<td valign="top">There isn''t enough detail in the shape to make this a good image.</td>', 'There isn''t enough detail in the shape to make this a good image.', '2005-05-19 09:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397721, 178004, 11738, '<td valign="top">Awesome colour, but I find the crop too tight near the top.</td>', 'Awesome colour, but I find the crop too tight near the top.', '2005-05-19 09:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397722, 178566, 6814, '<td valign="top">These are shadows, not silhouettes.</td>', 'These are shadows, not silhouettes.', '2005-05-19 09:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397725, 176064, 6814, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.  I like the way the beam pulls the eye down to the trees.</td>', 'Very interesting image.  I like the way the beam pulls the eye down to the trees.', '2005-05-19 09:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397727, 178576, 6814, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here very much.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the colors here very much.  Nice job.', '2005-05-19 09:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397728, 177447, 6814, '<td valign="top">Where''s the silhouette?</td>', 'Where''s the silhouette?', '2005-05-19 09:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397731, 178176, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is almost a silhouette.  You really shouldn''t be able to see any color in your subjects in a true silhouette.</td>', 'This is almost a silhouette.  You really shouldn''t be able to see any color in your subjects in a true silhouette.', '2005-05-19 09:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397733, 177700, 11738, '<td valign="top">A good attempt, but it''s clear that you camera metered on the horse instead of the background, causing the background to be overexposed and the horse to have too much light to constitute a silhouette.  If your camera has manual priority functions for aperture and shutter speed (M), try getting a reading off the background and keep those settings to execute the shot.</td>', 'A good attempt, but it''s clear that you camera metered on the horse instead of the background, causing the background to be overexposed and the horse to have too much light to constitute a silhouette.  If your camera has manual priority functions for aperture and shutter speed (M), try getting a reading off the background and keep those settings to execute the shot.', '2005-05-19 10:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397737, 177541, 11738, '<td valign="top">This would have rocked as a black and white or duotone image.</td>', 'This would have rocked as a black and white or duotone image.', '2005-05-19 10:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397745, 177051, 11738, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but a shorter shutter speed would have given a shot with less detail on the flowers and thus creating a darker silhouette.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but a shorter shutter speed would have given a shot with less detail on the flowers and thus creating a darker silhouette.', '2005-05-19 10:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397749, 178569, 11738, '<td valign="top">I love how the kid is lit: it lamost has a comic book feel to it.  I think I would have cropped off a bit of the bottom to have a bit more sky showing.  Good work.</td>', 'I love how the kid is lit: it lamost has a comic book feel to it.  I think I would have cropped off a bit of the bottom to have a bit more sky showing.  Good work.', '2005-05-19 10:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397750, 178452, 6814, '<td valign="top">I love the creativity of this shot.  The color and detail in the flower is marvelous and the silhouette adds interest.</td>', 'I love the creativity of this shot.  The color and detail in the flower is marvelous and the silhouette adds interest.', '2005-05-19 10:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397756, 177723, 11738, '<td valign="top">A longer exposure would have been necessary to get more light from the cityscape to define the couple silhouette better.  Super composition.</td>', 'A longer exposure would have been necessary to get more light from the cityscape to define the couple silhouette better.  Super composition.', '2005-05-19 10:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397761, 178546, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too much background clutter to give an idea of the silhouette composition.</td>', 'Too much background clutter to give an idea of the silhouette composition.', '2005-05-19 10:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397768, 178565, 11738, '<td valign="top">The balck border doesn''t add anything to the image since we lose it in the bottom.  White would have been better I think.</td>', 'The balck border doesn''t add anything to the image since we lose it in the bottom.  White would have been better I think.', '2005-05-19 10:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397773, 178176, 29477, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this might get hammered by the fact that "this is not silhoutte enough", however I think it is a good capture.  Their main features (i.e. their faces) are nicely silhoutted and I like the detail in their clothing.  The only thing that I would have changed based on my experience at DPC is a tighter crop (just to the left of the gentleman''s elbow and right of the boccie ball) and more sky and less ground (reposition the subjects so that less than 1/4 of the image was represented by the grass.  Good Luck.</td>', 'I''m sure this might get hammered by the fact that "this is not silhoutte enough", however I think it is a good capture.  Their main features (i.e. their faces) are nicely silhoutted and I like the detail in their clothing.  The only thing that I would have changed based on my experience at DPC is a tighter crop (just to the left of the gentleman''s elbow and right of the boccie ball) and more sky and less ground (reposition the subjects so that less than 1/4 of the image was represented by the grass.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 10:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397782, 176434, 11738, '<td valign="top">I know that the trees are silhouetted in the image, but the image composition puts much more emphasis on the setting sun rather than on the silhouette, which was the target of this challenge.  Wicked sunset.  Must have been awesome to witness.</td>', 'I know that the trees are silhouetted in the image, but the image composition puts much more emphasis on the setting sun rather than on the silhouette, which was the target of this challenge.  Wicked sunset.  Must have been awesome to witness.', '2005-05-19 10:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397789, 178544, 11738, '<td valign="top">This image is a tad dark.  I think you coud have lightened it somewhat while still conserving the ducks as silhouettes.  Boosting orange in the image would have given it more warmth as well.</td>', 'This image is a tad dark.  I think you coud have lightened it somewhat while still conserving the ducks as silhouettes.  Boosting orange in the image would have given it more warmth as well.', '2005-05-19 10:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397822, 177447, 29477, '<td valign="top">Image is extremely grainy and appears out of focus.  It may not appeal to most DPC voters.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Image is extremely grainy and appears out of focus.  It may not appeal to most DPC voters.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 10:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397829, 177466, 29477, '<td valign="top">I really like this image with the person being a perfect silhoutte yet your lighting allows us to see the brass of the trombone.   The only downside for me is your border overkill and I think it damages an otherwise great image.  The gold trim is great but the black shouldn''t be more than 4-8 pixels per side IMHO.  Good Luck.</td>', 'I really like this image with the person being a perfect silhoutte yet your lighting allows us to see the brass of the trombone.   The only downside for me is your border overkill and I think it damages an otherwise great image.  The gold trim is great but the black shouldn''t be more than 4-8 pixels per side IMHO.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 10:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397830, 178243, 26313, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouettes, but oversharpened I think (see the haloes?).</td>', 'Nice silhouettes, but oversharpened I think (see the haloes?).', '2005-05-19 10:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397841, 178576, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great colours and sunset.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Great colours and sunset.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 10:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397850, 177945, 26313, '<td valign="top">Seems like a nice picture, but it''s hard to pick out the what the sihouettes are when it''s so small...</td>', 'Seems like a nice picture, but it''s hard to pick out the what the sihouettes are when it''s so small...', '2005-05-19 10:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397855, 177970, 29477, '<td valign="top">I love B&amp;W, however I think this would have been more powerful in colour. Good Luck.</td>', 'I love B&W, however I think this would have been more powerful in colour. Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397859, 178207, 29477, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and entry.  One of my favs so far.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Excellent composition and entry.  One of my favs so far.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 10:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397860, 178440, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like this moody piece very much. the title is simple yet conveys an exactness to the image''s story. the tonal variation also adds a lot to the mood. 8. bumped.</td>', 'I like this moody piece very much. the title is simple yet conveys an exactness to the image''s story. the tonal variation also adds a lot to the mood. 8. bumped.', '2005-05-19 10:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397870, 176208, 29477, '<td valign="top">I really like this image and framing created by the tree around the setting sun. Well done.  The border negatively impacts an otherwise nice entry.  Good Luck.</td>', 'I really like this image and framing created by the tree around the setting sun. Well done.  The border negatively impacts an otherwise nice entry.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 10:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397875, 177348, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the sunset.  Very powerful. Good Luck.</td>', 'Great capture of the sunset.  Very powerful. Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 10:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397882, 178116, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love this!  Is that a computer screen?  Irrelevent I guess.  Can''t tell you how to improve so I''ll just give you a 9.</td>', 'Love this!  Is that a computer screen?  Irrelevent I guess.  Can''t tell you how to improve so I''ll just give you a 9.', '2005-05-19 10:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397884, 178270, 29477, '<td valign="top">Like the composition, but there is way too much detail lost from what I am assuming is a big level adjustment.  I think colour would have been a nice version with the setting sun and the resulting effect in the sky.  A little more detail and this would have done really well IMO.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Like the composition, but there is way too much detail lost from what I am assuming is a big level adjustment.  I think colour would have been a nice version with the setting sun and the resulting effect in the sky.  A little more detail and this would have done really well IMO.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 10:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397885, 178256, 34247, '<td valign="top">Sorry, it''s a shadow. The subject is supposed to be backlit, not the photographer. 3</td>', 'Sorry, it''s a shadow. The subject is supposed to be backlit, not the photographer. 3', '2005-05-19 10:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397886, 178323, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Kinda wish the water drops weren''t there.  They are unnecessary for me and almost detract.  Think you did a great job on this.  hopefully no one will tell you it shouldn''t be centered- I think rule of thirds so popular here would ruin the image.  there is so much movement  here.  Wow.  bumping up to 10</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Kinda wish the water drops weren''t there.  They are unnecessary for me and almost detract.  Think you did a great job on this.  hopefully no one will tell you it shouldn''t be centered- I think rule of thirds so popular here would ruin the image.  there is so much movement  here.  Wow.  bumping up to 10', '2005-05-19 10:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397888, 178428, 25355, '<td valign="top">The figure, to me, seems too close to the left edge, which is made worse by the border.</td>', 'The figure, to me, seems too close to the left edge, which is made worse by the border.', '2005-05-19 10:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397891, 177879, 25355, '<td valign="top">One thing about DPC recently is that there sure have been a lot of photos with ferris wheels in them!</td>', 'One thing about DPC recently is that there sure have been a lot of photos with ferris wheels in them!', '2005-05-19 10:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
