(1397898, 177703, 25355, '<td valign="top">ah, here we go again, this beach.  <br/>Is that a rock in the foreground? It may have been better to have been standing on the rock to to take the photo.</td>', 'ah, here we go again, this beach.  Is that a rock in the foreground? It may have been better to have been standing on the rock to to take the photo.', '2005-05-19 10:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397899, 178477, 26313, '<td valign="top">While this is a great photo, the sihouettes seem more like an afterthought.</td>', 'While this is a great photo, the sihouettes seem more like an afterthought.', '2005-05-19 10:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397900, 177510, 29477, '<td valign="top">How can you lose with lady liberty.  Nicely captured.  Good Luck.</td>', 'How can you lose with lady liberty.  Nicely captured.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 10:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397918, 176129, 29477, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad that you couldn''t get a better angle so that the father and son had more sky behind them to silhoutte more of their bodies.  The focus also appears crisper on the trees behind the subjects.  Still a nice image and the silhouttes still provide some details to allow you to get a feel for the expressions on their face.  Good luck.</td>', 'It''s too bad that you couldn''t get a better angle so that the father and son had more sky behind them to silhoutte more of their bodies.  The focus also appears crisper on the trees behind the subjects.  Still a nice image and the silhouttes still provide some details to allow you to get a feel for the expressions on their face.  Good luck.', '2005-05-19 11:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397930, 177263, 29477, '<td valign="top">Better of the two images (which appear to be somewhat identical).  Like the fact that the surfer is squating and the board is parrellel to the ground rather than upright with the surfer.  Love the colours of the sky and refelction on the water and beach.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Better of the two images (which appear to be somewhat identical).  Like the fact that the surfer is squating and the board is parrellel to the ground rather than upright with the surfer.  Love the colours of the sky and refelction on the water and beach.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 11:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397960, 176243, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this... I wonder if some people are going to complain that you can see too much for it to be a silhouette... but I think it is perfect!  In terms of cropping, I think it might have been nice if you had cropped in quite a bit - I like the way the light highlights the books names and I feel you didn''t need the computer in the photo perhaps, or the window above?  A tighter crop (quite a bit off the left and the top) - might have been extremely effective and put more emphasis on the books, and also helped to uncenter the boy (self portrait?) either way.  Nice job!  With a crop would have been a 10 but I''m giving an 8 (because it also bothers me that it is tilting slightly)</td>', 'I like this... I wonder if some people are going to complain that you can see too much for it to be a silhouette... but I think it is perfect!  In terms of cropping, I think it might have been nice if you had cropped in quite a bit - I like the way the light highlights the books names and I feel you didn''t need the computer in the photo perhaps, or the window above?  A tighter crop (quite a bit off the left and the top) - might have been extremely effective and put more emphasis on the books, and also helped to uncenter the boy (self portrait?) either way.  Nice job!  With a crop would have been a 10 but I''m giving an 8 (because it also bothers me that it is tilting slightly)', '2005-05-19 11:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397969, 178324, 22533, '<td valign="top">Love the blue background.</td>', 'Love the blue background.', '2005-05-19 11:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397971, 178356, 4967, '<td valign="top">beautiful, soft image.  I like the composition and the colors.  Nicely done.  -9-</td>', 'beautiful, soft image.  I like the composition and the colors.  Nicely done.  -9-', '2005-05-19 11:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397977, 178568, 22533, '<td valign="top">This is a top 5. I love the sky. Good composition too. I personally would have liked the scarf frozen (sharp), but I also know that was probably impossible with the low light. Also I am sure some prefer it blurred.</td>', 'This is a top 5. I love the sky. Good composition too. I personally would have liked the scarf frozen (sharp), but I also know that was probably impossible with the low light. Also I am sure some prefer it blurred.', '2005-05-19 11:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397984, 177723, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great idea - if they are truly engaged (not just set up) they will definitely cherish this photo.  I only wish I could see more of a story from this photo.  At first I didn''t see the glasses going together, and those do help a bit, but maybe just a few seconds later they kissed?  leaning in towards each other would have been really nice - I just feel they are a bit too separated.  Nicely done though... good idea, great focus.  -9-</td>', 'Great idea - if they are truly engaged (not just set up) they will definitely cherish this photo.  I only wish I could see more of a story from this photo.  At first I didn''t see the glasses going together, and those do help a bit, but maybe just a few seconds later they kissed?  leaning in towards each other would have been really nice - I just feel they are a bit too separated.  Nicely done though... good idea, great focus.  -9-', '2005-05-19 11:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397985, 178495, 22533, '<td valign="top">Great focus and composition. I like how the stem comes from the left. The background color is good too.</td>', 'Great focus and composition. I like how the stem comes from the left. The background color is good too.', '2005-05-19 11:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397990, 177983, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it would have been possible... depending on limits of your camera (dslr/p&amp;s and megs) but I think this photo could have been just as effective with the colors and background, and more effective with your silhouette if you had zoomed in some (or cropped)Pretty though.</td>', 'I''m not sure if it would have been possible... depending on limits of your camera (dslr/p&s and megs) but I think this photo could have been just as effective with the colors and background, and more effective with your silhouette if you had zoomed in some (or cropped)Pretty though.', '2005-05-19 11:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397992, 178045, 22533, '<td valign="top">The windmill isn''t quite dark enough, but the sky is gorgeous.</td>', 'The windmill isn''t quite dark enough, but the sky is gorgeous.', '2005-05-19 11:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398001, 177541, 4967, '<td valign="top">I wish you would have rotated this a bit to be straight.... very cute, I like the way the window seems quite dirty and almost cell like, maybe it''s raining?  Nicely done... just watch your rotations especially on ones like this where it is extremely obvious.</td>', 'I wish you would have rotated this a bit to be straight.... very cute, I like the way the window seems quite dirty and almost cell like, maybe it''s raining?  Nicely done... just watch your rotations especially on ones like this where it is extremely obvious.', '2005-05-19 11:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398003, 178530, 35720, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a shadow than silhouette to me. Silhouette should be dark with clear and sharp outlines to work well in my opinion. Nice shot though.</td>', 'This looks more like a shadow than silhouette to me. Silhouette should be dark with clear and sharp outlines to work well in my opinion. Nice shot though.', '2005-05-19 11:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398009, 178532, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this... alot (even though I hate bugs)! Interesting where you decided to cut this guy off, and I''m very glad you didn''t put one of those silly added frames on in PS or something.  I love the pattern of the leaf etc.  Maybe a tad sharper?  I just think this is unique and nicely colored and pretty - 10 -</td>', 'I like this... alot (even though I hate bugs)! Interesting where you decided to cut this guy off, and I''m very glad you didn''t put one of those silly added frames on in PS or something.  I love the pattern of the leaf etc.  Maybe a tad sharper?  I just think this is unique and nicely colored and pretty - 10 -', '2005-05-19 11:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398012, 177465, 4967, '<td valign="top">Hehehehe... cute.  Did you do any burning here in Photoshop?  Good photo for black and white.  Nicely done!  Makes me mile (always a good thing - especially around finals!) - 10 -</td>', 'Hehehehe... cute.  Did you do any burning here in Photoshop?  Good photo for black and white.  Nicely done!  Makes me mile (always a good thing - especially around finals!) - 10 -', '2005-05-19 11:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398016, 178492, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking you are going to do quite well with this :-) Fun photo!! Great job with your composition.  Nice action and good exposure.  All around very well done -10-</td>', 'I''m thinking you are going to do quite well with this :-) Fun photo!! Great job with your composition.  Nice action and good exposure.  All around very well done -10-', '2005-05-19 11:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398022, 176595, 4967, '<td valign="top">Yep!  Definitely!  LOL. Very nicely lit, provocative without being raunchy.  I love the way you can just start to make out the expression on her face, and her breasts are just slightly highlighted.  A very sexy picture.  The one thing I do wish is that there was a slightly warmer background, the white (although it was most likely how you achieved the effect and so it couldn''t be helped) gives it a very clean, sterile look which slightly takes away from it.  Otherwise GORGEOUS.  -9-</td>', 'Yep!  Definitely!  LOL. Very nicely lit, provocative without being raunchy.  I love the way you can just start to make out the expression on her face, and her breasts are just slightly highlighted.  A very sexy picture.  The one thing I do wish is that there was a slightly warmer background, the white (although it was most likely how you achieved the effect and so it couldn''t be helped) gives it a very clean, sterile look which slightly takes away from it.  Otherwise GORGEOUS.  -9-', '2005-05-19 11:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398030, 178496, 32968, '<td valign="top">Love it!! Excellent idea for silhouette!!</td>', 'Love it!! Excellent idea for silhouette!!', '2005-05-19 11:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
