(1398540, 178012, 37103, '<td valign="top">Beautiful backdrop colors.  The horizon looks a little tilted.  If possible it would have been nice to see this tree on its own so my attention doesn''t get drawn to the bush on the left.</td>', 'Beautiful backdrop colors.  The horizon looks a little tilted.  If possible it would have been nice to see this tree on its own so my attention doesn''t get drawn to the bush on the left.', '2005-05-19 15:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398546, 177398, 25140, '<td valign="top">One of the most interesting shots in the challenge, nice work.</td>', 'One of the most interesting shots in the challenge, nice work.', '2005-05-19 15:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398551, 176132, 25140, '<td valign="top">Some may complain about the blown out area but I think it really adds to this photo, it has an almost haunting feeling.  I love the colors.</td>', 'Some may complain about the blown out area but I think it really adds to this photo, it has an almost haunting feeling.  I love the colors.', '2005-05-19 15:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398554, 176200, 24314, '<td valign="top">cool pic! Love the lightsaber colour!</td>', 'cool pic! Love the lightsaber colour!', '2005-05-19 15:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398555, 177618, 25140, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  I love the motion blur it really gives you a sense of being there and of time passing.</td>', 'This is a great image.  I love the motion blur it really gives you a sense of being there and of time passing.', '2005-05-19 15:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398560, 178546, 25140, '<td valign="top">I like how the helmut and hand? has a touch of color while the rest is in silouette.  I wish I could see more detail/shapes.</td>', 'I like how the helmut and hand? has a touch of color while the rest is in silouette.  I wish I could see more detail/shapes.', '2005-05-19 15:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398571, 177235, 25140, '<td valign="top">I love the artistic feel of this photograph.  Its so simple and lovely.  The details in the brick contrast so nicely with the dark subjects and shadows.  The perspective is nice too, as they are walking into the picture, getting closer to me, to where, perhaps, I might see who it is.</td>', 'I love the artistic feel of this photograph.  Its so simple and lovely.  The details in the brick contrast so nicely with the dark subjects and shadows.  The perspective is nice too, as they are walking into the picture, getting closer to me, to where, perhaps, I might see who it is.', '2005-05-19 15:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398578, 178138, 25140, '<td valign="top">I like how the subject is looking into the distance and her pole is pointing in the same direction making me look there too.  The highlights on the water and her silouette are such nice complements.</td>', 'I like how the subject is looking into the distance and her pole is pointing in the same direction making me look there too.  The highlights on the water and her silouette are such nice complements.', '2005-05-19 15:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398582, 177693, 25140, '<td valign="top">I like how the scene floats in the dark.</td>', 'I like how the scene floats in the dark.', '2005-05-19 15:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398592, 178452, 25140, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  The detail in the lily is amazing, but something isn''t quite right with the siloutte, it seems too far away from the lily to be smelling it.  I''m sure setting up and lighting this shot is quite difficult, good effort.</td>', 'Neat idea.  The detail in the lily is amazing, but something isn''t quite right with the siloutte, it seems too far away from the lily to be smelling it.  I''m sure setting up and lighting this shot is quite difficult, good effort.', '2005-05-19 15:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398598, 178264, 25140, '<td valign="top">The little bit of detail in this shot (white flowers, wather ripples) really make this image wonderful.  The contrast between the dark bottom and white sky gives it such nice balance.</td>', 'The little bit of detail in this shot (white flowers, wather ripples) really make this image wonderful.  The contrast between the dark bottom and white sky gives it such nice balance.', '2005-05-19 15:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398601, 178271, 25140, '<td valign="top">Simple and lovely.  What a neat idea that is well executed.</td>', 'Simple and lovely.  What a neat idea that is well executed.', '2005-05-19 15:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398603, 177672, 14735, '<td valign="top">It''s like the grim basketball player.I like the light on the side and the shaodwed front. Well done.</td>', 'It''s like the grim basketball player.I like the light on the side and the shaodwed front. Well done.', '2005-05-19 15:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398606, 178478, 25140, '<td valign="top">What a lovely capture of an amazing sunset.</td>', 'What a lovely capture of an amazing sunset.', '2005-05-19 15:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398608, 177924, 14735, '<td valign="top">NIce color in the sky. Like the stormy effect</td>', 'NIce color in the sky. Like the stormy effect', '2005-05-19 15:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398609, 178585, 14735, '<td valign="top">I like the way the ioght comes through the subject, nice silhouette</td>', 'I like the way the ioght comes through the subject, nice silhouette', '2005-05-19 15:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398612, 178245, 25140, '<td valign="top">I love how the dust and edges of this little guy capture the light, its such a neat effect.  A great image!</td>', 'I love how the dust and edges of this little guy capture the light, its such a neat effect.  A great image!', '2005-05-19 15:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
