(1398616, 178568, 14735, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the shall blowing in the wind, wish there was more of it.</td>', 'I like the effect of the shall blowing in the wind, wish there was more of it.', '2005-05-19 15:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398627, 177051, 25140, '<td valign="top">The sepia is a great choice and I like the frame.  You have made a popular subject in this challenge stand out from the rest.</td>', 'The sepia is a great choice and I like the frame.  You have made a popular subject in this challenge stand out from the rest.', '2005-05-19 15:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398734, 177796, 29477, '<td valign="top">I really like the pose and outline of the subjects face.  I wish you didn''t have such a tight crop and included more of the OOF sky and sunset behind your subject (i.e. zoom out and convert to landscape).  Good Luck.</td>', 'I really like the pose and outline of the subjects face.  I wish you didn''t have such a tight crop and included more of the OOF sky and sunset behind your subject (i.e. zoom out and convert to landscape).  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 16:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398764, 178245, 29477, '<td valign="top">Based on what I have seen so far, this should be in the top 10.  Wonderful capture and colours from the sun.  Some may give the standard response of "would have preferred the elephant on the left of the image... blah, blah, blah...", but seeing the little ones dust trail is perfect.  Could have done without the border as it doesn''t add anything.  Still one of my favs so far.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Based on what I have seen so far, this should be in the top 10.  Wonderful capture and colours from the sun.  Some may give the standard response of "would have preferred the elephant on the left of the image... blah, blah, blah...", but seeing the little ones dust trail is perfect.  Could have done without the border as it doesn''t add anything.  Still one of my favs so far.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 16:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398774, 178562, 29477, '<td valign="top">Really love the composition and colours, but the subjects pose makes me think of a "wigger" (i.e. Eminem).  The title helps tell the story and if the subject was simply standing their staring out to the ocean, it would have had a more dramatic effect IMO.  Still a beautiful image.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Really love the composition and colours, but the subjects pose makes me think of a "wigger" (i.e. Eminem).  The title helps tell the story and if the subject was simply standing their staring out to the ocean, it would have had a more dramatic effect IMO.  Still a beautiful image.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 16:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398784, 178241, 29477, '<td valign="top">Definately a creative take on the challenge, however, I don''t think it will go over well with DPC voters.  IMO, if you where able to adjust the lighting to dull the colours of your hat and shirt (i.e. better silhoutte your reflection) it may have helped.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Definately a creative take on the challenge, however, I don''t think it will go over well with DPC voters.  IMO, if you where able to adjust the lighting to dull the colours of your hat and shirt (i.e. better silhoutte your reflection) it may have helped.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 16:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398790, 178269, 29477, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I like the framing and use of negative space as well as the subtle reflection of the subjects in the floor.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I like the framing and use of negative space as well as the subtle reflection of the subjects in the floor.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 16:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398801, 178486, 29477, '<td valign="top">I really like the innocence of this image and anticipation of what''s ahead.  I find the wall to the left and bottom distracting and would have liked to have seen a tighter crop to include just the mommy''s silhoutte and blind behind her.  Good Luck.</td>', 'I really like the innocence of this image and anticipation of what''s ahead.  I find the wall to the left and bottom distracting and would have liked to have seen a tighter crop to include just the mommy''s silhoutte and blind behind her.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 16:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398804, 178533, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed image.  I really like the simplicity of this image.  Well done.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Nicely composed image.  I really like the simplicity of this image.  Well done.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 16:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398809, 178033, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great Image.  Love the silhoutte of the feathers and wonderful colours being reflected in the water.  Well done.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Great Image.  Love the silhoutte of the feathers and wonderful colours being reflected in the water.  Well done.  Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 16:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398863, 177465, 29477, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a great take on the challenge.  Very simple and effective composition.  However, IMO the post shot editing has killed the beauty that is this image.  It appears that you have done some dodging and burning and the results around the shoes and hat just doesn''t look right.  It has also created a shadowy effect from the legs on the blinds which doesn''t make sense when back lighting should be creating the silhoutte. I think the composition is a solid 8 and it definately meets the challenge, however I have scored it a 5 based on the editing and points I have stated.  I would have really liked to have seen the original image with some brightness and contrast adjustments only. Good Luck.</td>', 'I think that this is a great take on the challenge.  Very simple and effective composition.  However, IMO the post shot editing has killed the beauty that is this image.  It appears that you have done some dodging and burning and the results around the shoes and hat just doesn''t look right.  It has also created a shadowy effect from the legs on the blinds which doesn''t make sense when back lighting should be creating the silhoutte. I think the composition is a solid 8 and it definately meets the challenge, however I have scored it a 5 based on the editing and points I have stated.  I would have really liked to have seen the original image with some brightness and contrast adjustments only. Good Luck.', '2005-05-19 17:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398946, 178323, 19959, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites. very well realized.</td>', 'One of my favourites. very well realized.', '2005-05-19 17:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398948, 178367, 19959, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Classic silhouette shapes.</td>', 'Very nice. Classic silhouette shapes.', '2005-05-19 17:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
