(1398980, 175911, 19959, '<td valign="top">This is a great backlit scene, well spotted, the exposure and the composition are good. The fence is a good contrast to the natural flower. I think however that because the fence is black that most voters may consider this not a silhouette...</td>', 'This is a great backlit scene, well spotted, the exposure and the composition are good. The fence is a good contrast to the natural flower. I think however that because the fence is black that most voters may consider this not a silhouette...', '2005-05-19 17:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
