(1398988, 177466, 19959, '<td valign="top">Excellent... I have to say I hate the border... if the image was the size of the overall frame I think you would do better... having said that, this is just my opinion. I really hope this does well.. on second viewing I am bumping up (for the picture and not the border! :-) )</td>', 'Excellent... I have to say I hate the border... if the image was the size of the overall frame I think you would do better... having said that, this is just my opinion. I really hope this does well.. on second viewing I am bumping up (for the picture and not the border! :-) )', '2005-05-19 17:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398993, 178572, 19959, '<td valign="top">very good... now if the background horse was just framed a little better... ideally under the chin of the foreground horse it would be perfect. I like the sky and tones.. should do well... good luck!</td>', 'very good... now if the background horse was just framed a little better... ideally under the chin of the foreground horse it would be perfect. I like the sky and tones.. should do well... good luck!', '2005-05-19 17:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399027, 178532, 27823, '<td valign="top">great contrast number 10</td>', 'great contrast number 10', '2005-05-19 18:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399036, 178245, 3087, '<td valign="top">Stunning though contrast seems a touch high and compression hasn''t done any favours to that lovely halo of light around his body. BEAUTIFUL capture - can''t wait to learn more about where and how this was taken!</td>', 'Stunning though contrast seems a touch high and compression hasn''t done any favours to that lovely halo of light around his body. BEAUTIFUL capture - can''t wait to learn more about where and how this was taken!', '2005-05-19 18:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399045, 178207, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful journalistic image. This may not be half as strong for non-Brits but it really communicates SO much and so strongly to me. I love the framing and the tonal range and the composition and the head torch and just the whole thing. Absolutely fantastic industrial portrait. 10</td>', 'What a wonderful journalistic image. This may not be half as strong for non-Brits but it really communicates SO much and so strongly to me. I love the framing and the tonal range and the composition and the head torch and just the whole thing. Absolutely fantastic industrial portrait. 10', '2005-05-19 18:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399050, 177348, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! It''s like a jewel on a giant necklace isn''t it and the building spires below balance it so well. Well done, indeed!</td>', 'Beautiful! It''s like a jewel on a giant necklace isn''t it and the building spires below balance it so well. Well done, indeed!', '2005-05-19 18:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399056, 177983, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully colours though the strange texture in the water nearer the horizon is somewhat strange. Like the way you have blue, orange, blue, orange from top to bottom. Good composition. Not sure what the red-orange blob is towards the end of the peninsula on which the fisherman is standing? Although the white at top right is interesting I do think it unbalances overall composition a bit. Nice image though!</td>', 'Beautifully colours though the strange texture in the water nearer the horizon is somewhat strange. Like the way you have blue, orange, blue, orange from top to bottom. Good composition. Not sure what the red-orange blob is towards the end of the peninsula on which the fisherman is standing? Although the white at top right is interesting I do think it unbalances overall composition a bit. Nice image though!', '2005-05-19 18:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399066, 178585, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the quality and colour of light through the dandelion head, especially where there is a pale background behind. I also like the way that the background has both light and dark. I am not sure that the composition, in terms of where is light and where is dark in that background, feels quite balanced but it still works well. 8</td>', 'I love the quality and colour of light through the dandelion head, especially where there is a pale background behind. I also like the way that the background has both light and dark. I am not sure that the composition, in terms of where is light and where is dark in that background, feels quite balanced but it still works well. 8', '2005-05-19 18:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399147, 178356, 28299, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2005-05-19 19:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399184, 178573, 28299, '<td valign="top">Lovely - stark and stunning - 10</td>', 'Lovely - stark and stunning - 10', '2005-05-19 19:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399186, 178033, 28299, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition - 10</td>', 'beautiful composition - 10', '2005-05-19 19:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399203, 176595, 31200, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done..this picture stands out very nicely due to the lovely curves and the touch of red...very beautiful...beautiful looking model too...</td>', 'Very nicely done..this picture stands out very nicely due to the lovely curves and the touch of red...very beautiful...beautiful looking model too...', '2005-05-19 19:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399281, 178245, 6999, '<td valign="top">An extraordinary photograph - as you must have know in the moment you pressed the shutter release. It has the strengths of great wildlife photography along with the strength of the apocalyptic scene you''ve found. In the last moments of the earth, the great beasts will walk again. Marvellous stuff.</td>', 'An extraordinary photograph - as you must have know in the moment you pressed the shutter release. It has the strengths of great wildlife photography along with the strength of the apocalyptic scene you''ve found. In the last moments of the earth, the great beasts will walk again. Marvellous stuff.', '2005-05-19 20:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399289, 177358, 12578, '<td valign="top">Although I like the sun in the shot it seems to be in a commical place. great image</td>', 'Although I like the sun in the shot it seems to be in a commical place. great image', '2005-05-19 20:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399292, 178271, 12578, '<td valign="top">Very clever but feel it could look better if not as crisp around the edges, I would prefer to see it with a softer feel as teh image is trying to portray</td>', 'Very clever but feel it could look better if not as crisp around the edges, I would prefer to see it with a softer feel as teh image is trying to portray', '2005-05-19 20:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399293, 178486, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely view and great light. I love the touches of texture in the background, although the skewed upright disrupts the cleanliness of the shot for me.</td>', 'Lovely view and great light. I love the touches of texture in the background, although the skewed upright disrupts the cleanliness of the shot for me.', '2005-05-19 20:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399296, 177990, 8860, '<td valign="top">I would infinitely prefer this shot without the hand and rose, which give it a stock-shot vibe. The face is a beautiful and has plenty of interest all on its own. Well shot.</td>', 'I would infinitely prefer this shot without the hand and rose, which give it a stock-shot vibe. The face is a beautiful and has plenty of interest all on its own. Well shot.', '2005-05-19 20:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
