(1399596, 178572, 36426, '<td valign="top">This has beautiful photographics.</td>', 'This has beautiful photographics.', '2005-05-19 22:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399614, 178245, 6702, '<td valign="top">Very, Very cool. Love the way the sun lights up the dust and highlights the top of the elephant. It looks like the top of a volcano. I would like to see a version with a tighter crop on the animal. You would loose some of the dust cloud, but the animal silhouette is so strong, I think it would look great. Perfect border.</td>', 'Very, Very cool. Love the way the sun lights up the dust and highlights the top of the elephant. It looks like the top of a volcano. I would like to see a version with a tighter crop on the animal. You would loose some of the dust cloud, but the animal silhouette is so strong, I think it would look great. Perfect border.', '2005-05-19 23:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399617, 178496, 37903, '<td valign="top">Well done. The image and the colors are so clean<br/>I just bought a Beta less than 2 hours ago, we wanted a dog but our landlord doesn''t allow them...</td>', 'Well done. The image and the colors are so cleanI just bought a Beta less than 2 hours ago, we wanted a dog but our landlord doesn''t allow them...', '2005-05-19 23:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399618, 178568, 6702, '<td valign="top">I think I would like this better if the second person was not in the photo. The flowing scarf is a nice touch.</td>', 'I think I would like this better if the second person was not in the photo. The flowing scarf is a nice touch.', '2005-05-19 23:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399620, 178460, 6702, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The striking match is a great aspect of this photo. Unfortunately, I think the smoke detracts. It looks like a smudge, and keeps taking my eye away from the man and the hand. Your cropping is dead on.</td>', 'Very nice. The striking match is a great aspect of this photo. Unfortunately, I think the smoke detracts. It looks like a smudge, and keeps taking my eye away from the man and the hand. Your cropping is dead on.', '2005-05-19 23:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399623, 175911, 6702, '<td valign="top">Love the shot. It''s not a strong silhouette, but if it were, it wouldn''t be much of a flower. So, given the subject matter, I think this is the best you could do.</td>', 'Love the shot. It''s not a strong silhouette, but if it were, it wouldn''t be much of a flower. So, given the subject matter, I think this is the best you could do.', '2005-05-19 23:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399624, 178130, 38050, '<td valign="top">I love the amber glow to this, wonderful silouette. Great job!!</td>', 'I love the amber glow to this, wonderful silouette. Great job!!', '2005-05-19 23:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399626, 177945, 6702, '<td valign="top">Wish it were bigger. The glow of the tracks is nice.</td>', 'Wish it were bigger. The glow of the tracks is nice.', '2005-05-19 23:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399639, 177956, 8624, '<td valign="top">great timing! your effort was well rewarded in this very eye catching image!</td>', 'great timing! your effort was well rewarded in this very eye catching image!', '2005-05-19 23:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399640, 178255, 32997, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones in this shot..your composition really works..nice take on challenge.</td>', 'I really like the tones in this shot..your composition really works..nice take on challenge.', '2005-05-19 23:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399642, 177235, 32997, '<td valign="top">Effective.</td>', 'Effective.', '2005-05-19 23:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399677, 178360, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that this would have been stronger if you included a bit more of the model''s torso. As it was it took me a moment to identify what this silhouette was. It would have also been less ambiguous if her arms were held somewhat more in front of her head. I like the non-intrusive background.</td>', 'I think that this would have been stronger if you included a bit more of the model''s torso. As it was it took me a moment to identify what this silhouette was. It would have also been less ambiguous if her arms were held somewhat more in front of her head. I like the non-intrusive background.', '2005-05-20 00:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399679, 178532, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the veins in the leaf, but I would have preferred to see the bug''s shadow a bit darker.</td>', 'I like the veins in the leaf, but I would have preferred to see the bug''s shadow a bit darker.', '2005-05-20 00:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399691, 178384, 10261, '<td valign="top">I find the few dark specks in the sky distracting. Since advanced editing is allowed, cloning these out would have been a good idea. As for the subject: the tops of the trees are the only part that''s readily distinguishable from the other shadows. Shooting this from a location closer to the base of the trees would probably have allowed you to use more of that bright spot in the sky to frame the trees. Although the jet trail adds a point of interest, I think that framing the tree in a mode dramatic way would have given you a single, stronger subject rather than the tree + jet trail combination.</td>', 'I find the few dark specks in the sky distracting. Since advanced editing is allowed, cloning these out would have been a good idea. As for the subject: the tops of the trees are the only part that''s readily distinguishable from the other shadows. Shooting this from a location closer to the base of the trees would probably have allowed you to use more of that bright spot in the sky to frame the trees. Although the jet trail adds a point of interest, I think that framing the tree in a mode dramatic way would have given you a single, stronger subject rather than the tree + jet trail combination.', '2005-05-20 00:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399701, 178486, 10261, '<td valign="top">It looks like you dodged out a lot more of the shade behind the woman''s bust than was necessary. The angle of her head conveys a feeling that she''s looking hopefully toward the future.</td>', 'It looks like you dodged out a lot more of the shade behind the woman''s bust than was necessary. The angle of her head conveys a feeling that she''s looking hopefully toward the future.', '2005-05-20 00:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399710, 178477, 10261, '<td valign="top">The silhouettes of the trees seem like an intrusive element that were only included to make this otherwise good photograph meet the challenge. <br/></td>', 'The silhouettes of the trees seem like an intrusive element that were only included to make this otherwise good photograph meet the challenge. ', '2005-05-20 00:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399713, 177092, 19952, '<td valign="top">Outstanding dark silhouette with excellent even tones throughout. It''s great that you were able to capture such a bright white without the image appearing blown out and without a lot of banding in the colors that sometimes happens with gradients like this. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Outstanding dark silhouette with excellent even tones throughout. It''s great that you were able to capture such a bright white without the image appearing blown out and without a lot of banding in the colors that sometimes happens with gradients like this. Very nicely done.', '2005-05-20 00:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399716, 178004, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silhouette with outstanding, rich golden tones. Very nicely done!</td>', 'Beautiful silhouette with outstanding, rich golden tones. Very nicely done!', '2005-05-20 00:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399721, 178368, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding sutdio silhouette with excellent lighting and strong, rich colors. Really great job!</td>', 'This is an outstanding sutdio silhouette with excellent lighting and strong, rich colors. Really great job!', '2005-05-20 00:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399725, 178561, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the background, but it looks so good that it seems fake. I''d actually be more impressed if there was some flaw that encouraged me to believe that this image was attributable to nature and not Photoshop.</td>', 'I like the background, but it looks so good that it seems fake. I''d actually be more impressed if there was some flaw that encouraged me to believe that this image was attributable to nature and not Photoshop.', '2005-05-20 00:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399728, 178444, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a really stunning image. There''s a bit of a halo where the dark colors meet the light ones, but other than that, this is an outstanding silhouette and a beautiful image.</td>', 'Wow, this is a really stunning image. There''s a bit of a halo where the dark colors meet the light ones, but other than that, this is an outstanding silhouette and a beautiful image.', '2005-05-20 00:25:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1399731, 178209, 10261, '<td valign="top">The silhouette seems like an intrusive element which was only included to make this otherwise dramatic photograph meet the challenge. Although the sunset is quite good, it''s so saturated that it looks fake.</td>', 'The silhouette seems like an intrusive element which was only included to make this otherwise dramatic photograph meet the challenge. Although the sunset is quite good, it''s so saturated that it looks fake.', '2005-05-20 00:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399733, 178572, 19952, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject with nice, dark tones throughout. This is a great example of a beautiful silhouette with strong lighting and (I believe) burning techniques as well. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Excellent subject with nice, dark tones throughout. This is a great example of a beautiful silhouette with strong lighting and (I believe) burning techniques as well. Very nicely done.', '2005-05-20 00:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399737, 178323, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really love this image. The centered composition works great for this shot and the shallow DOF makes for a really interesting effect on your main subject, as well as a nice background. Great job!</td>', 'I really love this image. The centered composition works great for this shot and the shallow DOF makes for a really interesting effect on your main subject, as well as a nice background. Great job!', '2005-05-20 00:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399748, 178353, 10261, '<td valign="top">The contrast in this photograph is too high for my taste. Although the most prominent characteristic of a silhouette is the absence of shadow detail, I think that the slight shades of grey around the edges of the subject are important too. The contrast here is so high that the highlight on the upper lip and eyebrow are the only reasons for me to believe that this is two people and not a piece of cardboard blocking the light. I like the pose, but the implementation could have been stronger.</td>', 'The contrast in this photograph is too high for my taste. Although the most prominent characteristic of a silhouette is the absence of shadow detail, I think that the slight shades of grey around the edges of the subject are important too. The contrast here is so high that the highlight on the upper lip and eyebrow are the only reasons for me to believe that this is two people and not a piece of cardboard blocking the light. I like the pose, but the implementation could have been stronger.', '2005-05-20 00:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399751, 177492, 10261, '<td valign="top">I realize that you probably didn''t have time to try alternative executions of this shot, but I''d be interested in seeing this with a slower shutter speed (just slow enough to blur the rotors and not introduce any strong motion blur due to it''s direction of travel).</td>', 'I realize that you probably didn''t have time to try alternative executions of this shot, but I''d be interested in seeing this with a slower shutter speed (just slow enough to blur the rotors and not introduce any strong motion blur due to it''s direction of travel).', '2005-05-20 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399755, 178440, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''d have found this more interesting if the pose were either a bit more dynamic or more visibly stationary. Without the title I''d have spent more time wondering whether he was standing on one foot or moving than I would have enjoying the shot. The low-hanging dark clouds over his head add a nice mood to the image, but dodging the cloud subtly to create more visual separation / better tone difference between him and the cloud would have improved the shot as well.</td>', 'I''d have found this more interesting if the pose were either a bit more dynamic or more visibly stationary. Without the title I''d have spent more time wondering whether he was standing on one foot or moving than I would have enjoying the shot. The low-hanging dark clouds over his head add a nice mood to the image, but dodging the cloud subtly to create more visual separation / better tone difference between him and the cloud would have improved the shot as well.', '2005-05-20 00:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399772, 178384, 6668, '<td valign="top">The blown out sky really distracts from this image in my opinion, my eyes automatically are drawn to that spot and away from the silhouette and the jet stream.</td>', 'The blown out sky really distracts from this image in my opinion, my eyes automatically are drawn to that spot and away from the silhouette and the jet stream.', '2005-05-20 00:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399779, 178514, 6668, '<td valign="top">the colors look very strange and unatural to me in this image, perhaps oversaturated?</td>', 'the colors look very strange and unatural to me in this image, perhaps oversaturated?', '2005-05-20 00:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399780, 178492, 36619, '<td valign="top">perfect</td>', 'perfect', '2005-05-20 01:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399781, 177510, 6668, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful image, excellently done! Good luck in the challenge.! 10</td>', 'This is a very beautiful image, excellently done! Good luck in the challenge.! 10', '2005-05-20 01:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399782, 178362, 7910, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-05-20 01:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399785, 178033, 7910, '<td valign="top">nice light</td>', 'nice light', '2005-05-20 01:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399789, 178559, 7910, '<td valign="top">If you''ve never read it, I recommend Stephen King''s "Dreamcatcher"  (the book, not the movie)</td>', 'If you''ve never read it, I recommend Stephen King''s "Dreamcatcher"  (the book, not the movie)', '2005-05-20 01:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399812, 178390, 7910, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the over exposed  background in a silhouette</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the over exposed  background in a silhouette', '2005-05-20 01:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399821, 178132, 7910, '<td valign="top">nice simple composition, with the semi visible moon adding an interesting focal point</td>', 'nice simple composition, with the semi visible moon adding an interesting focal point', '2005-05-20 01:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399829, 177956, 7910, '<td valign="top">looked too quick on the first pass and assumed a typical under exposed meter reading.... but then came back to the placement of the sun.   nice planning</td>', 'looked too quick on the first pass and assumed a typical under exposed meter reading.... but then came back to the placement of the sun.   nice planning', '2005-05-20 01:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399854, 178066, 38055, '<td valign="top">Very interesting that you would put these two together.</td>', 'Very interesting that you would put these two together.', '2005-05-20 01:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399906, 177011, 31036, '<td valign="top">Okay...that''s just beyond cool.</td>', 'Okay...that''s just beyond cool.', '2005-05-20 02:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399919, 178132, 30861, '<td valign="top">The purity of this image is remarkable. I''m not sure I''d have gone with the somewhat greenish tint you have used, I wonder how it would look shifted to a purer blue? Regardless, a strong entry, very well done.</td>', 'The purity of this image is remarkable. I''m not sure I''d have gone with the somewhat greenish tint you have used, I wonder how it would look shifted to a purer blue? Regardless, a strong entry, very well done.', '2005-05-20 03:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399921, 178368, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is fantastically well done. It''s a little artificial for my tastes, but I admire the skill of it. Fine entry!</td>', 'This is fantastically well done. It''s a little artificial for my tastes, but I admire the skill of it. Fine entry!', '2005-05-20 03:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399922, 178496, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Love the title too. Strong entry.</td>', 'Very nice. Love the title too. Strong entry.', '2005-05-20 03:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399924, 178572, 30861, '<td valign="top">One of the most startling entries in the challenge, wildly surreal and mind-blowing. It''s a pity the BG horse was not better-framed between the legs of the other. Stron entry!</td>', 'One of the most startling entries in the challenge, wildly surreal and mind-blowing. It''s a pity the BG horse was not better-framed between the legs of the other. Stron entry!', '2005-05-20 03:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399927, 178568, 30861, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot to love in this image. I''d wish for a little beter separation of figures from beach, and I''d wish we could see some chin/neck delineation instead of the strange tubular effect on the foreground figure. Very strong entry.</td>', 'There''s a lot to love in this image. I''d wish for a little beter separation of figures from beach, and I''d wish we could see some chin/neck delineation instead of the strange tubular effect on the foreground figure. Very strong entry.', '2005-05-20 03:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399930, 176533, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very nice reprise of Karate Kid. A strong image marred somewhat by excessive noise and an overly heavy border.</td>', 'Very nice reprise of Karate Kid. A strong image marred somewhat by excessive noise and an overly heavy border.', '2005-05-20 03:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399931, 178576, 30861, '<td valign="top">Just outstanding! I wish the leftmost diagonal shape were not truncated, though.</td>', 'Just outstanding! I wish the leftmost diagonal shape were not truncated, though.', '2005-05-20 03:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399934, 178562, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sweet... feels a tad soft &amp; noisy, but overall really nice. I''d like to see it with more DOF, so the water and sky were somewhat crisper.<br/></td>', 'Sweet... feels a tad soft & noisy, but overall really nice. I''d like to see it with more DOF, so the water and sky were somewhat crisper.', '2005-05-20 03:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399935, 177465, 30861, '<td valign="top">Higly amusing. Strong entry. Cowboy boots might have kicked it up a notch? Well done regardless.</td>', 'Higly amusing. Strong entry. Cowboy boots might have kicked it up a notch? Well done regardless.', '2005-05-20 03:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399937, 178323, 30861, '<td valign="top">I love the pure minimalism of this, the delicately-rendered DOF. The droplets are precious. Well done!</td>', 'I love the pure minimalism of this, the delicately-rendered DOF. The droplets are precious. Well done!', '2005-05-20 03:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399939, 178245, 30861, '<td valign="top">Powerful shot. Technically not that hot, but graphically it''s total dynamite. The border seems too heavy to me, however.</td>', 'Powerful shot. Technically not that hot, but graphically it''s total dynamite. The border seems too heavy to me, however.', '2005-05-20 03:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399942, 177672, 30861, '<td valign="top">This may get hammered as "not a silhouette", but in my book it''s one of the strongest, most visceral images in the challenge. Well done!</td>', 'This may get hammered as "not a silhouette", but in my book it''s one of the strongest, most visceral images in the challenge. Well done!', '2005-05-20 03:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399945, 178222, 30861, '<td valign="top">Strange shot. Hope it does better than I suspect it will. Well seen!</td>', 'Strange shot. Hope it does better than I suspect it will. Well seen!', '2005-05-20 03:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399948, 178436, 30861, '<td valign="top">There''s much to love here, but the "clumping" of the central posts is bothering me, and I long for a tad more separation where the nets are.</td>', 'There''s much to love here, but the "clumping" of the central posts is bothering me, and I long for a tad more separation where the nets are.', '2005-05-20 03:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399950, 176797, 30861, '<td valign="top">I love the way htis tells a story. It''s a warm and carinf picture. Your border is doing you no favors, though. If you''re gonna drop a shadow, you really need more whote to flost it on I think.</td>', 'I love the way htis tells a story. It''s a warm and carinf picture. Your border is doing you no favors, though. If you''re gonna drop a shadow, you really need more whote to flost it on I think.', '2005-05-20 03:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399951, 178453, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like the pure, minimalist nature of this. I wish it were crisper.</td>', 'I like the pure, minimalist nature of this. I wish it were crisper.', '2005-05-20 03:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399953, 177011, 30861, '<td valign="top">A nice piece of work, reminiscent of the Blue Man ads for the chipsets. Technically flawless, but it leaves me feeling a lack of emotional response.</td>', 'A nice piece of work, reminiscent of the Blue Man ads for the chipsets. Technically flawless, but it leaves me feeling a lack of emotional response.', '2005-05-20 03:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399957, 178588, 30861, '<td valign="top">There''s so much potential to this, but a lot of it''s unrealized IMO. In particular, you could have made the foreground more luminous so the gull playes a stronger supporting role. The rock and fog are remarkable. I know the scene very well, I'';ve spent a lot of time in Morro Bay.</td>', 'There''s so much potential to this, but a lot of it''s unrealized IMO. In particular, you could have made the foreground more luminous so the gull playes a stronger supporting role. The rock and fog are remarkable. I know the scene very well, I'';ve spent a lot of time in Morro Bay.', '2005-05-20 03:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399960, 178563, 30861, '<td valign="top">I admire this shot immensely. The tonalities are beautiful, the whole scene speaks to me hauntingly. As a "silhouette" entry it will probably be seen as marginal by the voters, but I''m willing to accept it as meeting the challenge. Nice work!</td>', 'I admire this shot immensely. The tonalities are beautiful, the whole scene speaks to me hauntingly. As a "silhouette" entry it will probably be seen as marginal by the voters, but I''m willing to accept it as meeting the challenge. Nice work!', '2005-05-20 03:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399962, 177466, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. One of the few examples of heavy border that''s working in this challenge. I only wish the curve of the end of the slide were separated better...</td>', 'Nicely done. One of the few examples of heavy border that''s working in this challenge. I only wish the curve of the end of the slide were separated better...', '2005-05-20 03:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399981, 177051, 22748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image! But it is not a silhouette in my opinion. There is far too much detail and brightness in the subject. Still a fabulous image but doesn''t seem to meet the challenge to me.</td>', 'Beautiful image! But it is not a silhouette in my opinion. There is far too much detail and brightness in the subject. Still a fabulous image but doesn''t seem to meet the challenge to me.', '2005-05-20 03:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399999, 178464, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome!! Mysterious, beautiful, intriguing. I love the cool green tones and the surrounding darkness. Incredible. This is my favorite image in the challenge!!</td>', 'Awesome!! Mysterious, beautiful, intriguing. I love the cool green tones and the surrounding darkness. Incredible. This is my favorite image in the challenge!!', '2005-05-20 04:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400020, 178492, 20324, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture, nice composition, perfect for this challenge. (9)</td>', 'Interesting picture, nice composition, perfect for this challenge. (9)', '2005-05-20 04:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400023, 178362, 20324, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, artistic, perfect composition, some people may say that it is not a perfec silhouette. I like it a lot. (9)</td>', 'Beautiful, artistic, perfect composition, some people may say that it is not a perfec silhouette. I like it a lot. (9)', '2005-05-20 04:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400062, 177051, 8643, '<td valign="top">Great use of sepia, lovely soft tones, perfect composition, very nice!</td>', 'Great use of sepia, lovely soft tones, perfect composition, very nice!', '2005-05-20 06:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400063, 178271, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is more difficult to achieve than it looks - well done - nice composition and good clean silhouettes.</td>', 'This is more difficult to achieve than it looks - well done - nice composition and good clean silhouettes.', '2005-05-20 06:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400064, 176117, 8643, '<td valign="top">Good silhouette, love the gradient green, nice touch.</td>', 'Good silhouette, love the gradient green, nice touch.', '2005-05-20 06:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400065, 178368, 8643, '<td valign="top">Love the warm tones and the radiating light, nice composition too; good silhouette.</td>', 'Love the warm tones and the radiating light, nice composition too; good silhouette.', '2005-05-20 06:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400066, 178452, 8643, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, would have preferred a sharper edge to the silhouette.</td>', 'Nice idea, would have preferred a sharper edge to the silhouette.', '2005-05-20 06:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400067, 178572, 34610, '<td valign="top">Good story behind this photograph... Very successful</td>', 'Good story behind this photograph... Very successful', '2005-05-20 06:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400070, 177569, 18080, '<td valign="top">really nice shot<br/>9<br/>good luck<br/></td>', 'really nice shot9good luck', '2005-05-20 07:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400091, 178256, 30791, '<td valign="top">deffinantly a shadow</td>', 'deffinantly a shadow', '2005-05-20 07:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400151, 178585, 31036, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Background colors accent the main subject. perfectly. Composition is nearly perfect. I''d hope this at least makes the top 25.</td>', 'Beautiful. Background colors accent the main subject. perfectly. Composition is nearly perfect. I''d hope this at least makes the top 25.', '2005-05-20 08:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400156, 177358, 17033, '<td valign="top">Is that a torch in his pocket or is he glad to see you?</td>', 'Is that a torch in his pocket or is he glad to see you?', '2005-05-20 09:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400157, 177121, 31036, '<td valign="top">This one is really tough for me to rate for some reason, and I can''t quite figure that reason out. I love the concept, the angle, and the competing lines, but it falls a little short. Maybe if the window glare wasn''t there, and if the photo was rotated to level out the horizontal line (from a wall?). If this was mine, I''d straighten it, burn the window, and clone out the roof antenna on the furthest house. I still really like the photo, though... enough for a 7.</td>', 'This one is really tough for me to rate for some reason, and I can''t quite figure that reason out. I love the concept, the angle, and the competing lines, but it falls a little short. Maybe if the window glare wasn''t there, and if the photo was rotated to level out the horizontal line (from a wall?). If this was mine, I''d straighten it, burn the window, and clone out the roof antenna on the furthest house. I still really like the photo, though... enough for a 7.', '2005-05-20 09:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400161, 177672, 31036, '<td valign="top">Hahaha... nice. Love the lighting. I''m very impressed.</td>', 'Hahaha... nice. Love the lighting. I''m very impressed.', '2005-05-20 09:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400162, 177945, 31036, '<td valign="top">I really wish this was bigger. It''s difficult to examine and critique in that size.</td>', 'I really wish this was bigger. It''s difficult to examine and critique in that size.', '2005-05-20 09:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
