(1400271, 177235, 35804, '<td valign="top">A two fer! A silhouette and a shadow. I really like the starkness of the image. The B &amp; W is extremely effective. This image has a great late night mood to it, suggested by the starkness and that touch of "grain". The light on the brick wall is also wonderful, just really nicely done.</td>', 'A two fer! A silhouette and a shadow. I really like the starkness of the image. The B & W is extremely effective. This image has a great late night mood to it, suggested by the starkness and that touch of "grain". The light on the brick wall is also wonderful, just really nicely done.', '2005-05-20 10:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400277, 178586, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is a WONDERFUL image...so "odd"...ethereal actually. For me it has a somewhat abstract quality about it, which is quite appealing in this case. I like that the subject isn''t in your face obvious...this is an image that demanded more of my attention. When I first came upon this picture when I was voting, I actually cocked my head to one side and moved closer to the screen and thought to myself... " what is this...what do we have here?... I love it!"...excellent job, very elegant.</td>', 'This is a WONDERFUL image...so "odd"...ethereal actually. For me it has a somewhat abstract quality about it, which is quite appealing in this case. I like that the subject isn''t in your face obvious...this is an image that demanded more of my attention. When I first came upon this picture when I was voting, I actually cocked my head to one side and moved closer to the screen and thought to myself... " what is this...what do we have here?... I love it!"...excellent job, very elegant.', '2005-05-20 10:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400280, 178572, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is one of my absolute favorite images in the challenge. I really like the unusual perspective, very effective. The only thing that seems a little odd/distracting is the area by the front horses face, perhaps some cloning happened here? Even still, this is a great picture!</td>', 'This is one of my absolute favorite images in the challenge. I really like the unusual perspective, very effective. The only thing that seems a little odd/distracting is the area by the front horses face, perhaps some cloning happened here? Even still, this is a great picture!', '2005-05-20 10:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
