(1400445, 177618, 7910, '<td valign="top">Good idea.   I''m not against showing motion,  but I think a higher ISO (if possible) to freeze the fish would have made it a bit more interesting.   I''ve tried this shot too and it''s not that easy to get a good one.   Extra point for that.</td>', 'Good idea.   I''m not against showing motion,  but I think a higher ISO (if possible) to freeze the fish would have made it a bit more interesting.   I''ve tried this shot too and it''s not that easy to get a good one.   Extra point for that.', '2005-05-20 12:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400446, 178222, 25024, '<td valign="top">I love the tree sillhouettes - I dont think the right hand elements and the foreground add a lot, and the blue is just too blue! Personally I think I would have composed the shot a little further from the left - good luck</td>', 'I love the tree sillhouettes - I dont think the right hand elements and the foreground add a lot, and the blue is just too blue! Personally I think I would have composed the shot a little further from the left - good luck', '2005-05-20 12:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
