(1400609, 177693, 29535, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this barely meets the challenge.  Everything is so hard to make out with all the wasted space and there are no silouettes, only a reverse in fact, with a weak image engulfed by darkness.</td>', 'I''m afraid this barely meets the challenge.  Everything is so hard to make out with all the wasted space and there are no silouettes, only a reverse in fact, with a weak image engulfed by darkness.', '2005-05-20 13:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
