(1400613, 178241, 29535, '<td valign="top">I see no silouette at all here...</td>', 'I see no silouette at all here...', '2005-05-20 13:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400615, 177990, 29535, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid you;ve got your wires crossed as to what a silouette is.  Shame, it''s a good photo.</td>', 'I''m afraid you;ve got your wires crossed as to what a silouette is.  Shame, it''s a good photo.', '2005-05-20 13:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400618, 176255, 29535, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but  very bland example of a silouette.  Out of focus too and compositionally lacking.</td>', 'Meets the challenge but  very bland example of a silouette.  Out of focus too and compositionally lacking.', '2005-05-20 13:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400619, 178546, 29535, '<td valign="top">Too dark to hold much value.  If at correct brightness the silouettes would not be dark enough to be called such and the detail would be lacking.</td>', 'Too dark to hold much value.  If at correct brightness the silouettes would not be dark enough to be called such and the detail would be lacking.', '2005-05-20 13:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400620, 178256, 29535, '<td valign="top">This would be a shadow, not a silouette I''m afraid.  Sorry!</td>', 'This would be a shadow, not a silouette I''m afraid.  Sorry!', '2005-05-20 13:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400690, 177618, 35804, '<td valign="top">The colors of and in the water are magnicent, the image has a great sense of movement...super cool.</td>', 'The colors of and in the water are magnicent, the image has a great sense of movement...super cool.', '2005-05-20 13:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400695, 177122, 35804, '<td valign="top">The ripples and refelctions on the water are completely delicious...a beautiful hushed image.</td>', 'The ripples and refelctions on the water are completely delicious...a beautiful hushed image.', '2005-05-20 13:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400710, 178269, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is so simple and lovely. I love the romance, the softness, the implied closeness.  The composition is quite nice and if this image were in color...it would not be the same at all...color would be an immense distraction I think. The light and reflections are completely elegant and gorgeous.</td>', 'This is so simple and lovely. I love the romance, the softness, the implied closeness.  The composition is quite nice and if this image were in color...it would not be the same at all...color would be an immense distraction I think. The light and reflections are completely elegant and gorgeous.', '2005-05-20 13:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400718, 178241, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture...but I really don''t see a silhouette, it seems to be more of a reflection...still a very interesting image though.</td>', 'I really like this picture...but I really don''t see a silhouette, it seems to be more of a reflection...still a very interesting image though.', '2005-05-20 13:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400725, 178382, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really really like the image, it has a great "mystery" about it...gorgeous light and subtle color range...what I don''t like is the massive white border...it''s almost too distracting for me.</td>', 'I really really like the image, it has a great "mystery" about it...gorgeous light and subtle color range...what I don''t like is the massive white border...it''s almost too distracting for me.', '2005-05-20 13:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400729, 176243, 35804, '<td valign="top">I don''t miss college at all....The color on the wall is absolutely gorgeous as is the light and lack there of. Really nicely done.</td>', 'I don''t miss college at all....The color on the wall is absolutely gorgeous as is the light and lack there of. Really nicely done.', '2005-05-20 13:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400732, 178360, 6702, '<td valign="top">The color and contrast in this shot is excellent. My only suggestion would be to get more detail on the model. The scarf, hair, and arms all come together in the primary focus of the image and even though you know what it is, it is too distorted.</td>', 'The color and contrast in this shot is excellent. My only suggestion would be to get more detail on the model. The scarf, hair, and arms all come together in the primary focus of the image and even though you know what it is, it is too distorted.', '2005-05-20 13:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400735, 177465, 35804, '<td valign="top">Do cowgirls wear shoes like that? None I know do...even when "gone wild ".</td>', 'Do cowgirls wear shoes like that? None I know do...even when "gone wild ".', '2005-05-20 13:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400740, 176595, 35804, '<td valign="top">The models body seems somewhat distorted?  Her head looks huge to me...I can''t put my finger on it exactly but there is something "odd" looking about this image.</td>', 'The models body seems somewhat distorted?  Her head looks huge to me...I can''t put my finger on it exactly but there is something "odd" looking about this image.', '2005-05-20 13:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400746, 176082, 35804, '<td valign="top">This image is more of a profile than a silhouette...pretty light though.</td>', 'This image is more of a profile than a silhouette...pretty light though.', '2005-05-20 13:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400914, 178444, 6702, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. I think originality will be the reason that you don''t score even higher on this shot. Great colors, Great contrast. This was my daughters favorite.</td>', 'This is a great shot. I think originality will be the reason that you don''t score even higher on this shot. Great colors, Great contrast. This was my daughters favorite.', '2005-05-20 15:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400940, 178149, 6702, '<td valign="top">This is a little too much like an underexposed snapshot. The water doesn''t provide enough contrast from the models. The sun needed to be lower in the sky. The steep shoreline also forced a downward shot that caused the horizon to be a too high. If you could''ve lowered the camera to put more sky behind the models, the silhouette would have been enhanced.</td>', 'This is a little too much like an underexposed snapshot. The water doesn''t provide enough contrast from the models. The sun needed to be lower in the sky. The steep shoreline also forced a downward shot that caused the horizon to be a too high. If you could''ve lowered the camera to put more sky behind the models, the silhouette would have been enhanced.', '2005-05-20 15:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400950, 178544, 6702, '<td valign="top">For me the photo is a little too dark. An overall brightening of the image while maintaining the contrast for the silhouettes, would have been a stronger entry. Aside from that, it is a very nice, peaceful shot. I want to go fishing now.</td>', 'For me the photo is a little too dark. An overall brightening of the image while maintaining the contrast for the silhouettes, would have been a stronger entry. Aside from that, it is a very nice, peaceful shot. I want to go fishing now.', '2005-05-20 15:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1400956, 178568, 2223, '<td valign="top">This is just an amazing photo. It has everything, color, emotion, awesome composition, great silhouette light...I want to bump it to 11 but I cant!</td>', 'This is just an amazing photo. It has everything, color, emotion, awesome composition, great silhouette light...I want to bump it to 11 but I cant!', '2005-05-20 15:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401001, 177492, 6702, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture. I think two things would make it even better. 1. Slower shutter speed, to get some blade rotation.  (I don''t know exactly how that would look. The blades may disappear completely). 2. Larger helicopter. Maybe 100% larger. Just some thoughts.</td>', 'This is a great picture. I think two things would make it even better. 1. Slower shutter speed, to get some blade rotation.  (I don''t know exactly how that would look. The blades may disappear completely). 2. Larger helicopter. Maybe 100% larger. Just some thoughts.', '2005-05-20 16:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401017, 177703, 6702, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich colors. It took me a minute to figure out the right side of the shot. The  rock in the forground is a little distracting. My eyes keep getting drawn away from the great sunset and the rocks on the horizon.</td>', 'Beautiful rich colors. It took me a minute to figure out the right side of the shot. The  rock in the forground is a little distracting. My eyes keep getting drawn away from the great sunset and the rocks on the horizon.', '2005-05-20 16:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401188, 176129, 16028, '<td valign="top">This is awesome, sepia like tones.</td>', 'This is awesome, sepia like tones.', '2005-05-20 17:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401273, 177738, 33435, '<td valign="top">This looks like something you would see on Stargate.  Very Interesting photo, and good to see something a little different.</td>', 'This looks like something you would see on Stargate.  Very Interesting photo, and good to see something a little different.', '2005-05-20 18:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401287, 178444, 4888, '<td valign="top">I hope you make prints available of this one, it''d match my house''s other paintings really well.</td>', 'I hope you make prints available of this one, it''d match my house''s other paintings really well.', '2005-05-20 18:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401338, 178245, 37103, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot.  I don''t know what the yellow clouds behind the elephant are, but that color adds so much.</td>', 'Amazing shot.  I don''t know what the yellow clouds behind the elephant are, but that color adds so much.', '2005-05-20 19:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401349, 178329, 13688, '<td valign="top">I like that you were able to capture the moon and generally a silhouette of the tree, but then there would be no moon if it was a truely backt lit.   Other than that, I think it would be a really cool shot without quite so much space between the 2 objects.  Perhaps a lower and closer point of view would have allowed this.</td>', 'I like that you were able to capture the moon and generally a silhouette of the tree, but then there would be no moon if it was a truely backt lit.   Other than that, I think it would be a really cool shot without quite so much space between the 2 objects.  Perhaps a lower and closer point of view would have allowed this.', '2005-05-20 19:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401352, 177975, 13688, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition.  Awesome post processing.  Extremely moody.   Unfortunately if I''m likeing it as much as I do, you could be in trouble with the rest of the site.  Hope I''m wrong.</td>', 'Perfect composition.  Awesome post processing.  Extremely moody.   Unfortunately if I''m likeing it as much as I do, you could be in trouble with the rest of the site.  Hope I''m wrong.', '2005-05-20 19:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401355, 177672, 37103, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable silhouette.  I love the touches of color on his clothes.  Love the attitude and definitely one of my favorites.</td>', 'Unbelievable silhouette.  I love the touches of color on his clothes.  Love the attitude and definitely one of my favorites.', '2005-05-20 19:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401356, 178464, 13688, '<td valign="top">Really like this.  Has a computer generated feel to it, which though I''m sure disliked by most photography purists, I find very cool.</td>', 'Really like this.  Has a computer generated feel to it, which though I''m sure disliked by most photography purists, I find very cool.', '2005-05-20 19:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401357, 178460, 37103, '<td valign="top">I love you framing and the sky blue.  Awesome image.</td>', 'I love you framing and the sky blue.  Awesome image.', '2005-05-20 19:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401364, 177754, 13688, '<td valign="top">1 of the few photographs i''ve seen on this site where i can actually feel the objects in the image interacting with each other.  As i look, i feel  the lower trees wanting to bend further away.</td>', '1 of the few photographs i''ve seen on this site where i can actually feel the objects in the image interacting with each other.  As i look, i feel  the lower trees wanting to bend further away.', '2005-05-20 19:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401459, 178588, 37042, '<td valign="top">Great picutre..  I like it.</td>', 'Great picutre..  I like it.', '2005-05-20 20:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401464, 178452, 37042, '<td valign="top">I love this picture...<br/> <br/>wonderful job.</td>', 'I love this picture... wonderful job.', '2005-05-20 20:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401486, 178585, 14614, '<td valign="top">really like the mood you''ve created here - one of my ribbon picks</td>', 'really like the mood you''ve created here - one of my ribbon picks', '2005-05-20 20:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401489, 177051, 14614, '<td valign="top">softness is contrasted nicely with the silhouette - strong composition - I really like this one!  one of my ribbon picks 10</td>', 'softness is contrasted nicely with the silhouette - strong composition - I really like this one!  one of my ribbon picks 10', '2005-05-20 20:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401490, 178323, 14614, '<td valign="top">excellent -- great whispy feel -- one of my ribbon picks</td>', 'excellent -- great whispy feel -- one of my ribbon picks', '2005-05-20 20:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401491, 177924, 14614, '<td valign="top">you had a lot of "windmill competition" this challenge and you''ve come out on top in my opinon -- one of my ribbon picks -- tones and clouds/windmill are excellently composed.</td>', 'you had a lot of "windmill competition" this challenge and you''ve come out on top in my opinon -- one of my ribbon picks -- tones and clouds/windmill are excellently composed.', '2005-05-20 20:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401494, 177466, 14614, '<td valign="top">wonderful lighting - such a great misty atmosphere.  one of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'wonderful lighting - such a great misty atmosphere.  one of my favorites this challenge', '2005-05-20 20:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401498, 178464, 14614, '<td valign="top">excellent use of color and light/dark areas - one of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'excellent use of color and light/dark areas - one of my favorites this challenge', '2005-05-20 20:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401499, 178538, 14614, '<td valign="top">great story!  you''ve captured all the emotion of the love of fishing and the bordom of fishing - one of my favorities this challenge</td>', 'great story!  you''ve captured all the emotion of the love of fishing and the bordom of fishing - one of my favorities this challenge', '2005-05-20 20:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401500, 178335, 14614, '<td valign="top">wonderful tones... just the right moment - one of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'wonderful tones... just the right moment - one of my favorites this challenge', '2005-05-20 20:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401501, 177235, 14614, '<td valign="top">unique --- has me studying this one!  one of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'unique --- has me studying this one!  one of my favorites this challenge', '2005-05-20 20:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401505, 178572, 14614, '<td valign="top">this is a memorable shot - so dramatic - unique/quirky placement of horses keeps my interest.  One of my ribbon picks</td>', 'this is a memorable shot - so dramatic - unique/quirky placement of horses keeps my interest.  One of my ribbon picks', '2005-05-20 20:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401507, 178245, 14614, '<td valign="top">I''m looking forward to reading the story behind this excellent shot.  the light and the tones are exquisit... one of my ribbon picks</td>', 'I''m looking forward to reading the story behind this excellent shot.  the light and the tones are exquisit... one of my ribbon picks', '2005-05-20 20:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401508, 176243, 14614, '<td valign="top">you''ve capture the emotion of the moment - silhouette really fits this image -- one of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'you''ve capture the emotion of the moment - silhouette really fits this image -- one of my favorites this challenge', '2005-05-20 20:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401513, 178495, 14614, '<td valign="top">blue and black tones are wonderful - one of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'blue and black tones are wonderful - one of my favorites this challenge', '2005-05-20 20:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401626, 178484, 8125, '<td valign="top">Although this is a very nice shot - I don''t think it technically is a silhouette.  I can see too much color and detail in this image.</td>', 'Although this is a very nice shot - I don''t think it technically is a silhouette.  I can see too much color and detail in this image.', '2005-05-20 22:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401632, 178573, 8125, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challenge - I love how the coloring in the sky ''outlines'' your subject.</td>', 'Certainly meets the challenge - I love how the coloring in the sky ''outlines'' your subject.', '2005-05-20 22:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401637, 178243, 8125, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I really like the colors in the sky.  I don''t quite understand the title - I see only 1 river and many bridges.</td>', 'Nice shot - I really like the colors in the sky.  I don''t quite understand the title - I see only 1 river and many bridges.', '2005-05-20 22:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401650, 176082, 7910, '<td valign="top">hmm... not really a silhouette, and its focus is soft.</td>', 'hmm... not really a silhouette, and its focus is soft.', '2005-05-20 22:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401652, 177398, 8125, '<td valign="top">I wish I had better comments for you, but the best way to learn is someone pointing out what could be done better in the future.  The image is out of focus.  You do have the right idea on how to create a silhouette... however, the bright spot of what appears to be a flashlight behind the moth is very distracting.  This image also appears pixelated as if you tried to resize too much.  Good luck in future challenges!</td>', 'I wish I had better comments for you, but the best way to learn is someone pointing out what could be done better in the future.  The image is out of focus.  You do have the right idea on how to create a silhouette... however, the bright spot of what appears to be a flashlight behind the moth is very distracting.  This image also appears pixelated as if you tried to resize too much.  Good luck in future challenges!', '2005-05-20 22:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401659, 178209, 8125, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  I wish the person was a little higher in the frame as the brim of the hat seems to be competing with the horizon.</td>', 'Great colors!  I wish the person was a little higher in the frame as the brim of the hat seems to be competing with the horizon.', '2005-05-20 22:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401663, 178496, 8125, '<td valign="top">Love it, Love it, Love it.  Fantastic image - love the idea here.  Colors are wonderful - a 10 for me.</td>', 'Love it, Love it, Love it.  Fantastic image - love the idea here.  Colors are wonderful - a 10 for me.', '2005-05-20 22:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401667, 177466, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is terrific!  Great job here and I think the frame/border really enhances this shot.</td>', 'This is terrific!  Great job here and I think the frame/border really enhances this shot.', '2005-05-20 22:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401672, 178176, 8125, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this is not really a silhouette and appears to be a snapshot.  It looks like you used too much contrast, color enhancing and/or sharpening.  Good luck with future challenges!</td>', 'Unfortunately this is not really a silhouette and appears to be a snapshot.  It looks like you used too much contrast, color enhancing and/or sharpening.  Good luck with future challenges!', '2005-05-20 22:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401677, 178295, 7910, '<td valign="top">nice sky</td>', 'nice sky', '2005-05-20 22:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401678, 177945, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is far too small to see it and make comments.  Try making your image closer to the maximum allowable size for future challenges.</td>', 'This is far too small to see it and make comments.  Try making your image closer to the maximum allowable size for future challenges.', '2005-05-20 22:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401685, 178295, 8125, '<td valign="top">The coloring in the sky is nice, but that''s about all there is going for this shot.  Unfortunately the power lines and tree lines don''t make for something interesting to look at.  Good luck in future challenges!</td>', 'The coloring in the sky is nice, but that''s about all there is going for this shot.  Unfortunately the power lines and tree lines don''t make for something interesting to look at.  Good luck in future challenges!', '2005-05-20 22:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401688, 178256, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is actually a shadow rather than a silhouette.  I would suggest adding some other element, as it is right now - there isn''t a whole lot to look at.  The bricks provide texture and color - but that''s about it.</td>', 'This is actually a shadow rather than a silhouette.  I would suggest adding some other element, as it is right now - there isn''t a whole lot to look at.  The bricks provide texture and color - but that''s about it.', '2005-05-20 22:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401691, 177956, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow... great timing catching that sun in just the right position.  Nice sky color!</td>', 'Wow... great timing catching that sun in just the right position.  Nice sky color!', '2005-05-20 22:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401698, 177569, 8125, '<td valign="top">Although this is simple - I find that I like it a lot.  My only wish would be to have some interesting colors in the sky - but we can''t have everything I suppose.  :-)</td>', 'Although this is simple - I find that I like it a lot.  My only wish would be to have some interesting colors in the sky - but we can''t have everything I suppose.  :-)', '2005-05-20 22:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401701, 177660, 7485, '<td valign="top">Interesting almost-duetone, but way too much sharpening</td>', 'Interesting almost-duetone, but way too much sharpening', '2005-05-20 22:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401703, 178037, 8125, '<td valign="top">Great coloring in the sky - however I wish you silhouette subject was a little more interesting.</td>', 'Great coloring in the sky - however I wish you silhouette subject was a little more interesting.', '2005-05-20 22:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401704, 175917, 7910, '<td valign="top">Looks like a bad case of the jaggies.  Could be the way it''s downsized and compressed?</td>', 'Looks like a bad case of the jaggies.  Could be the way it''s downsized and compressed?', '2005-05-20 22:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401706, 176132, 8125, '<td valign="top">I find the large white spot overtakes this photo and ruins the great coloring you were able to capture.</td>', 'I find the large white spot overtakes this photo and ruins the great coloring you were able to capture.', '2005-05-20 22:47:40.000000', NULL, 1);
