(1401709, 177999, 8125, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!!</td>', 'Great shot!!!', '2005-05-20 22:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401710, 178368, 7910, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors</td>', 'Very nice colors', '2005-05-20 22:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401711, 178291, 554, '<td valign="top">great sil</td>', 'great sil', '2005-05-20 22:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401714, 178246, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow, quoting Aqua are we?  That''s probably the most interesting part of this submission.  I''m sorry, but the image and background don''t do anything for me.  I wish you luck on future challenges.</td>', 'Wow, quoting Aqua are we?  That''s probably the most interesting part of this submission.  I''m sorry, but the image and background don''t do anything for me.  I wish you luck on future challenges.', '2005-05-20 22:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401716, 177348, 7910, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with the placement of the sun.</td>', 'Nice composition with the placement of the sun.', '2005-05-20 22:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401717, 178581, 8125, '<td valign="top">I really like this image - I can''t say for any specific reasons either - but I really like it.  I can say the coloring is nice and your subject is just interesting to me.  Nice work.</td>', 'I really like this image - I can''t say for any specific reasons either - but I really like it.  I can say the coloring is nice and your subject is just interesting to me.  Nice work.', '2005-05-20 22:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401718, 178572, 554, '<td valign="top">love it..............hope you win</td>', 'love it..............hope you win', '2005-05-20 22:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401719, 177657, 7485, '<td valign="top">Millennium eye? When I was there, the pod ahead of us had just this one couple getting served champagne and strawberries. But I didn''t think of taking a great photo like this! Just wish you had cropped out that thing on the left.</td>', 'Millennium eye? When I was there, the pod ahead of us had just this one couple getting served champagne and strawberries. But I didn''t think of taking a great photo like this! Just wish you had cropped out that thing on the left.', '2005-05-20 22:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401721, 178241, 8125, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this not a silhouette.  Your image appears that it may be slighly out of focus and there are many distracting parts of this image.  Wishing you luck on future challenges.</td>', 'Unfortunately this not a silhouette.  Your image appears that it may be slighly out of focus and there are many distracting parts of this image.  Wishing you luck on future challenges.', '2005-05-20 22:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401723, 178577, 3306, '<td valign="top">Was this taken at the Baltimore Aquarium?</td>', 'Was this taken at the Baltimore Aquarium?', '2005-05-20 22:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401727, 178464, 7910, '<td valign="top">very x-files-ish.  Cool.</td>', 'very x-files-ish.  Cool.', '2005-05-20 22:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401728, 178577, 8125, '<td valign="top">I don''t really know what this image is - I don''t find it appealing and I''m not truly seeing the silhouette here.  I think those objects on the lower half of the photo are people and I think you may have taken this with a slower shutter creating the motion blur effect - but it doesn''t really work here.  Sorry... wishing you luck on future challenges.</td>', 'I don''t really know what this image is - I don''t find it appealing and I''m not truly seeing the silhouette here.  I think those objects on the lower half of the photo are people and I think you may have taken this with a slower shutter creating the motion blur effect - but it doesn''t really work here.  Sorry... wishing you luck on future challenges.', '2005-05-20 22:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401729, 178222, 3306, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what that is in the loser right corner, but this picture would be outstanding if you could have taken that out.</td>', 'I''m not sure what that is in the loser right corner, but this picture would be outstanding if you could have taken that out.', '2005-05-20 22:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401731, 178453, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2005-05-20 22:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401734, 178328, 8125, '<td valign="top">You are really close to having a really great image.  It''s not bad the way it is, but I''m seeing what appears to be a slight tilt and I wish the horizon were a little more interesting.  There is an image in the Silhouette I challenge that is similar using a ''cowgirl'' against a sunset and that''s what I''m thinking of...</td>', 'You are really close to having a really great image.  It''s not bad the way it is, but I''m seeing what appears to be a slight tilt and I wish the horizon were a little more interesting.  There is an image in the Silhouette I challenge that is similar using a ''cowgirl'' against a sunset and that''s what I''m thinking of...', '2005-05-20 22:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401735, 178538, 1827, '<td valign="top">One of my top three photos for this challenge.  I love the composition - it''s just great the way the red thing on the fishing pole pulls your eyes into that portion of the photo.  I like the gentle orange of the sunset,  the companionship, the fact that the companion (child? spouse?) is tired after a long day.  Just lovely.  10</td>', 'One of my top three photos for this challenge.  I love the composition - it''s just great the way the red thing on the fishing pole pulls your eyes into that portion of the photo.  I like the gentle orange of the sunset,  the companionship, the fact that the companion (child? spouse?) is tired after a long day.  Just lovely.  10', '2005-05-20 22:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401736, 178558, 7910, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene.  It would be better without that hot white gash across the sky, but probably not much you could do about it.</td>', 'Wonderful scene.  It would be better without that hot white gash across the sky, but probably not much you could do about it.', '2005-05-20 22:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401737, 178342, 7485, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Would be even better with a much tighter crop on the left and slightly tighter on the right and above.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Would be even better with a much tighter crop on the left and slightly tighter on the right and above.', '2005-05-20 22:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401739, 176200, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very timely picture. You are obviously a Star Wars fan! Good capture.</td>', 'Very timely picture. You are obviously a Star Wars fan! Good capture.', '2005-05-20 22:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401740, 176255, 8125, '<td valign="top">I wish I had great things to say here, but this photo isn''t interesting at all.  The coloring in the sky isn''t really good and the ''scene or subject'' is nothing really to look at.  I''m sorry - I wish you luck in future challenges!</td>', 'I wish I had great things to say here, but this photo isn''t interesting at all.  The coloring in the sky isn''t really good and the ''scene or subject'' is nothing really to look at.  I''m sorry - I wish you luck in future challenges!', '2005-05-20 22:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401742, 178207, 1827, '<td valign="top">Update: This is one of my top three photos for this challenge.  I like the grittiness of the black and white, which matches the surroundings and the photojournalistic feel of the shot.  I like that you managed a true silhouette without blowing the higlights in your background - somethign that wasn''t acheived often in this challenge I thought.  And as aforementioned, I dig the light.  10<br/> <br/>The light on the hat is a nice touch.  I like the moodiness of this.</td>', 'Update: This is one of my top three photos for this challenge.  I like the grittiness of the black and white, which matches the surroundings and the photojournalistic feel of the shot.  I like that you managed a true silhouette without blowing the higlights in your background - somethign that wasn''t acheived often in this challenge I thought.  And as aforementioned, I dig the light.  10 The light on the hat is a nice touch.  I like the moodiness of this.', '2005-05-20 23:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401744, 178563, 3306, '<td valign="top">Love the mood of this picture. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Love the mood of this picture. One of my favorites.', '2005-05-20 23:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401745, 178460, 3306, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. Great shot.</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. Great shot.', '2005-05-20 23:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401746, 178563, 1827, '<td valign="top">One of my top three photos for this challenge.  I love the contrast of the girl''s silhouette versus the boy in full view.  I am drawn into the solitude of the photo - despite depicting two people, it really gives you a sense of being alone.  I can easily get lost in either person''s world.  The boy, whiling away an afternoon, bored but intent.  The girl longing to be elsewhere, even her pose helps the viewer imagine her face lost in thought.  The lighting is wonderful.  The sepia is just perfect, and this coming from one who is not a fan of sepia. 10 and into my favs it goes.</td>', 'One of my top three photos for this challenge.  I love the contrast of the girl''s silhouette versus the boy in full view.  I am drawn into the solitude of the photo - despite depicting two people, it really gives you a sense of being alone.  I can easily get lost in either person''s world.  The boy, whiling away an afternoon, bored but intent.  The girl longing to be elsewhere, even her pose helps the viewer imagine her face lost in thought.  The lighting is wonderful.  The sepia is just perfect, and this coming from one who is not a fan of sepia. 10 and into my favs it goes.', '2005-05-20 23:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401748, 177398, 7485, '<td valign="top">Could have been good if you brought the black-point way up in Photoshop (or any other photo editor that lets you edit the histogram)</td>', 'Could have been good if you brought the black-point way up in Photoshop (or any other photo editor that lets you edit the histogram)', '2005-05-20 23:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401749, 178572, 1827, '<td valign="top">The angle here is stunning.  I would love this even without the dramatic sky.  I hope the sky is mostly natural and not assisted too much in PS just because that''s my preference, but either way, this is a terrific shot.  I expect this will either ribbon, or else really suffer from people who don''t want to see anymore PSed skies.  9 from me.</td>', 'The angle here is stunning.  I would love this even without the dramatic sky.  I hope the sky is mostly natural and not assisted too much in PS just because that''s my preference, but either way, this is a terrific shot.  I expect this will either ribbon, or else really suffer from people who don''t want to see anymore PSed skies.  9 from me.', '2005-05-20 23:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401751, 178496, 1827, '<td valign="top">Refreshing to see somethign so different from what everyone else has submitted.  Very well executed.  Love the hues.  Lighting is suberb.</td>', 'Refreshing to see somethign so different from what everyone else has submitted.  Very well executed.  Love the hues.  Lighting is suberb.', '2005-05-20 23:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401771, 176132, 17890, '<td valign="top">i really like this siloutte and overall effect of this...my eye is drawn to the bright light at the top of the photo, a tighter crop may have been more effective imo...good luck!</td>', 'i really like this siloutte and overall effect of this...my eye is drawn to the bright light at the top of the photo, a tighter crop may have been more effective imo...good luck!', '2005-05-20 23:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
