(1401861, 178083, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very nice reds in the sky, I may have captured more sky but hey, it''s good</td>', 'Very nice reds in the sky, I may have captured more sky but hey, it''s good', '2005-05-21 00:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401863, 178538, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the two subjects. However, because this is only a silhouette, the close placement of the two people makes it unclear what their relative position is and they seem to blend together. If possible, I would have had them move farther apart or move the camera to a different angle to increase the separation.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the two subjects. However, because this is only a silhouette, the close placement of the two people makes it unclear what their relative position is and they seem to blend together. If possible, I would have had them move farther apart or move the camera to a different angle to increase the separation.', '2005-05-21 00:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401865, 178130, 33515, '<td valign="top">very nice photo, the back lighting is very good</td>', 'very nice photo, the back lighting is very good', '2005-05-21 00:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401866, 178452, 33515, '<td valign="top">Best one I have seen so far, very imaginative</td>', 'Best one I have seen so far, very imaginative', '2005-05-21 00:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401868, 177036, 32033, '<td valign="top">I would like this for the light challenge</td>', 'I would like this for the light challenge', '2005-05-21 00:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401869, 177703, 33515, '<td valign="top">Sunsets on the coast.......</td>', 'Sunsets on the coast.......', '2005-05-21 00:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401871, 178241, 10261, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, but I can''t see how it meets the challenge. The portrait crop mirrors the shape of the frames reflected in the lens, but I think that squaring the image slightly to include a little more breathing room to the left and right of the lens would have improved the image.</td>', 'I really like this image, but I can''t see how it meets the challenge. The portrait crop mirrors the shape of the frames reflected in the lens, but I think that squaring the image slightly to include a little more breathing room to the left and right of the lens would have improved the image.', '2005-05-21 00:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401873, 178271, 33515, '<td valign="top">Great ides, don''t like the baggy pants on the guy</td>', 'Great ides, don''t like the baggy pants on the guy', '2005-05-21 00:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401874, 177700, 35321, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and composition, though for a  silhouette you can still see a lot of detail on a large portion of the horse.   Using a larger aperture to blur the background a bit more might be helpful.  :-) 6</td>', 'Nice framing and composition, though for a  silhouette you can still see a lot of detail on a large portion of the horse.   Using a larger aperture to blur the background a bit more might be helpful.  :-) 6', '2005-05-21 00:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401876, 176450, 26756, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge.  Nice foreground subject enjoying the view, and I like how you''ve managed such sharp focus throughout the picture.  Wonderful, rich colors.</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge.  Nice foreground subject enjoying the view, and I like how you''ve managed such sharp focus throughout the picture.  Wonderful, rich colors.', '2005-05-21 00:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401877, 177358, 33515, '<td valign="top">Sure that''s a male? Nice photo</td>', 'Sure that''s a male? Nice photo', '2005-05-21 00:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401878, 178335, 35321, '<td valign="top">Great subject and execution!  Not sure I understand the title though. :-} 8</td>', 'Great subject and execution!  Not sure I understand the title though. :-} 8', '2005-05-21 00:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401879, 178572, 33515, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning.', '2005-05-21 00:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401880, 178482, 10261, '<td valign="top">Dodging the tip of the steeple was a good idea, but you went so far that the editing is obvious. In my opinion a somewhat more subtle edit would have been much better. Even so, this is one of my top picks so far. I really like the shot''s moody feel.</td>', 'Dodging the tip of the steeple was a good idea, but you went so far that the editing is obvious. In my opinion a somewhat more subtle edit would have been much better. Even so, this is one of my top picks so far. I really like the shot''s moody feel.', '2005-05-21 00:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401882, 178585, 26756, '<td valign="top">Really, really nice.  Definitely not a photo everyone would think to take and you''ve pulled it off perfectly.  The detail, focus and back-lit colors are great.  And the shallow dof and color of the background really enhances and blends perfect with the subject.  Gorgeous. 10</td>', 'Really, really nice.  Definitely not a photo everyone would think to take and you''ve pulled it off perfectly.  The detail, focus and back-lit colors are great.  And the shallow dof and color of the background really enhances and blends perfect with the subject.  Gorgeous. 10', '2005-05-21 00:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401885, 178390, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks very over-processed.</td>', 'This looks very over-processed.', '2005-05-21 00:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401888, 178285, 33515, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the angle of the stairs</td>', 'Nice, I like the angle of the stairs', '2005-05-21 00:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
