(1401897, 178563, 27894, '<td valign="top">Manny is that you again? :) great photo. Love the shadows. Love the blow out windows works great for your image. Always look forward to see what you come up with next :)</td>', 'Manny is that you again? :) great photo. Love the shadows. Love the blow out windows works great for your image. Always look forward to see what you come up with next :)', '2005-05-21 00:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
