(1401914, 177795, 35321, '<td valign="top">Very nice, though the silhouette of the branch above and trees behind distracts a bit from the silhouette of the church.   Moving to the right to get a silhouette of just the church might lessen the distraction from the background trees and improve the composition, though I understand your wanting to get the sun behind the cross.</td>', 'Very nice, though the silhouette of the branch above and trees behind distracts a bit from the silhouette of the church.   Moving to the right to get a silhouette of just the church might lessen the distraction from the background trees and improve the composition, though I understand your wanting to get the sun behind the cross.', '2005-05-21 01:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
