(1403370, 178560, 22734, '<td valign="top">An impressive capture with great subject matter and whose title is so closely related. The sunset is well treated to exploit the good qualities of the silhoutte. Certainly, a great wall hanger. Bump.</td>', 'An impressive capture with great subject matter and whose title is so closely related. The sunset is well treated to exploit the good qualities of the silhoutte. Certainly, a great wall hanger. Bump.', '2005-05-22 02:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
