(1403412, 177541, 36141, '<td valign="top">Really like this photo, especially the colors. The upperhalf might be a bit overexposed, but that doesn''t matter to me.<br/> <br/>Titia</td>', 'Really like this photo, especially the colors. The upperhalf might be a bit overexposed, but that doesn''t matter to me. Titia', '2005-05-22 02:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403416, 177990, 36141, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice photo, but to me it''s not really a silhouette. It would have been though if you had turned it into B&amp;W and darkened it a little.</td>', 'It''s a very nice photo, but to me it''s not really a silhouette. It would have been though if you had turned it into B&W and darkened it a little.', '2005-05-22 03:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403419, 176916, 36141, '<td valign="top">nice colors.</td>', 'nice colors.', '2005-05-22 03:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403425, 177770, 36141, '<td valign="top">To me it looses power because of the sun right behind the wire. The orange parts are beautiful and strong, but nevertheless a nice catch.</td>', 'To me it looses power because of the sun right behind the wire. The orange parts are beautiful and strong, but nevertheless a nice catch.', '2005-05-22 03:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403442, 178464, 36141, '<td valign="top">I said WOW at first sight, but at a closer look I can''t figure out where the light actually is coming from and in wich hand she''s holding the door. I''d say she''s holding the door in her left hand and her right hand is holding the door post, but then the shadow on the floor doesn''t make sense.  It could well be the other way around too. Getting a bit confused, but nevertheless, I like it very much, beautiful green color and therefor will rate it high.</td>', 'I said WOW at first sight, but at a closer look I can''t figure out where the light actually is coming from and in wich hand she''s holding the door. I''d say she''s holding the door in her left hand and her right hand is holding the door post, but then the shadow on the floor doesn''t make sense.  It could well be the other way around too. Getting a bit confused, but nevertheless, I like it very much, beautiful green color and therefor will rate it high.', '2005-05-22 03:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403443, 178384, 36141, '<td valign="top">How do you know it was the last plane? LOL Like your colors.</td>', 'How do you know it was the last plane? LOL Like your colors.', '2005-05-22 03:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403445, 178565, 36141, '<td valign="top">Play? I would say '' cross their swords'' . Very nice cityscape.</td>', 'Play? I would say '' cross their swords'' . Very nice cityscape.', '2005-05-22 03:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403451, 178255, 36141, '<td valign="top">Pity this photo is devided in two parts due to placing the horizon right there in the middle. It''s a silhouette alright, but the upper part with the clouds is too strong, it distracts the eye from what the challenge is about. Both parts are beautiful, but I should''ve cropped it just above the horizon.</td>', 'Pity this photo is devided in two parts due to placing the horizon right there in the middle. It''s a silhouette alright, but the upper part with the clouds is too strong, it distracts the eye from what the challenge is about. Both parts are beautiful, but I should''ve cropped it just above the horizon.', '2005-05-22 03:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403456, 177890, 36141, '<td valign="top">Mmmm...don''t quite get the picture what the gun is doing there. It really does dominate the photo, because it gives one no other choice then see ''holding power over...'', while one could''ve seen ''adoration for...''  if the gun had been left out.</td>', 'Mmmm...don''t quite get the picture what the gun is doing there. It really does dominate the photo, because it gives one no other choice then see ''holding power over...'', while one could''ve seen ''adoration for...''  if the gun had been left out.', '2005-05-22 03:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403461, 178517, 36141, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the times, when ladies were waiting for their man to come home, dreaming away in emptiness.</td>', 'Reminds me of the times, when ladies were waiting for their man to come home, dreaming away in emptiness.', '2005-05-22 03:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403463, 177723, 36141, '<td valign="top">The concept is nice, but in my opinion you shoud''ve blurred the background more. Now it''s getting all the attention and one has to look for the silhouettes.</td>', 'The concept is nice, but in my opinion you shoud''ve blurred the background more. Now it''s getting all the attention and one has to look for the silhouettes.', '2005-05-22 04:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
