(1403711, 178241, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept: Interesting, but muddled with flaws of the subject:  nail holes, wire, gold thing.<br/>Center focus: Too busy to remain interesting.<br/>Challenge: I cannot see it.<br/>Composition: Centered focus, poor crop.<br/>Sorry, I just have nothing really good to say about this image.</td>', 'Concept: Interesting, but muddled with flaws of the subject:  nail holes, wire, gold thing.Center focus: Too busy to remain interesting.Challenge: I cannot see it.Composition: Centered focus, poor crop.Sorry, I just have nothing really good to say about this image.', '2005-05-22 10:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403718, 177581, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept: Shadow on foredrop, not really a sil, but acceptable.  What hurts this is that the sheet is all too present with its wrinkles and own shadows.  The Meditative pose itself could be a winning image, but it does not seem natural or well placed in the image.</td>', 'Concept: Shadow on foredrop, not really a sil, but acceptable.  What hurts this is that the sheet is all too present with its wrinkles and own shadows.  The Meditative pose itself could be a winning image, but it does not seem natural or well placed in the image.', '2005-05-22 10:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403720, 178574, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept: Hurt this image<br/>Composition: Appears to be a centered over exposed skylight that is granting light to some support structures inside.<br/>Challenge:  Too much of a stretch.</td>', 'Concept: Hurt this imageComposition: Appears to be a centered over exposed skylight that is granting light to some support structures inside.Challenge:  Too much of a stretch.', '2005-05-22 10:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403722, 177492, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept: Snapshot - Hey I hear a chopper overhead.<br/>Composition: Decent, not centered.<br/>Subject: At its size, not interesting.<br/>Technical:  Caught some detail on the chopper, can be tough against overcast backgrounds.</td>', 'Concept: Snapshot - Hey I hear a chopper overhead.Composition: Decent, not centered.Subject: At its size, not interesting.Technical:  Caught some detail on the chopper, can be tough against overcast backgrounds.', '2005-05-22 10:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403723, 178586, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept: Interesting Idea that failed in the crop and potentially the curves.<br/>Composition: Subject is well placed, but the colors surrounding it appear to be only shadows, in fact shadows that would have been created by almost inverting the curves within PS.<br/>Subject:  Moth is actually thru-lit, not really a sil.</td>', 'Concept: Interesting Idea that failed in the crop and potentially the curves.Composition: Subject is well placed, but the colors surrounding it appear to be only shadows, in fact shadows that would have been created by almost inverting the curves within PS.Subject:  Moth is actually thru-lit, not really a sil.', '2005-05-22 10:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403724, 178499, 28261, '<td valign="top">Composition: Cross is almost centered, losing a lot of artistic potential here.<br/>Challenge: Yup, its a sil.<br/>Concept:  Could have had a lot more impact with a different crop and a sky that didn''t come off looking like it had been harshly adjusted in PS.<br/>Major Flaw: Lens smear/Sensor dust very close to subject.</td>', 'Composition: Cross is almost centered, losing a lot of artistic potential here.Challenge: Yup, its a sil.Concept:  Could have had a lot more impact with a different crop and a sky that didn''t come off looking like it had been harshly adjusted in PS.Major Flaw: Lens smear/Sensor dust very close to subject.', '2005-05-22 10:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403729, 177447, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept: Bridge Sil. Works for challenge, but is hurt by composition.<br/>Composition: Bridge is at top area, emphasizing the water and the top of the bridge is cut off, further lowering its importance.  The castles and support structure then become the focus and these are not sil.<br/>Colors:  Seem very washed out, hazy giving a snapshot feel to this image.</td>', 'Concept: Bridge Sil. Works for challenge, but is hurt by composition.Composition: Bridge is at top area, emphasizing the water and the top of the bridge is cut off, further lowering its importance.  The castles and support structure then become the focus and these are not sil.Colors:  Seem very washed out, hazy giving a snapshot feel to this image.', '2005-05-22 11:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403732, 177693, 28261, '<td valign="top">Challenge:  Not really or so unimportant to the rest of the composition as to be ignored.<br/>Composition: A front and back lit powerstation with dock lights surrounded by black - Reflection is almost not viewable or unnoticeable.<br/>Concept:  A closer view of this with more detail in the surrounding might be something worth investigating.  Looks to be a tough sell tho with the dock lights and thier extreme luminance.<br/>Overall:  Too dark and image to hold an attention span.</td>', 'Challenge:  Not really or so unimportant to the rest of the composition as to be ignored.Composition: A front and back lit powerstation with dock lights surrounded by black - Reflection is almost not viewable or unnoticeable.Concept:  A closer view of this with more detail in the surrounding might be something worth investigating.  Looks to be a tough sell tho with the dock lights and thier extreme luminance.Overall:  Too dark and image to hold an attention span.', '2005-05-22 11:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403733, 178368, 27562, '<td valign="top">The raised pinkie makes it.  Great work.</td>', 'The raised pinkie makes it.  Great work.', '2005-05-22 11:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403736, 178464, 28261, '<td valign="top">By far the best interpretation on the challenge.  I hope this wins.   I wish she did not look like she was wearing a hood, as it would change the mood just slightly, but I cannot critique it.  The concept works so well.</td>', 'By far the best interpretation on the challenge.  I hope this wins.   I wish she did not look like she was wearing a hood, as it would change the mood just slightly, but I cannot critique it.  The concept works so well.', '2005-05-22 11:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403738, 177510, 28261, '<td valign="top">I rally like this image and expect it to do very well, some will harp on the centered highlight or political nature.  As a red-blooded American I can''t help but love this image and the emotional impact it provides.  This is one that should be hanging on many walls.</td>', 'I rally like this image and expect it to do very well, some will harp on the centered highlight or political nature.  As a red-blooded American I can''t help but love this image and the emotional impact it provides.  This is one that should be hanging on many walls.', '2005-05-22 11:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
