(1404045, 178444, 31213, '<td valign="top">I''m not the biggest fan of the cropping here.  Love the subjects and the colors in the sky.  Nice work.</td>', 'I''m not the biggest fan of the cropping here.  Love the subjects and the colors in the sky.  Nice work.', '2005-05-22 16:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404048, 178428, 31213, '<td valign="top">Not aq big fan of the hazy border thing you did.  Good candid shot and excellent use of silhouette though.</td>', 'Not aq big fan of the hazy border thing you did.  Good candid shot and excellent use of silhouette though.', '2005-05-22 16:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404049, 177879, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love the interesting angle of the shot.  Cool sky too.  Only complaint is that I can see some detail in the inner part of the ferris wheel...but overall i cant complain. :)</td>', 'Love the interesting angle of the shot.  Cool sky too.  Only complaint is that I can see some detail in the inner part of the ferris wheel...but overall i cant complain. :)', '2005-05-22 16:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404050, 178563, 31213, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus and sepia tone feel.  Looks very nice.</td>', 'I like the soft focus and sepia tone feel.  Looks very nice.', '2005-05-22 16:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404053, 178565, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great sihouette, very good colours.</td>', 'Great sihouette, very good colours.', '2005-05-22 16:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404055, 178492, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great sihouette, I like it very much...10</td>', 'Great sihouette, I like it very much...10', '2005-05-22 16:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404057, 178130, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great idea and outcome.</td>', 'Great idea and outcome.', '2005-05-22 16:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404058, 177263, 36060, '<td valign="top">Very good silhouette shot, great colours.</td>', 'Very good silhouette shot, great colours.', '2005-05-22 16:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404059, 178382, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great outcome.</td>', 'Great outcome.', '2005-05-22 16:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404060, 177235, 17033, '<td valign="top">Guessing E301 from the style and subject matter. Eye-catching symmetry really grabbed my jaded attention.</td>', 'Guessing E301 from the style and subject matter. Eye-catching symmetry really grabbed my jaded attention.', '2005-05-22 16:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404062, 178568, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette and composition....10</td>', 'Great silhouette and composition....10', '2005-05-22 16:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404063, 178243, 36060, '<td valign="top">Very good shot indeed.</td>', 'Very good shot indeed.', '2005-05-22 16:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404067, 178245, 17033, '<td valign="top">Uber-capture. 10</td>', 'Uber-capture. 10', '2005-05-22 16:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404069, 176889, 17033, '<td valign="top">refreshingly different from the usual dull musician shots....wel done</td>', 'refreshingly different from the usual dull musician shots....wel done', '2005-05-22 16:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404071, 177121, 17033, '<td valign="top">Good contemporary feel to it</td>', 'Good contemporary feel to it', '2005-05-22 16:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404074, 178572, 17033, '<td valign="top">I''d have placed this top if it wasn''t for that high-speed elephant! Brilliant composition. Only crit is right hand side of the sky feels a bit over-processed</td>', 'I''d have placed this top if it wasn''t for that high-speed elephant! Brilliant composition. Only crit is right hand side of the sky feels a bit over-processed', '2005-05-22 16:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404267, 177956, 6667, '<td valign="top">You deserve a high score not only for the image. . . but catching the sun on the sagging wires. . . priceless!  BOL  8</td>', 'You deserve a high score not only for the image. . . but catching the sun on the sagging wires. . . priceless!  BOL  8', '2005-05-22 19:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404274, 178567, 28261, '<td valign="top">Challenge: Yup its a sil.<br/>Concept:  Is there one?  This appears to be a happenstance.<br/>Composition: Balanced in the thirds concept<br/>Subject:  Could be interesting but it is so (thin) minor to the background that it is easily overlooked.  On one side, the wire starts a wave pattern that if repeated a few more times would stand on its own, but it ends prematurely into a cacophany of other shapes that hurt the overall image and cause it to be less interesting than its potential.</td>', 'Challenge: Yup its a sil.Concept:  Is there one?  This appears to be a happenstance.Composition: Balanced in the thirds conceptSubject:  Could be interesting but it is so (thin) minor to the background that it is easily overlooked.  On one side, the wire starts a wave pattern that if repeated a few more times would stand on its own, but it ends prematurely into a cacophany of other shapes that hurt the overall image and cause it to be less interesting than its potential.', '2005-05-22 19:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404279, 178530, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept: Hurts this image as a shadow cast on a sheet does not really come off as a sil.<br/>Challenge: See above.<br/>Composition: Centered but the crop helps to balance this technique.<br/>Major Flaw:  The concept relies on a smooth foreground and the sheet is way too apparent and wrinkled while the shadow is unevenly cast and further detracts from the potential.</td>', 'Concept: Hurts this image as a shadow cast on a sheet does not really come off as a sil.Challenge: See above.Composition: Centered but the crop helps to balance this technique.Major Flaw:  The concept relies on a smooth foreground and the sheet is way too apparent and wrinkled while the shadow is unevenly cast and further detracts from the potential.', '2005-05-22 19:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404283, 178329, 28261, '<td valign="top">Subject:  Torn on this one.  It is minimalist and well balanced due to crop, but seems less than interesting which detracts from the whole.<br/>Concept:  Good Idea, perhaps the division (space) between the two is what is causing me to not appreciate this image as I should.<br/>Challenge:  Bit too much detail in the top portion of the branch.  Almost side-lit which does not lend well to the concept of a sil.</td>', 'Subject:  Torn on this one.  It is minimalist and well balanced due to crop, but seems less than interesting which detracts from the whole.Concept:  Good Idea, perhaps the division (space) between the two is what is causing me to not appreciate this image as I should.Challenge:  Bit too much detail in the top portion of the branch.  Almost side-lit which does not lend well to the concept of a sil.', '2005-05-22 19:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404287, 178128, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept:  Nice Idea, but fails in the composition.<br/>Composition:  Backlit by what could be a monitor, replica buildings come off cheap and the background is not realistic.  Centered subject here could work much better with a different crop-ratio or orientation.<br/>Challenge:  Not enough dark where there should be.  Too much detail in the buildings.</td>', 'Concept:  Nice Idea, but fails in the composition.Composition:  Backlit by what could be a monitor, replica buildings come off cheap and the background is not realistic.  Centered subject here could work much better with a different crop-ratio or orientation.Challenge:  Not enough dark where there should be.  Too much detail in the buildings.', '2005-05-22 19:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404291, 177398, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept:  Nice idea, but composition detracts too much.<br/>Composition:  Good placement of subject and light, but very oof, with light streaming through the wings, hurting the challenge topic.  Blur factor on background and subject make this seem very overprocessed on a ho-hum image.<br/>Challenge:  Almost.  Too much light/detail in the subject.</td>', 'Concept:  Nice idea, but composition detracts too much.Composition:  Good placement of subject and light, but very oof, with light streaming through the wings, hurting the challenge topic.  Blur factor on background and subject make this seem very overprocessed on a ho-hum image.Challenge:  Almost.  Too much light/detail in the subject.', '2005-05-22 19:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404297, 178256, 28261, '<td valign="top">Challenge: Sil or Shadowcast?  The very question will hurt this image, although technically a sil, in the ''purist''s'' minds, this will cost you.<br/>Composition:  There is an uneven lighting top to bottom that causes some distraction and lends a yellowish cast to part of the image.<br/>Concept:  Fails on interest level, but does not hurt or help the overall.</td>', 'Challenge: Sil or Shadowcast?  The very question will hurt this image, although technically a sil, in the ''purist''s'' minds, this will cost you.Composition:  There is an uneven lighting top to bottom that causes some distraction and lends a yellowish cast to part of the image.Concept:  Fails on interest level, but does not hurt or help the overall.', '2005-05-22 19:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404300, 177978, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept: Good subject, very bad background choice.<br/>Composition:  The screen would have been better cropped to show no evidence of the window sill.<br/>Challenge:  Yes, definitely, but the background is so harshly lit and ultimately ugly as to detract from the potential that this image could have achieved.</td>', 'Concept: Good subject, very bad background choice.Composition:  The screen would have been better cropped to show no evidence of the window sill.Challenge:  Yes, definitely, but the background is so harshly lit and ultimately ugly as to detract from the potential that this image could have achieved.', '2005-05-22 19:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404311, 178246, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept:  Humor: Stands even without the title, but is hurt by the composition.<br/>Composition:  Backlit background, shows too much fabric detail which becomes an element of the shot and hurts the overall.  Crop/Negative space shows too much of the distracting fabric.<br/>Challenge:  Yes definitely.  In fact redeeming quality here is the red cast on the main subject that lends a bit more interest to that area.</td>', 'Concept:  Humor: Stands even without the title, but is hurt by the composition.Composition:  Backlit background, shows too much fabric detail which becomes an element of the shot and hurts the overall.  Crop/Negative space shows too much of the distracting fabric.Challenge:  Yes definitely.  In fact redeeming quality here is the red cast on the main subject that lends a bit more interest to that area.', '2005-05-22 19:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404315, 178566, 28261, '<td valign="top">Concept:  Good Idea, not well executed.  Comes off cheap (toys and shadow boxing)<br/>Composition:  Lighting seems good, but the use of shadowcasting as a sil will hurt this image.  Shadows themselves are uneven and come off blurry.<br/>Challenge:  Hurt by shadowcast as opposed to backlighting.</td>', 'Concept:  Good Idea, not well executed.  Comes off cheap (toys and shadow boxing)Composition:  Lighting seems good, but the use of shadowcasting as a sil will hurt this image.  Shadows themselves are uneven and come off blurry.Challenge:  Hurt by shadowcast as opposed to backlighting.', '2005-05-22 20:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404321, 178489, 38152, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning...love it!</td>', 'Simply stunning...love it!', '2005-05-22 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404358, 178033, 7992, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and color.</td>', 'Lovely composition and color.', '2005-05-22 20:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404361, 178492, 7992, '<td valign="top">Unique concept for this challenge--well done!</td>', 'Unique concept for this challenge--well done!', '2005-05-22 20:33:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1404362, 176117, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice image, if you get rid of the noise.  Neatimage would make a huge difference here.<br/> <br/>Edit after results:<br/>How did this comment get here?  It was made for a completely different picture.  Great shot.  I expected it to do better.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-23 07:59:54.</i></td>', 'Nice image, if you get rid of the noise.  Neatimage would make a huge difference here. Edit after results:How did this comment get here?  It was made for a completely different picture.  Great shot.  I expected it to do better.', '2005-05-22 20:34:03.000000', '2005-05-23 08:59:54.000000', 1),
(1404370, 177358, 7992, '<td valign="top">lol - great silhouette!</td>', 'lol - great silhouette!', '2005-05-22 20:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404371, 177235, 11738, '<td valign="top">Now this is a nice shot!  My first reaction to it was : cooooolll!  Great execution.  Love the feel of this one.  One of my favourites.</td>', 'Now this is a nice shot!  My first reaction to it was : cooooolll!  Great execution.  Love the feel of this one.  One of my favourites.', '2005-05-22 20:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404402, 177805, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice with great natural pattern variations. A tad darker would increased the impact more, but not worry, the image is pleasant as is.</td>', 'Very nice with great natural pattern variations. A tad darker would increased the impact more, but not worry, the image is pleasant as is.', '2005-05-22 20:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404404, 178514, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is such a lovely image whose impression could have been enhamced further by avoiding the magenta tint which hardly ever appears in skies. Overall the image is strong and it gets bumped.</td>', 'This is such a lovely image whose impression could have been enhamced further by avoiding the magenta tint which hardly ever appears in skies. Overall the image is strong and it gets bumped.', '2005-05-22 20:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404408, 177036, 22734, '<td valign="top">What a site. A tree whose trunk is encased inside a home! Great capture. A little more brighter would have help define the bottom so. Spectacular and lovely. Bump.</td>', 'What a site. A tree whose trunk is encased inside a home! Great capture. A little more brighter would have help define the bottom so. Spectacular and lovely. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404409, 176296, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great slihoutte with a a beautiful liquid sky. Bump.</td>', 'Great slihoutte with a a beautiful liquid sky. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404410, 178328, 22734, '<td valign="top">Touching upon the graphical with the pushed sky color, however, the silhoutte and composition as well as the tilted angle add a special flavor. Bump.</td>', 'Touching upon the graphical with the pushed sky color, however, the silhoutte and composition as well as the tilted angle add a special flavor. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404413, 178562, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great silhoutte and great water and sky. Bump.</td>', 'Great silhoutte and great water and sky. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404417, 176533, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great sky and great silhoutte. Bump.</td>', 'Great sky and great silhoutte. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404421, 178452, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is quite a good combination of the photographic and graphical approach done with impeccable good taste. It looks like it can be a popular poster. Bump.</td>', 'This is quite a good combination of the photographic and graphical approach done with impeccable good taste. It looks like it can be a popular poster. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404423, 178571, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice theme. My personal taste would be for  sharper necks, but the effect is cool Bump.</td>', 'A very nice theme. My personal taste would be for  sharper necks, but the effect is cool Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404424, 177648, 22734, '<td valign="top">What a winner of a silhoutte does a french horn produce. Bump.</td>', 'What a winner of a silhoutte does a french horn produce. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404425, 177766, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very light hearted. Bump.</td>', 'Very light hearted. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404427, 177263, 22734, '<td valign="top">More charming than a serpent. The golden tones and setting sun can not be better. Bump.</td>', 'More charming than a serpent. The golden tones and setting sun can not be better. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404428, 178428, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice sepia with good water activity and soft sky. Bump.</td>', 'Very nice sepia with good water activity and soft sky. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404429, 177092, 22734, '<td valign="top">Ah, lady in waiting. Expressive rock formation leading to the main silhoutte. Bump.</td>', 'Ah, lady in waiting. Expressive rock formation leading to the main silhoutte. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404431, 177466, 22734, '<td valign="top">An outstanding trombone study. Hope he plays as good as this image is. Bump.</td>', 'An outstanding trombone study. Hope he plays as good as this image is. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404434, 177990, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice study and great use of a screen to isolate the imagery. Bump.</td>', 'A very nice study and great use of a screen to isolate the imagery. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404456, 178548, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice image with that wistful feel. Bump.</td>', 'A very nice image with that wistful feel. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404460, 178357, 22734, '<td valign="top">A sharper focus would have enhanced this image even more. Note that I say, even more. As is it is a nice study with the splash of the sun and then the pleasant blue shades of sky. Bump.</td>', 'A sharper focus would have enhanced this image even more. Note that I say, even more. As is it is a nice study with the splash of the sun and then the pleasant blue shades of sky. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404462, 178045, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great spinning motion and what a turbulaent sky. Bump.</td>', 'Great spinning motion and what a turbulaent sky. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404465, 178477, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great way to steal a silhoutte and present a lovely background. Bump.</td>', 'Great way to steal a silhoutte and present a lovely background. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404467, 177475, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great capture with a very lovely and obedient sky to bring out the silhoutte beauty. Bump.</td>', 'Great capture with a very lovely and obedient sky to bring out the silhoutte beauty. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404469, 178565, 22734, '<td valign="top">This town is cooking. Lol. Very good capture. Bump.</td>', 'This town is cooking. Lol. Very good capture. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404470, 177723, 22734, '<td valign="top">Ah, silhouttes adornewd in bokeh. Just a hair closer would have increased the impact. Bump.</td>', 'Ah, silhouttes adornewd in bokeh. Just a hair closer would have increased the impact. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404472, 177393, 22734, '<td valign="top">Yep, that is where they have placed us smokers. Bump.</td>', 'Yep, that is where they have placed us smokers. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404474, 178460, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great silhoutte which takes advantage of the flame to add realism. Very well done, you have my congratulations on this intriguing image. 7</td>', 'Great silhoutte which takes advantage of the flame to add realism. Very well done, you have my congratulations on this intriguing image. 7', '2005-05-22 21:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404476, 178532, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well lit to bring out the crawling company. Bump.</td>', 'Very well lit to bring out the crawling company. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404478, 178256, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great use of the shadow to impart the silhoutte feel. The brick texture as it plays in light and shadow is just nice to look at. Bump.</td>', 'Great use of the shadow to impart the silhoutte feel. The brick texture as it plays in light and shadow is just nice to look at. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404479, 178464, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely. An attractive silhoutte with wonderful body position and the good use of green against the black with tha open door. Bump. Returning for another bump.</td>', 'This is just lovely. An attractive silhoutte with wonderful body position and the good use of green against the black with tha open door. Bump. Returning for another bump.', '2005-05-22 21:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404482, 176200, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great poise. may the force be with you.</td>', 'Great poise. may the force be with you.', '2005-05-22 21:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404484, 176399, 22734, '<td valign="top">The sky here is superb along with the waves to bring out the main silhoutte. Bump.</td>', 'The sky here is superb along with the waves to bring out the main silhoutte. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404485, 177721, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of the solid and transparant to add that full bodied look. Lovely. Bump.</td>', 'Lovely use of the solid and transparant to add that full bodied look. Lovely. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404486, 178037, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lovely burning sky with outstanding transitions to highlight the the poles. Bump.</td>', 'Lovely burning sky with outstanding transitions to highlight the the poles. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404490, 177500, 22734, '<td valign="top">Verging on the graphical but very strong use of solid and transparant subjects. Bump.</td>', 'Verging on the graphical but very strong use of solid and transparant subjects. Bump.', '2005-05-22 21:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404509, 177664, 33817, '<td valign="top">I love the rich blue in the sky and pin-prick stars.  Clearly poised to do well!</td>', 'I love the rich blue in the sky and pin-prick stars.  Clearly poised to do well!', '2005-05-22 22:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404511, 177465, 33817, '<td valign="top">I''m a little distracted by the halos in a few places but not enough to forget that the tumbnail screamed at me to open it and continues to do so.  Striking in its simplicity ... good luck!</td>', 'I''m a little distracted by the halos in a few places but not enough to forget that the tumbnail screamed at me to open it and continues to do so.  Striking in its simplicity ... good luck!', '2005-05-22 22:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404516, 178572, 33817, '<td valign="top">Purists might find the coloring in the sky disturbing but for me it adds drama and tension.  For a week now I''ve wondered if it might be DQ''d not because I don''t like it .. but because as an entrant myself, I fear it.  Well deserved kudos for reminding me how very much I have yet to learn!</td>', 'Purists might find the coloring in the sky disturbing but for me it adds drama and tension.  For a week now I''ve wondered if it might be DQ''d not because I don''t like it .. but because as an entrant myself, I fear it.  Well deserved kudos for reminding me how very much I have yet to learn!', '2005-05-22 22:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404524, 177394, 33817, '<td valign="top">If there''s value in detail, this photo is nearly priceless ... very good indeed!</td>', 'If there''s value in detail, this photo is nearly priceless ... very good indeed!', '2005-05-22 22:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404685, 178492, 32754, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  This is a 9..action and lots of interest with lines of the ride.</td>', 'Great shot!  This is a 9..action and lots of interest with lines of the ride.', '2005-05-22 23:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404693, 178484, 37851, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful.  Like a perfect dream.</td>', 'This is so beautiful.  Like a perfect dream.', '2005-05-22 23:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404715, 177503, 10261, '<td valign="top">The colors in the water are the most interesting part of the image. The skyline isn''t particularly noteworthy, and I''m unable to identify a specific element which you framed as the subject. <br/></td>', 'The colors in the water are the most interesting part of the image. The skyline isn''t particularly noteworthy, and I''m unable to identify a specific element which you framed as the subject. ', '2005-05-22 23:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404722, 176749, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''d like this much better if the person''s head didn''t merge with the background.</td>', 'I''d like this much better if the person''s head didn''t merge with the background.', '2005-05-22 23:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404727, 177805, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image seems to have an odd color cast to it. Aside from that, I like the image.<br/></td>', 'This image seems to have an odd color cast to it. Aside from that, I like the image.', '2005-05-22 23:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404732, 178567, 10261, '<td valign="top">That looks like razor wire, not barbed wire. I think that this might have been stronger if photographed nearly parallel to the fence, perhaps looking through the tube formed by the razor wire.</td>', 'That looks like razor wire, not barbed wire. I think that this might have been stronger if photographed nearly parallel to the fence, perhaps looking through the tube formed by the razor wire.', '2005-05-22 23:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404735, 177478, 27847, '<td valign="top">Love the mood in the photo, dreary with almost a sense of urgency. I''m not sure but it''s just any excellent shot. Wonderful!</td>', 'Love the mood in the photo, dreary with almost a sense of urgency. I''m not sure but it''s just any excellent shot. Wonderful!', '2005-05-22 23:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
