(1405535, 176243, 30018, '<td valign="top">Wow...I am so surprised to see this one finish so low.  This was my personal favorite in this challenge.  As I look at the scoring I see my 10 was one of only 4.  Not very high marks and I am so surprised.  It''s a wonderful image.  A lot better than those top 3 animal pics, in my opinion...!</td>', 'Wow...I am so surprised to see this one finish so low.  This was my personal favorite in this challenge.  As I look at the scoring I see my 10 was one of only 4.  Not very high marks and I am so surprised.  It''s a wonderful image.  A lot better than those top 3 animal pics, in my opinion...!', '2005-05-23 08:12:40.000000', NULL, 0),
