(1406315, 178566, 18868, '<td valign="top">Ladies &amp; Gents, thanks for not being too brutal -- this entry should teach me not to rush poor entries in just under the deadline.  I clearly didn''t give enough thought to the distinction between shadows and silhouettes.  As an additional disapointment, I was just out of reach -- a mere 11 places -- from the Brown Ribbon!  ;)</td>', 'Ladies & Gents, thanks for not being too brutal -- this entry should teach me not to rush poor entries in just under the deadline.  I clearly didn''t give enough thought to the distinction between shadows and silhouettes.  As an additional disapointment, I was just out of reach -- a mere 11 places -- from the Brown Ribbon!  ;)', '2005-05-23 14:58:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1406327, 178245, 33560, '<td valign="top">Congrats.  Great shot!  <br/> <br/>The grass fire is not a phenomenon stateside.  You see the world differently once you''ve spent a couple hours beating the flames out at its periphery to save the compound - something I did once or twice as a child.  This really captures the sense of threat posed by natural forces on our lives.  Isolation from which somehow makes the world seem a little less real, a little less interesting, a little less alive.  Thanks.</td>', 'Congrats.  Great shot!   The grass fire is not a phenomenon stateside.  You see the world differently once you''ve spent a couple hours beating the flames out at its periphery to save the compound - something I did once or twice as a child.  This really captures the sense of threat posed by natural forces on our lives.  Isolation from which somehow makes the world seem a little less real, a little less interesting, a little less alive.  Thanks.', '2005-05-23 15:06:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1406382, 177738, 12362, '<td valign="top">This is very unique.<br/>When it comes to making different and interesting photos, you are second to nobody Daniel.<br/>Your preparation time for each challenge must exceed an hour everytime, great work.</td>', 'This is very unique.When it comes to making different and interesting photos, you are second to nobody Daniel.Your preparation time for each challenge must exceed an hour everytime, great work.', '2005-05-23 15:47:46.000000', NULL, 0),
