(1406717, 177581, 37544, '<td valign="top">Well, this was my first contest and I didn''t bomb as bad as I thought I would.  I have never in my life done a sihouette!! All of the comments where VERY helpful. I should have gotten infront of the sheet, not behind it.  It probably would have helped if I would have ironed it too! HA!  It was actually hanging over two kitchen chairs. <br/> <br/>Even though I didn''t get in the top half of the entries, I am surprised I didn''t get in the bottom 10!  I will do better next time!  GOD BLESS all of you who gave me over a 5 for this one, you are too nice.  And whoever gave me a 10, I love you.</td>', 'Well, this was my first contest and I didn''t bomb as bad as I thought I would.  I have never in my life done a sihouette!! All of the comments where VERY helpful. I should have gotten infront of the sheet, not behind it.  It probably would have helped if I would have ironed it too! HA!  It was actually hanging over two kitchen chairs.  Even though I didn''t get in the top half of the entries, I am surprised I didn''t get in the bottom 10!  I will do better next time!  GOD BLESS all of you who gave me over a 5 for this one, you are too nice.  And whoever gave me a 10, I love you.', '2005-05-23 17:50:31.000000', NULL, 0),
