(1410474, 176742, 93, '<td valign="top">Well.. sometimes one''s predictions are almost spot on. Usually I''m not this good. lol.   Of course, most of the comments I predicted didn''t materialize.<br/> <br/>Yah, I went the subtle route.  I thought people might be inspired by this simple, reflective image.. instead of something out there, or crazy.  I guess it can''t be a photographer.. it has to be birds, in order to work that way. Also, I''m noticing that people seem to like yellow/gold a lot..</td>', 'Well.. sometimes one''s predictions are almost spot on. Usually I''m not this good. lol.   Of course, most of the comments I predicted didn''t materialize. Yah, I went the subtle route.  I thought people might be inspired by this simple, reflective image.. instead of something out there, or crazy.  I guess it can''t be a photographer.. it has to be birds, in order to work that way. Also, I''m noticing that people seem to like yellow/gold a lot..', '2005-05-25 02:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
