(2441010, 178245, 36470, '<td valign="top">Incredible capture!  These type of wildlife shots always amaze me.  The closest I have ever gotten to an elephant was in a zoo. I love how the lighting created the glow around him.  The dust trail almost looks like lava...lol The tones are just right. Excellent stuff.</td>', 'Incredible capture!  These type of wildlife shots always amaze me.  The closest I have ever gotten to an elephant was in a zoo. I love how the lighting created the glow around him.  The dust trail almost looks like lava...lol The tones are just right. Excellent stuff.', '2006-05-20 18:32:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2629358, 177672, 52945, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic. The sky, pose and hoodie (I think he''s wearing a hoodie...) all just exude attitude.</td>', 'This is fantastic. The sky, pose and hoodie (I think he''s wearing a hoodie...) all just exude attitude.', '2006-07-17 10:42:53.000000', NULL, 0),
