(3910464, 178228, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful... I saw this one on your flickr website. I love this shade of blue, and the smoothness of the swirling fog creates such a beautiful, freezingly silent atmostphere. Glorious image.<br/> <br/>*edit*<br/>No, even after learning how you processed it, it''s still a glorious image. ;) I figure that as long as it turns out okay in photoshop, it doesn''t really matter how you got to it!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-18 19:59:31.</i></td>', 'This is so beautiful... I saw this one on your flickr website. I love this shade of blue, and the smoothness of the swirling fog creates such a beautiful, freezingly silent atmostphere. Glorious image. *edit*No, even after learning how you processed it, it''s still a glorious image. ;) I figure that as long as it turns out okay in photoshop, it doesn''t really matter how you got to it!', '2007-07-17 12:43:59.000000', '2007-07-18 20:59:31.000000', 0),
